hildren and the natives from down the street and across the gardens, until the sun cast the sky red-violet and we were avenged, or called in for dinner, battle-weary. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/01/garden/01DOMESTIC1/01DOMESTIC1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1022, 'width': 729, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/01/garden/01DOMESTIC1/01DOMESTIC1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/01/garden/01DOMESTIC1/01DOMESTIC1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Wonderland of Stage Toys', 'kicker': 'Domestic Lives', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Wonderland Of Stage Toys', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Children and Childhood', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'London (England)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-01T00:15:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Home', 'section_name': 'Home & Garden', 'byline': {'original': 'By Caroline H. Dworin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Caroline', 'middlename': 'H.', 'lastname': 'Dworin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/277e77c1-eb73-54f8-8760-6346402c28a1', 'word_count': 1415, 'uri': 'nyt://article/277e77c1-eb73-54f8-8760-6346402c28a1'}, {'abstract': 'Rebecca Schiffman makes sterling silver jewelry based on buildings in her neighborhood, the Upper East Side.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.