lectrical engineer was enrolled in a four-month “employability” class. In other words, he was trying to improve his command of English and become more confident and expressive.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Big Mismatch: Jobs and Skills', 'kicker': 'India Ink', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Labor and Jobs', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-01T07:31:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Vikas Bajaj', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Vikas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bajaj', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6c82b613-524d-5364-badc-6ec8ac2d7c82', 'word_count': 911, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6c82b613-524d-5364-badc-6ec8ac2d7c82'}, {'abstract': 'See what you know about the news of the day.', 'web_url': 'https://learning.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/01/news-quiz-dec-1-2011/', 'snippet': 'See what you know about the news of the day.', 'lead_paragraph': 'See what you know about the news below. To prepare, you might scan the articles or summaries on today’s paper.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'News Quiz | Dec. 1, 2011', 'kicker': 'The Learning Network', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-12-01T07:58:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Education', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kenan Christiansen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kenan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Christiansen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d872e00c-a014-573e-a5f9-68e80615d715', 'word_count': 20, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d872e00c-a014-573e-a5f9-68e80615d715'}, {'abstract': 'New restrictions in the aftermath of the storming of the British Embassy in Tehran fell short of demands by Britain and France for an oil embargo.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/02/world/middleeast/britain-closure-embassy-iran-expel-diplomats.html', 'snippet': 'New restrictions in the aftermath of the storming of the British Embassy in Tehran fell short of demands by Britain and France for an oil embargo.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Galvanized by the pillaging of Britain’s Embassy in Tehran, Western nations moved Thursday to significantly tighten sanctions against Iran over its suspect nuclear program, with the European Union expanding an Iranian blacklist and the United States Senate passing a measure that could severely disrupt Iran’s oil income. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/02/global-home/2iran-image/2iran-image-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 658, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/02/global-home/2iran-image/2iran-image-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/02/global-home/2iran-image/2iran-image-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'West Tightens Iran Sanctions After Embassy Attack', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'West Tightens Iran Sanctions After Embassy Attack', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'International Relations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Diplomatic Service,