tes was uncertain that humanitarian assistance for North Korea would reach people in need, an official said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SEOUL, South Korea — The United States needs more time to decide on possible aid for North Korea because it is not sure humanitarian assistance would reach the people in need, the top American aid official said on Thursday.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Official Says U.S. Needs Time to Assess Aid to North Korea', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'North Korea: U.S. Aid Delayed Over Misappropriation Concerns', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'North Korea', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Food Aid', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Famine', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Humanitarian Aid', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-01T11:36:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Choe Sang-Hun', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Choe', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sang-Hun', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/cb5b692d-6a86-57dd-af83-5d5a0b877aca', 'word_count': 529, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cb5b692d-6a86-57dd-af83-5d5a0b877aca'}, {'abstract': 'How to describe the food at Yotam Ottolenghi’s London restaurants? It’s complicated.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/04/magazine/Ottolenghi-Rice-With-Poached-Eggs.html', 'snippet': 'How to describe the food at Yotam Ottolenghi’s London restaurants? It’s complicated.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Time: 1 to 1 1/4 hours', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '56', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo