up-your-home-for-the-holidays/', 'snippet': 'D.I.Y. tips on sprucing up your home for the holidays, the humble thermostat gets a makeover, twelve things you didn’t know about Facebook and other consumer-focused news from The New York Times.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A variety of consumer-focused articles appears daily in The New York Times and online in our blogs. Each weekday morning, we gather them together here so you can quickly scan the news that could hit you in your wallet.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Thursday Reading: D.I.Y. Tips to Spruce Up Your Home for the Holidays', 'kicker': 'Bucks', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-12-01T13:15:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Your Money', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ann Carrns', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ann', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Carrns', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ffd9f9e4-ddbd-5244-92d2-765f56f0a1c7', 'word_count': 124, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ffd9f9e4-ddbd-5244-92d2-765f56f0a1c7'}, {'abstract': 'Iraq’s top officials and Vice President Joseph R. Biden Jr. paid tribute to each other’s soldiers as they recognized the end of the Iraq war on Thursday.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/02/world/middleeast/in-iraq-biden-says-tide-of-conflict-is-receding.html', 'snippet': 'Iraq’s top officials and Vice President Joseph R. Biden Jr. paid tribute to each other’s soldiers as they recognized the end of the Iraq war on Thursday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CAMP VICTORY, Iraq — As the United States prepared to turn over this optimistically named military base to Iraq, leaders of both countries held a solemn commemoration here on Thursday of the sacrifices of American and Iraqi troops during eight years of war, marking 