': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1122d475-fa6f-51c1-abc5-8f3f162ae7c8', 'word_count': 35, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1122d475-fa6f-51c1-abc5-8f3f162ae7c8'}, {'abstract': 'The Cunningham company’s Repertory Understudy Group, known as the RUGs, ended performances at the Cunningham Studio.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/01/cunningham-countdown-saying-goodbye-to-the-rugs/', 'snippet': 'The Cunningham company’s Repertory Understudy Group, known as the RUGs, ended performances at the Cunningham Studio.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It’s no longer news that the Merce Cunningham Dance Company is due to shut up shop at the end of 2011. But another, attached troupe has already given its farewell. The Cunningham company’s Repertory Understudy Group ended with a season of six performances in the Cunningham studio over the last six days of November. Known as the RUGs, its four dancers were never quite a second company. The group, formalized in 1990, served as an apprentice program for the Cunningham company, with whose members its four dancers shared studios and took class.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Cunningham Countdown: Saying Goodbye to the RUGs', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dancing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Cunningham, Merce, Dance Co', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-01T18:44:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alastair Macaulay', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alastair', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Macaulay', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/76f9ecd9-737e-5a14-