 'BRIAN KELLY started planning his father’s work trips — and managing his travel awards — when he was still a kid. At 13, he had collected enough points to book a family vacation in the Cayman Islands. Now Mr. Kelly’s blog, thepointsguy.com, helps frustrated travelers who don’t know how to make the most of their awards. With so much gift-giving and family visiting, Mr. Kelly said, the holidays are the season for racking up travel points. Below are his five tips for giving — and getting.\xa0', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/04/travel/sub04QNA1/sub04QNA1-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 670, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/04/travel/sub04QNA1/sub04QNA1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/04/travel/sub04QNA1/sub04QNA1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'It’s the Season to Earn, and Spend, Points', 'kicker': 'Ask an Expert', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'It’s the Season To Earn, and Spend, Points', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kelly, Brian', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-01T20:20:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Travel', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rachel Lee Harris', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rachel', 'middlename': 'Lee', 'lastname': 'Harris', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Question', '_id': 'nyt://article/6c751