illion people.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The series premiere of “I Hate My Teenage Daughter” posted decent numbers for Fox on Wednesday, helping the network win the night in total viewership and in the 18-to-49-year-old demographic. Some 6.8 million viewers sampled the new sitcom while it held 75 percent of the 18-to-49 audience from its lead-in, “The X Factor.” ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Viewers Don’t Hate New Fox Sitcom', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'ABC INC', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'CBS Corporation', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Fox Broadcasting Co', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Broadcasting Co', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Rockefeller Center (NYC)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-01T21:33:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Adam W. Kepler', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Adam', 'middlename': 'W.', 'lastname': 'Kepler', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4fb7ee76-db12-5a5c-94a3-35688d099d4b', 'word_count': 116, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4fb7ee76-db12-5a5c-94a3-35688d099d4b'}, {'abstract': 'A critical guide to movies playing in New York.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/02/movies/movie-listings-for-dec-2-8.html', 'snippet': 'A critical guide to movies playing in New York.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Movies', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Movie Listings for Dec. 2-8', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker'