irlish uniforms and naïve dresses have curious appeal.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/01/winter-wonders-the-cool-class/', 'snippet': 'For some stylish women during the holidays, girlish uniforms and naïve dresses have curious appeal.', 'lead_paragraph': 'We all revert a little during the holidays — we go home, childhood memories surface, and the next thing we know girlish uniforms and naïve dresses have curious appeal. Here, Britain’s most popular sister-in-law, Pippa Middleton, takes to the skating rink in a coat with a modlike pouf skirt; the actress Sienna Miller gets gold stars for her prim A-line look; and Kate Moss sticks to the straight and narrow with a midthigh peacoat and high leather boots.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Winter Wonders | The Cool Class', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Models (Professional)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Middleton, Pippa', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Miller, Sienna', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Moss, Kate', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Great Britain', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-01T21:37:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Edward Barsamian', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Edward', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Barsamian', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b7857667-4e46-5513-a877-b2fc68564378', 'word_count': 78, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b7857667-4e46-5513-a877-b2fc68564378'}, {'abstract': 'Not everyone can be a calligrapher when it comes to making out party invitations.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/04/fashion/a-husbands-thoughts-and-actions-count-social-qs.html', 'snippet': 'Not everyone can be a calligrapher when it comes to making out party invitations.', 'lead_paragraph': 'My husband wants to throw a holiday party this year and promised to do all the work himself. He created the guest list, mostly from our neighborhood, and bought invitations that required him to fill in names and dates. The trouble is, he has the worst handwriting imaginable. He doesn’t know some of our neighbors’ last names (or the correct spelling of many of their first names). Still, he got them out. Am I wrong to be bothered by his invitation etiquette? C. Z., San Francisco', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/28/fashion/social_inline/social_inline-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 599, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/28/fashion/social_inline/social_inline-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 599}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/28/fashion/social_inline/social_inline-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 923, 'width': 925, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/28/fashion/social_inline/social_inline-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 923, 'width': 925, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/28/fashion/social_inline/social_inline-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/28/fashion/social_inline/social_inline-thumbStandard