k in vogue, real estate agents say.', 'lead_paragraph': 'THE sprawling 19th-century greenhouse owned by Dr. Alvin Friedman-Kien in Garrison is more than just a place to start tomatoes in advance of spring. With its wicker and wrought-iron furniture, a dining table that seats 12 and a fireplace, the 55-foot-long greenhouse is also an inviting backdrop for entertaining friends.', 'print_section': 'RE', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/04/realestate/04WEZONE1_SPAN/04WEZONE1_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/12/04/realestate/04WEZONE1_SPAN/04WEZONE1_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/04/realestate/04WEZONE1_SPAN/we-zone-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/04/realestate/04WEZONE1_SPAN/04WEZONE1_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/04/realestate/04WEZONE1_SPAN/04WEZONE1_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Some Like It Hothouse', 'kicker': 'In the Region | Westchester', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Some Like It Hothouse', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Westchester County (NY)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Real Estate and Housing (Residential)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gardens and Gardening', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-1