th plan may be a model for the future.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Big institutions are often slow to awaken to major social transformations. Microsoft was famously late to grasp the importance of the Internet. American auto manufacturers were slow to identify the demand for fuel-efficient cars. And today, the United States government is making a similar mistake: it still doesn’t seem to recognize that Americans no longer work the way they used to.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Health Care for a Changing Work Force', 'kicker': 'Fixes', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Freelancing, Self-Employment and Independent Contracting', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Health Insurance and Managed Care', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Labor and Jobs', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-02T02:15:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Bornstein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bornstein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f31a9df3-b126-52e4-8500-5f34d36ecd2d', 'word_count': 1881, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f31a9df3-b126-52e4-8500-5f34d36ecd2d'}, {'abstract': 'The university’s decision not to contact law enforcement during its initial investigation in 2005 has drawn criticism from experts who handle sexual abuse cases.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/02/sports/ncaabasketball/syracuse-criticized-for-its-handling-of-sexual-abuse-case.html', 'snippet': 'The university’s decision not to contact law enforcement during its initial investigation in 2005 has drawn criticism from experts who handle sexual abuse cases.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When Bobby Davis