ca4-1638-5474-b11e-e40eed4c601c', 'word_count': 970, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2ed00ca4-1638-5474-b11e-e40eed4c601c'}, {'abstract': 'Herman Cain’s recent troubles say a lot about the craving for genuine outsiders in politics — and why they so rarely succeed.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/02/us/politics/the-tantalizing-lure-of-the-outsider-candidate.html', 'snippet': 'Herman Cain’s recent troubles say a lot about the craving for genuine outsiders in politics — and why they so rarely succeed.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In what may yet be the last turn in Herman Cain’s bizarre journey through the world of presidential politics, the candidate will return home to Atlanta this weekend for a meeting with his wife and family, so they can decide whether it still makes sense for Mr. Cain to continue his campaign.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/02/us/BAI-1/BAI-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 687, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/02/us/BAI-1/BAI-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/02/us/BAI-1/BAI-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Tantalizing Lure of the Outsider Candidate', 'kicker': 'Political Times', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Tantalizing Lure of the Outsider Candidate', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cain, Herman', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date'