 beauty regimen at a photo shoot for Mark Cosmetics.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/02/face-time-ashley-greene/', 'snippet': 'Ashley Greene discusses her beauty regimen at a photo shoot for Mark Cosmetics.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I recently chatted with Ashley Greene at a photo shoot for Mark Cosmetics. (She’s worked with the brand since 2010.) The fourth installment in the “Twilight” series, “Breaking Dawn – Part 1,” just opened, and her next two movies are wrapped and ready to go. Fans, take note: she appears this Sunday on the TV show “Pan Am.” Greene was warm and easy to talk to, and we were able to touch on many topics in a short amount of time.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Face Time | Ashley Greene', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-12-02T18:54:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tina Turnbow', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tina', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Turnbow', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c25b7240-79d3-5715-b419-f210ac9a6744', 'word_count': 721, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c25b7240-79d3-5715-b419-f210ac9a6744'}, {'abstract': 'The Republican presidential candidate he launches a new Web page, Women for Cain.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/02/wifes-word-to-decide-cain-campaigns-fate/', 'snippet': 'The Republican presidential candidate he launches a new Web page, Women for Cain.', 'lead_paragraph': 'What will Gloria say?', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Wife’s Word to Decide Cain Campaign’s Fate', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'