 includes, once again, our selection of 100 Notable Books, including a wide range of biographies — many about 20th-century giants.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/04/books/review/up-front.html', 'snippet': 'This year’s Holiday Books issue includes, once again, our selection of 100 Notable Books, including a wide range of biographies — many about 20th-century giants.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This year’s Holiday Books issue includes, once again, our selection of 100 Notable Books, drawn from all those reviewed in our pages since last year’s big winter issue. The nonfiction choices feature a wide range of biographies — many of them of 20th-century giants like Clarence Darrow, Mahatma Gandhi, Pauline Kael, George F. Kennan, Malcolm X and Kurt Vonnegut, \xadnot to mention the ageless Rin Tin Tin.', 'print_section': 'BR', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/04/books/review/upfront/upfront-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 724, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/04/books/review/upfront/upfront-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/04/books/review/upfront/upfront-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Up Front', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Up Front', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-02T19:45:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'BookReview', 'section_name': 'Books', 'subsection_name': 'Book Review', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editors', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editors'},