 on a recent trip, the car achieved 50 m.p.g.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/04/automobiles/a-diesel-for-the-long-haul.html', 'snippet': 'VW says the turbodiesel Passat can cover 795 highway miles on a single tank, based on its 31 m.p.g. city, 43 highway rating. But on a recent trip, the car achieved 50 m.p.g.', 'lead_paragraph': 'FIFTY miles per gallon may not be a big deal for a tiny hybrid. But it seems like a minor miracle in a big, road-tripping sedan.', 'print_section': 'AU', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Diesel for the Long Haul', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Diesel for the Long Haul', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fuel Efficiency', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Audi Division of Volkswagen AG', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Volkswagen A.G', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-02T20:24:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Automobiles', 'section_name': 'Automobiles', 'byline': {'original': 'By Lawrence Ulrich', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Lawrence', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ulrich', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e76a5f2e-7653-5855-a90a-a61abc16465b', 'word_count': 573, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e76a5f2e-7653-5855-a90a-a61abc16465b'}, {'abstract': 'Volkswagen wants to become the world’s top automaker, and it hopes to achieve that goal with the help of the new, less expensive Passat. The base version is a remarkable $7,100 cheaper than the last model.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/04/automobiles/autoreviews/2012-volkswagen-passat-achtung-kmart-shoppers.html', 'snippet': 'Volkswagen wants to become 