, 'snippet': 'The singing competition narrows the field to five.', 'lead_paragraph': 'With CBS in repeats Fox was the No. 1 broadcast network on Thursday night in total audience and in the 18-to-49-year-old demographic, the age group most coveted by advertisers.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '‘X Factor’ Lifts Fox Past CBS', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'CBS Corporation', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-02T21:07:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Adam W. Kepler', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Adam', 'middlename': 'W.', 'lastname': 'Kepler', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ee068c43-382e-56d3-b670-906b78f1a645', 'word_count': 98, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ee068c43-382e-56d3-b670-906b78f1a645'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Sues, whose acting career began onstage with dramatic roles, played over-the-top characters like Uncle Al the Kiddies’ Pal on the 1960s hit variety-comedy show.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/03/arts/television/alan-sues-a-laugh-in-cast-mainstay-dies-at-85.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Sues, whose acting career began onstage with dramatic roles, played over-the-top characters like Uncle Al the Kiddies’ Pal on the 1960s hit variety-comedy show.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Alan Sues, an actor whose loud, clownish comedic style made him an invaluable cast member on “Rowan & Martin’s Laugh-In,” one of the top-rated shows on television in the late 1960s, died on Thursday at his home in Los Angeles.\xa0He was 85.\xa0 ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype