c93-8dfc-c138ddda7644'}, {'abstract': 'Agnieszka Holland’s film “In Darkness” will rise or fall on how convincing Robert Wieckiewicz is as a somewhat anti-Semitic sewer worker who helped save Jews from the Nazis.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/04/movies/agnieszka-hollands-holocaust-feature-in-darkness.html', 'snippet': 'Agnieszka Holland’s film “In Darkness” will rise or fall on how convincing Robert Wieckiewicz is as a somewhat anti-Semitic sewer worker who helped save Jews from the Nazis.', 'lead_paragraph': 'AT first the Polish film director Agnieszka Holland wanted nothing to do with the script that became “In Darkness,” a new drama based on the true story of Jews in Poland who escaped the Nazis by hiding in sewers. She had already made two films about the Holocaust, “Angry Harvest” in 1985 and “Europa Europa” in 1990, both of which were nominated for Academy Awards, and she had no desire to revisit that wrenching subject.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/04/arts/04DARKNESS2_SPAN/04DARKNESS2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/12/04/arts/04DARKNESS2_SPAN/04DARKNESS2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/04/arts/04DARKNESS2_SPAN/04DARKNESS2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/04/arts/04DARKNESS2_SPAN/04DARKNESS2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/04/arts/04DARKNESS2_SPAN/04DARKNESS2-thumbStand