-norton-on-bbc-america-review.html', 'snippet': 'Graham Norton hosts “Would You Rather ...? With Graham Norton,” an ersatz game show in which celebrities compete for nothing by improvising off of set-up lines.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Some shows this season have tried to entertain with pricey special effects (“Terra Nova”) or drawer-dropping stars (“Two and a Half Men”). But “Would You Rather ...? With Graham Norton” on BBC America proves that a fair amount of fun can be generated simply by putting people in chairs and letting them crack wise. All you have to do is ask them the right questions. Ridiculously incongruous questions.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/03/arts/RATHER/RATHER-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/12/03/arts/RATHER/RATHER-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/03/arts/RATHER/RATHER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 666, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/03/arts/RATHER/RATHER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/03/arts/RATHER/RATHER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'On This Game Show, There Is No Right Answer', 'kicker': 'Television Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'On This Game Show, There Is No Right Answer', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'BBC America', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'va