ri': 'nyt://article/70ecd8de-5736-5735-80ef-63f1b6522423'}, {'abstract': 'As thousands of Egyptians rallied in Cairo’s Tahrir Square on Friday, some members of the crowd wore bandages over one eye to draw attention to the fact that dozens of protesters sustained serious eye injuries last week, after being hit in the face with pellets or rubber bullets.', 'web_url': 'https://thelede.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/02/egyptians-want-justice-for-protesters-shot-in-the-eyes/', 'snippet': 'As thousands of Egyptians rallied in Cairo’s Tahrir Square on Friday, some members of the crowd wore bandages over one eye to draw attention to the fact that dozens of protesters sustained serious eye injuries last week, after being hit in the fac...', 'lead_paragraph': 'As thousands of Egyptians rallied in Cairo’s Tahrir Square on Friday, some members of the crowd wore bandages over one eye. The demonstration was part of an ongoing campaign to draw attention to the dozens of protesters who sustained serious eye injuries last week, after being hit in the face with pellets or rubber bullets fired by police officers.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Egyptians Want Justice for Protesters Shot in the Eyes', 'kicker': 'The Lede', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Demonstrations, Protests, and Riots', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Middle East and North Africa Unrest (2010- )', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Police', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Egypt', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Tahrir Square (Cairo)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-02T23:29:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Robert Mackey', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Robert', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mackey