, Joan Juliet', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Day, Charlie', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Farmiga, Taissa', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Heller, Zoe', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mortensen, Viggo', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Self, Will', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Thompson, Richard', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-03T00:00:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By T Magazine', 'person': [{'firstname': '', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/31ba7d83-a8c1-554d-b938-b143f01c3427', 'word_count': 124, 'uri': 'nyt://article/31ba7d83-a8c1-554d-b938-b143f01c3427'}, {'abstract': 'Former Senator Timothy E. Wirth argues against potential American withdrawals from United Nations agencies besides Unesco.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/03/opinion/the-us-the-palestinians-and-un-agencies.html', 'snippet': 'Former Senator Timothy E. Wirth argues against potential American withdrawals from United Nations agencies besides Unesco.', 'lead_paragraph': 'To the Editor:', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The U.S., the Palestinians and U.N. Agencies', 'kicker': 'Letter', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The U.S., the Palestinians and U.N. Agencies', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United Nations Educational, Scientific and Cultural Organization', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Palestinians', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'va