n named Gregory Ross in Bedford-Stuyvesant, a case that had gone unsolved for more than two decades, was the result of the ruthless logic of the drug trade.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/03/nyregion/he-brought-him-a-head-but-not-the-right-one.html', 'snippet': 'The beheading of a man named Gregory Ross in Bedford-Stuyvesant, a case that had gone unsolved for more than two decades, was the result of the ruthless logic of the drug trade.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Children get the first look at much of this city in the morning, and a group of them found the body, wedged between a loading dock and a trash bin behind their elementary school in Brooklyn. A garbage bag covered the top of a dead man, and today, 24 years later, there is blessed little reason to believe those children looked underneath. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/03/nyregion/CRIMESCENE1/CRIMESCENE1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 701, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/03/nyregion/CRIMESCENE1/CRIMESCENE1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/03/nyregion/CRIMESCENE1/CRIMESCENE1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'He Brought Him a Head, but Not the Right One', 'kicker': 'Crime Scene', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'He Brought Him a Head, but Not the Right One', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Bedford-Stuyvesant (NYC)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders and Attempted Murders', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Police Departm