patient, “but your life will change tremendously.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/03/nyregion/multiple-sclerosis-recurs-but-doesnt-dim-a-desire-to-inspire.html', 'snippet': 'The doctor’s diagnosis was multiple sclerosis. It was not fatal, he told the patient, “but your life will change tremendously.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Wonder Pearson knew something was wrong when her typing speed began to drop. She had averaged 95 words a minute while working as an administrative assistant at the Internal Revenue Service in Atlanta. But in fall 1995, not only did she get drastically slower, but she also found it hard to remember what others said in meetings while she took notes, and she struggled to keep her balance. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/03/nyregion/03NEEDIEST/03NEEDIEST-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/12/03/nyregion/03NEEDIEST/03NEEDIEST-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/03/nyregion/03NEEDIEST/03NEEDIEST-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/03/nyregion/03NEEDIEST/03NEEDIEST-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/03/nyregion/03NEEDIEST/03NEEDIEST-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Woman’s Illness Recurs, but She Still Tries to Inspire Others', 'kicker': 'The Neediest Cases', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Woman’s Illness Recur