ary personnel due to terrorism are down more than 50 percent this year from the year before, according to a state home ministry report.\xa0 The report said 158 people, including 99 whom it characterized as terrorists, had been killed as of Nov. 15 this year, while 323 people were reported killed in the previous year (Kashmir Live).', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Newswallah: Bharat Edition', 'kicker': 'India Ink', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shopping and Retail', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Chandy, Oommen', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Google Inc', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'India', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-03T10:16:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5bc06fb1-ab9e-50c5-bf88-6c7f99c52b86', 'word_count': 409, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5bc06fb1-ab9e-50c5-bf88-6c7f99c52b86'}, {'abstract': 'Political news from today’s Times and around the Web, plus a look at the president’s weekly address.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/03/the-weekend-word-rifts/', 'snippet': 'Political news from today’s Times and around the Web, plus a look at the president’s weekly address.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Today’s Times', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Weekend Word: Rifts', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-12-03T11:00:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original'