s and titles throughout their contracts, like Randy Johnson and Greg Maddux. But typically, the quick-fix free agent becomes a bloated reminder of a broken dream.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/04/sports/baseball/in-free-agent-shopping-temptation-and-remorse.html', 'snippet': 'Some free agents pile up awards and titles throughout their contracts, like Randy Johnson and Greg Maddux. But typically, the quick-fix free agent becomes a bloated reminder of a broken dream.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Imagine, for a moment, that the principal figures of the baseball winter meetings were cartoon characters. Team executives would be gullible rubes with straw hats, overalls and sacks full of money. Agents would be silver-tongued hucksters in fedoras and sharp suits, smoothly peddling their shiny free agents.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/04/sports/dog-kepner-2/dog-kepner-2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 811, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/04/sports/dog-kepner-2/dog-kepner-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/04/sports/dog-kepner-2/dog-kepner-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'In Free-Agent Shopping, Temptation and Remorse', 'kicker': 'On Baseball', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In Free-Agent Shopping, Temptation and Remorse', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Free Agents (Sports)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pujols, Albert', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fielder, Prince', 'rank': 3, 'major':