stock-could-yield-fortunes/', 'snippet': 'Financial firms are preparing to dole out huge amounts of stock at depressed prices, the value of which could rise substantially in a few years.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Buffeted by lackluster profits and turmoil in the global markets, Wall Street is bracing for one of the worst bonus seasons in recent memory. But in the alchemy of high finance, bankers are hoping to turn the slump to their advantage.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Modest Bonus Year on Wall St., but Stock Could Yield Fortunes', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Banking and Financial Institutions', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bonuses', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Stocks and Bonds', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-03T23:21:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Susanne Craig', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Susanne', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Craig', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/edc286b7-bd72-5c07-bb83-a44a495b7a1d', 'word_count': 890, 'uri': 'nyt://article/edc286b7-bd72-5c07-bb83-a44a495b7a1d'}, {'abstract': 'In down-ballot races in Texas, simply being the Republican candidate is a huge boost. In Republican primaries, however, a name alone may matter, and some see bias against Hispanics in that.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/04/us/when-r-on-the-texas-ballot-may-not-be-enough.html', 'snippet': 'In down-ballot races in Texas, simply being the Republican candidate is a huge boost. In Republican primaries, however, a name alone may matter, and some see bias against Hispanics in that.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ross Ramsey, the executive editor of The Texas Tribune, writes a column for The Tribune.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '37A', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'When ‘R’ on the Ballot May Not Be Enough', 'kicker': 'The Texas Tribune', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'When ‘R’ on the Ballot May Not Be Enough', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Texas', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hispanic-Americans', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Primaries and Caucuses', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-03T23:25:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ross Ramsey', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ross', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ramsey', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b9ecbd6d-4fd1-590c-86c7-b37285fa14a7', 'word_count': 750, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b9ecbd6d-4fd1-590c-86c7-b37285fa14a7'}, {'abstract': 'Music lovers from independent record stores across the state make holiday gift suggestions: recently released albums by a variety of up-and-coming local artists.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/04/us/from-indie-record-stores-holiday-gift-thoughts.html', 'snippet': 'Music lovers from independent record stores across the state make holiday gift suggestions: recently released albums by a variety of up-and-coming local artists.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Last month, more than 60 independent record stores across Texas kicked off the holiday shopping season with a Black Friday edition of Record Store Day, an annual promotion that features special vinyl and CD releases made exclusively for mom-and-pop record stores. It is intended to bring shoppers back to independent record stores, which offer human interaction between customers and clerks that often results in the discovery of a new favorite album. Better still, what makes small record stores different is their emphasis on selling locally produced music.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '37B', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/04/us/4TTCULTURE1/4TTCULTURE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 370, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/12/04/us/4TTCULTURE1/4TTCULTURE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 370}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/04/us/4TTCULTURE1/4TTCULTURE1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 656, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/04/us/4TTCULTURE1/4TTCULTURE1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/04/us/4TTCULTURE1/4TTCULTURE1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'From Indie Record Stores, Holiday Gift Thoughts', 'kicker': 'Texas Monthly', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'From Indie Record Stores, Holiday Gift Thoughts', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shopping and Retail', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gifts', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Holidays and Special Occasions', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Texas', 'rank': 5, 'major': 