02FRESH account emerged last week about the magnitude of financial aid that the Federal Reserve bestowed on big banks during the 2008-09 credit crisis. The report came from Bloomberg News, which had to mount a lengthy legal fight to wrest documents from the Fed that detailed its rescue efforts.', 'print_section': 'BU', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/04/business/04-GRET-JP/04-GRET-JP-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 370, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/12/04/business/04-GRET-JP/04-GRET-JP-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 370}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/04/business/04-GRET-JP/04-GRET-JP-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 642, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Secrets of the Bailout, Now Told', 'kicker': 'Fair Game', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Secrets Of the Bailout, Now Told', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Credit and Debt', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Securities and Exchange Commission', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Federal Reserve System', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Morgan Stanley', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Citigroup Inc', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Economy', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Turner, Lynn E', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Banking and Financial Institutions', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-04T00:50:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'NAT', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Gretchen Morgenson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Gretchen', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Morgenson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3e22112d-58f8-5c45-a040-a11d6dfaea2c', 'word_count': 1049, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3e22112d-58f8-5c45-a040-a11d6dfaea2c'}, {'abstract': 'Ms. Haas Pfister served as a member of the Women Airforce Service Pilots, or WASPs, in World War II, and her passion for flight never faded.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/04/us/betty-haas-pfister-dies-at-90-wartime-pilot-with-passion-for-flight.html', 'snippet': 'Ms. Haas Pfister served as a member of the Women Airforce Service Pilots, or WASPs, in World War II, and her passion for flight never faded.', 'lead_paragraph': '“No, no, you can’t go up!” Betty Haas’s father insisted that day in 1940 when the family went to an air show in Bennington, Vt. But when her parents left, Ms. Haas, then 19, sneaked back to the airfield, paid a dollar and, as she liked to say, “squished into a seat” for a ride on a tiny plane. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '36', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/05/sports/03haas/03haas-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 808, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/05/sports/03haas/03haas-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/05/sports/03haas/03haas-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Betty Haas Pfister, a Woman With Wings, Dies at 90', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Betty Haas Pfister, 90, A Woman With Wings', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'WASP', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Women and Girls', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'World War II (1939-45)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'AIRLINES AND AIRPLANES', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pilots', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-04T01:05:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dennis Hevesi', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dennis', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hevesi', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/47a3ae4c-d8fa-5426-85a3-a553e394786a', 'word_count': 651, 'uri': 'nyt://article/47a3ae4c-d8fa-5426-85a3-a553e394786a'}, {'abstract': 'Jim Rutenberg reports from New Hampshire, where the biggest political advertiser in the state is a Super PAC funded partly by Jon M. Huntsman Jr.’s billionaire father.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/us/politics/100000001205505/on-the-trail-with-jon-huntsman.html', 'snippet': 'Jim Rutenberg reports from New Hampshire, where the biggest political advertiser in the state is a Super PAC funded partly by Jon M. Huntsman Jr.’s billionaire father.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Jim Rutenberg reports from New Hampshire, where the biggest political advertiser in the state is a Super PAC funded partly by Jon M. Huntsman Jr.’s billionaire father.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/02/us/politics/video-huntsman/video-huntsman-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'artic