//article/38017c72-c74b-5436-bfbf-ea3e42310156', 'word_count': 785, 'uri': 'nyt://article/38017c72-c74b-5436-bfbf-ea3e42310156'}, {'abstract': 'The singing competition TV show “The X Factor” has about half the viewers of “American Idol,” but it has lifted Fox’s ratings and it appeals to a comparatively younger audience.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/05/business/media/its-not-american-idol-but-the-x-factor-has-its-audience.html', 'snippet': 'The singing competition TV show “The X Factor” has about half the viewers of “American Idol,” but it has lifted Fox’s ratings and it appeals to a comparatively younger audience.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Shelby Worthington and Kelly Le are both 18 and are both Fox viewers. But they have very different feelings about the network’s two biggest reality shows, the nearly 10-year-old hit “American Idol” and the brand-new hit “The X Factor.” ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/05/business/05XFACTOR/05XFACTOR-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 934, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/05/business/05XFACTOR/05XFACTOR-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/05/business/05XFACTOR/05XFACTOR-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': '‘The X Factor’ Connects With Its Audience', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '‘The X Factor’ Connects With Its Audience', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cowell, Simon', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Reality Television', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'va