 a BBC special called “Jane Austen: The Unseen Portrait?”', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/05/author-says-shes-found-a-portrait-of-jane-austen/', 'snippet': 'Jane Austen and a newly discovered illustration possibly depicting the author of “Pride and Prejudice” and “Sense and Sensibility” will be the subject of a BBC special called “Jane Austen: The Unseen Portrait?”', 'lead_paragraph': 'For as few novels as Jane Austen published in a literary career that has long outlasted her brief 41 years, even fewer portraits of her are believed to have survived. Only two are officially recognized as representations of Austen, including a watercolor sketch by her sister, Cassandra, and neither looks particularly like Anne Hathaway. (But really, who does?)', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Author Says She’s Found a Portrait of Jane Austen', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Writing and Writers', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Austen, Jane', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bate, Jonathan', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Byrne, Paula', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'British Broadcasting Corp', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-05T15:56:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dave Itzkoff', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dave', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Itzkoff', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/07ceeded-16e9-5ee8-9d01-11db8ba2ba2b', 'word_count': 247, 'uri': 'nyt://article/07ceeded-16e9-5ee8-9d01-11db8ba2ba2b'}, {'abs