one}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/08590079-13f4-5be0-bf54-84c23c0f86ea', 'word_count': 53, 'uri': 'nyt://article/08590079-13f4-5be0-bf54-84c23c0f86ea'}, {'abstract': 'Homemade edible gifts like flavored oils, marinated things and mixes for baked goods are sure to please — and they’ll keep you out of the shopping mall.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/05/health/nutrition/gifts-to-savor-bite-by-bite-recipes-for-health.html', 'snippet': 'Homemade edible gifts like flavored oils, marinated things and mixes for baked goods are sure to please — and they’ll keep you out of the shopping mall.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This year I’m giving edible Christmas gifts, and I’ve already begun to make them. I’m focusing on flavored oils and marinated things right now, as they’ll benefit from a few weeks of steeping.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/06/science/05recipehealth/05recipehealth-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/12/06/science/05recipehealth/05recipehealth-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/06/science/05recipehealth/05recipehealth-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/06/science/05recipehealth/05recipehealth-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1333, 'width': 2000, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/06/science/05recipehealth/05recipehealth-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subT