nited States Supreme Court declined Monday to hear a Bronx church’s appeal of a city ban on holding worship services in public schools. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Supreme Court Won’t Hear Case on Churches’ Use of Schools', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-12-05T18:00:58+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Meredith Hoffman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Meredith', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hoffman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0b8d7532-6ec6-5642-be1a-bf68107c3f02', 'word_count': 332, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0b8d7532-6ec6-5642-be1a-bf68107c3f02'}, {'abstract': 'The mayor reacted cautiously but skeptically to reports that the governor was considering raising taxes on the wealthy to help close a budget gap.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/05/bloomberg-wary-of-reports-on-cuomos-tax-agenda/', 'snippet': 'The mayor reacted cautiously but skeptically to reports that the governor was considering raising taxes on the wealthy to help close a budget gap.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Mayor Michael R. Bloomberg reacted cautiously but skeptically Monday to reports that Gov. Andrew M. Cuomo was considering raising taxes on the wealthy to help close a looming budget gap.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Bloomberg Wary of Reports on Cuomo’s Tax Agenda', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Budgets and Budgeting', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Politics and Government', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Taxatio