s first hit with the Mets hinted at his incredible promise. His last hit with the Mets hinted at something else entirely.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Jose Reyes began his Mets career with a single, batting ninth and leading off the third inning in an interleague game against the Texas Rangers on June 10, 2003. Eight years later, Reyes said goodbye with a single, too, beating out a bunt against the Cincinnati Reds in the first inning of the final game of the season, on Sept. 28, 2011.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Bookends of Reyes’s Mets Career', 'kicker': 'Bats', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Reyes, Jose', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Mets', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-05T18:20:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jay Schreiber', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jay', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schreiber', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c1103db9-fdca-5944-85a2-507c63380629', 'word_count': 286, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c1103db9-fdca-5944-85a2-507c63380629'}, {'abstract': 'Western monitors criticize Russian elections; France and Germany push for fiscal discipline; and presidential parodies on Saturday Night Live.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/multimedia/100000001207969/timescast--december-5-2011.html', 'snippet': 'Western monitors criticize Russian elections; France and Germany push for fiscal discipline; and presidential parodies on Saturday Night Live.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Western monitors criticize Russian elections; France and Germany push for fiscal discipline;