rticle/83170aa2-54fe-5cd2-9362-b7964d2f4888'}, {'abstract': 'A new Saudi report claims issuing licenses to women will lead to an increase in prostitution, pornography and divorce.', 'web_url': 'https://takingnote.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/05/beware-of-female-drivers/', 'snippet': 'A new Saudi report claims issuing licenses to women will lead to an increase in prostitution, pornography and divorce.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Many ridiculous reasons have been given over the years for Saudi Arabia’s de facto ban on women drivers (de facto because there is no formal law, but women cannot obtain licenses). If women drive, it’s been said, they will lose their modesty and overcrowd the streets. In a sad Thelma and Louise meet Ishtar moment, it is also said that women who drive will find it easier to rebel against their husbands.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Beware of Female Drivers', 'kicker': 'Taking Note', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Women and Girls', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Skull and Bones', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Saudi Arabia', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-05T20:01:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Rosenthal', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rosenthal', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ca4e5cfe-0a60-5043-b38b-de0e8f10d4cf', 'word_count': 376, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ca4e5cfe-0a60-5043-b38b-de0e8f10d4cf'}, {'abstract': 'Election monitors and everyday Russians document blatant fraud in the weekend’s parliamentary vote.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/world/europe/100000001208218/timescas