e United States Supreme Court decided not to review a lower court’s ruling against a Bronx evangelical church that is fighting for access to public school space for services.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/06/nyregion/in-failure-of-legal-bid-churches-set-to-lose-public-school-space.html', 'snippet': 'The United States Supreme Court decided not to review a lower court’s ruling against a Bronx evangelical church that is fighting for access to public school space for services.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A small Bronx evangelical church on Monday lost the final round of its 16-year legal battle to force New York City to permit religious worship services in public schools, setting the stage for the city to eject dozens of churches and religious organizations that have been using schools for prayer.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/06/nyregion/CHURCHES/CHURCHES-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Churches to Lose Use of School Space After a Legal Push Fails', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Churches to Lose Use of School Space After a Legal Push Fails', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Education Department (NYC)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Prayers and Prayer Books', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Bronx (NYC)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Religion-State Relations', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Supreme Court', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Decisions and Verdicts', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Eva