orld/middleeast/large-scale-killings-reported-in-restive-syria-city.html', 'snippet': 'Dozens of bodies were found in Homs, in the worst carnage between the Sunni Muslim majority and the Alawite minority since the unrest in Syria began.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BEIRUT, Lebanon — In one of the worst episodes of sectarian carnage in Syria since the uprising began nine months ago, dozens of corpses were recovered from the streets of Homs this week, some of them dismembered, decapitated and bearing signs of torture, activists and residents said Tuesday.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Sharp Spate of Killings Traumatizes a Syrian City', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Sharp Spate Of Killings Traumatizes A Syrian City', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Syria', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Homs (Syria)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Middle East and North Africa Unrest (2010- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-06T16:43:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Anthony Shadid', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Anthony', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Shadid', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ee3672de-7b96-5c28-a39d-ed79866463b4', 'word_count': 1070, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ee3672de-7b96-5c28-a39d-ed79866463b4'}, {'abstract': 'After their mast came crashing down, forcing them to a remote island, the Puma team members are hoping to start the second leg of the Volvo Ocean Race, from Cape Town to Abu Dhabi, on Sunday.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/07/sports/for-puma-team-first-leg-of-volvo-ocean-race-is-an-adventure.html', 'snippet': 'After their mast came crashing down, forcing them to a remote island, the Puma team members are hoping to start the second leg of the Volvo Ocean Race, from Cape Town to Abu Dhabi, on Sunday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The last place the professional sailor Ryan Godfrey expected to be this week was hiking around a remote volcanic island in the South Atlantic in long underwear and a T-shirt. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/07/sports/07sailing-pic/07sailing-pic-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 375, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/12/07/sports/07sailing-pic/07sailing-pic-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 375}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/07/sports/07sailing-pic/07sailing-pic-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/07/sports/07sailing-pic/07sailing-pic-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/07/sports/07sailing-pic/07sailing-pic-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'First Leg of Ocean Race Is an Adventure', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'First Leg of Ocean Race Is an Adventure', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sailboats and Sailing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Volvo Ocean Race', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-06T16:47:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Chris Museler', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Chris', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Museler', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/138defba-5c6d-51d3-a488-99fe65b0185c', 'word_count': 1131, 'uri': 'nyt://article/138defba-5c6d-51d3-a488-99fe65b0185c'}, {'abstract': 'Prosecutors in the case against Councilman Larry B. Seabrook are concerned that jurors could be swayed by comments made by Mr. Seabrook’s lawyers outside court.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/06/as-seabrook-awaits-verdict-his-lawyers-are-cautioned-by-judge/', 'snippet': 'Prosecutors in the case against Councilman Larry B. Seabrook are concerned that jurors could be swayed by comments made by Mr. Seabrook’s lawyers outside court.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Prosecutors in the federal corruption trial of City Councilman Larry B. Seabrook have accused defense lawyers in the case of making comments outside of court that could influence the jury’s deliberations.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'As Seabrook Awaits Verdict, His Lawyers Are Cautioned by Judge', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Decisions and Verdicts', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Patterson, Robert P Jr', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Seabrook, Larry B', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-06T16:52:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Benjamin Weiser', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Benjamin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Weiser', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b2b5ded5-7a93-5336-a61d-53e0b07f2a6a', 'word_count': 399, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b2b5ded5-7a93-5336-a61d-53e0b07f2a6a'}, {'abstract': 'Why Latinos aren’t likely to put Newt Gingrich in the White House.', 'web_url': 'https://douthat.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/06/myths-of-the-hispanic-vote/', 'snippet': 'Why Latinos aren’t likely to put Newt Gingrich in the White House.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Not every liberal is publicly chortling over the prospect of facing Newt Gingrich in the general election. According to the Washington Post, some Democratic strategists fear Gingrich’s ability to … win Hispanic voters:', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Myths of the Hispanic Vote', 'kicker': 'Ross Douthat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-12-06T16:52:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ross Douthat', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ross', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Douthat', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b6020a57-c4a5-5002-b056-33d5a8075e54', 'word_count': 696, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b6020a57-c4a5-5002-b056-33d5a8075e54'}, {'abstract': 'The company, known for its sparkling handbags, has created pillboxes in 14 flavorful colors.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/08/fashion/judith-leiber-macaron-pillboxes-browsing.html', 'snippet': 'The company, known for its sparkling handbags, has created pillboxes in 14 flavorful colors.', 'lead_paragraph': 'THOSE delectable pastel macarons from Ladurée, the French patisserie open in New York since late summer, with lines still up the block, have been given the Judith Leiber treatment. That is, the Leiber company, known for its sparkling evening bags, has modeled a collection of crystal pillboxes after the iconic confection. The inspired idea came about after Jana Matheson, the creative director of Judith Leiber, returned from a trip to Paris with macarons for her office. “Over a tea and macaron meeting, we matched crystal colors to the desserts,” she said. “It was one of our most delicious meetings.” The pillboxes, true to size, come in 14 flavorful colors including champagne, lemon, rose and mint. ', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/08/fashion/08browsing-macaroon/08browsing-macaroon-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/12/08/fashion/08browsing-macaroon/08browsing-macaroon-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/08/fashion/08browsing-macaroon/08browsing-macaroon-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 800, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/08/fashion/08browsing-macaroon/08browsing-macaroon-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/08/fashion/08browsing-macaroon/08browsing-macaroon-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Macarons for What Ails You', 'kicker': 'Browsing', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Macarons for What Ails You', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cosmetics and Toiletries', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Laduree', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drugs 