 giant, which is trying to hold its big profit margins against a host of new competitors, is bundling some of its largest and most ambitious gear into a single large offering for cloud computing.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/06/ciscos-bigger-bundle-of-networking/', 'snippet': 'The computer networking giant, which is trying to hold its big profit margins against a host of new competitors, is bundling some of its largest and most ambitious gear into a single large offering for cloud computing.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Cisco introduced a comprehensive collection of computer networking hardware for cloud computing on Tuesday. The parts are not particularly new, but the packaging is — and that matters for both customer education and sales.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/07/technology/07bits-cisco/07bits-cisco-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Cisco’s Bigger Bundle of Networking', 'kicker': 'Bits', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Resource Pool For Networking', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cloud Computing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Data Storage', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Enterprise Computing', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Cisco Systems Inc', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-06T17:09:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By Quentin Hardy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Quentin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hardy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organizati