ockey fans react to knowing the details of the life and death of Derek Boogaard?', 'lead_paragraph': 'As the final installment in the story of the life and death of the hockey enforcer Derek Boogaard by The Times’s John Branch rolls out Tuesday, the waiting begins. Waiting to see if the sport reacts to something that has laid out the devastating effects of fighting in painful detail. Waiting to see if fans will continue to cheer fights, knowing they are likely trading those players’ brains for their entertainment. Waiting to see if pundits can still manage to proffer the absurd arguments about the violence preventing more violence.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Leading Off: The Sounds of Mostly Silence (So Far)', 'kicker': 'Slap Shot', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'College Athletics', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Heisman Trophy', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hockey, Ice', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bell, Heath', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bettman, Gary', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Boogaard, Derek', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Branch, John', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brown, Tim', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Couch, Greg', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Griffin, Robert', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Howard, Dwight', 'rank': 14, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Krzyzewski, Mike', 'rank': 15, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Paul