h Us', 'kicker': 'The 6th Floor', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Times', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-06T22:48:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Staff', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Staff'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/97ed6c2c-1ee4-5b6e-aa25-61bc82b19b1b', 'word_count': 78, 'uri': 'nyt://article/97ed6c2c-1ee4-5b6e-aa25-61bc82b19b1b'}, {'abstract': 'The president’s last major address to a Jewish group made headlines when he called for a peace deal on a Palestinian state based on Israel’s 1967 borders.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/06/obama-to-address-reform-jews/', 'snippet': 'The president’s last major address to a Jewish group made headlines when he called for a peace deal on a Palestinian state based on Israel’s 1967 borders.', 'lead_paragraph': 'President Obama will speak next week to a large gathering of North American Jews, the Union of Reform Judaism announced on Tuesday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Obama to Address Reform Jews', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-12-06T22:52:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Helene Cooper', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Helene', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cooper', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c4e82437-c3f3-5a63-98b7-6a67811fc917', 'word_count': 189, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c4e82437-c3f3-5a63-98b7-6a67811fc917'