tts,” the third movement of Ives’s “Concord” Sonata.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/07/arts/sub-denk/sub-denk-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/07/arts/sub-denk/sub-denk-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/07/arts/sub-denk/sub-denk-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Fleet Fingers Illustrating Eclectic Influences on Composers From Bach to Ligeti', 'kicker': 'Music Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Fleet Fingers Illustrating Eclectic Influences on Composers From Bach to Ligeti', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Denk, Jeremy', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Ninety-Second Street Y', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-06T23:30:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Vivien Schweitzer', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Vivien', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schweitzer', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/4b978348-4828-5972-ba19-100bf5649248', 'word_count': 467, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4b978348-4828-5972-ba19-100bf5649248'}, {'abstract': 'Automatic settings have made high-end professional cameras as easy to use as a point and shoot or a camera phone.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/07/technology/personaltech/to-artfully-capture-memories-try-these-cameras.html', 'snippet': 'Automatic settings have made high-end professional cameras as easy to use as a point and shoot or a camera phone.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CAMERA phones are terrific for documentation, capturing those spur of the moment snapshots of your pals downing sushi, your child finding a turtle in the driveway or even the damage someone did sideswiping your car. But the images you get probably are not frame quality.', 'print_section': 'F', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/07/technology/CAMERA-4/CAMERA-4-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/12/07/technology/CAMERA-4/CAMERA-4-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/07/technology/CAMERA-4/CAMERA-4-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 344, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/07/technology/CAMERA-4/CAMERA-4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/07/technology/CAMERA-4/CAMERA-4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'To Artfully Capture Memories, Try These Cameras', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'To Artfully Capture Memories, Try These Cameras', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cameras', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-06T23:32:51+0000', 'document_ty