tors.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/07/science/earth/kumi-naidoo-greenpeace-director-forges-a-broader-path-to-activism.html', 'snippet': 'Kumi Naidoo’s approach to revitalizing Greenpeace, a 40-year-old organization with something of an identity crisis, has brought him plenty of detractors.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DURBAN, South Africa — The bearded South African in the blood-red dashiki took a seat in the front row amid a sea of dark-suited executives on Monday morning at a side meeting of the United Nations climate change  conference here.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/07/world/GREENPEACE-2/GREENPEACE-2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 737, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/07/world/GREENPEACE-2/GREENPEACE-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/07/world/GREENPEACE-2/GREENPEACE-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Greenpeace Leader Visits Boardroom, Without Forsaking Social Activism', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Greenpeace Leader Visits the Boardroom, Without Forsaking Social Activism', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Greenpeace', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-07T02:50:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'Science', 'subsection_name': 'Environment', 'byline': {'original': 'By John M. Broder', 'person': [{'firstname': 'John', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/58e1a6b7-bc93-5485-942a-f1552a8c161f', 'word_count': 1111, 'uri': 'nyt://article/58e1a6b7-bc93-5485-942a-f1552a8c161f'}, {'abstract': 'It was a relief to hear the president elevate the middle class above the markets.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/07/opinion/president-obama-in-osawatomie.html', 'snippet': 'It was a relief to hear the president elevate the middle class above the markets.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After months of Republican candidates offering a cascade of bad ideas about the economy, President Obama’s speech in Osawatomie, Kan., Tuesday came as a relief. He made it clear that he was finally prepared to contest the election on the issues of income inequality and the obligation of both government and the private sector to enlarge the nation’s shrinking middle class.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '30', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Obama in Osawatomie', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Obama in Osawatomie', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Income Inequality', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-07T02:51:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/eb1e878a-1009-5987-a05a-00730751916f', 'word_count': 598, 'uri': 'nyt://article/eb1e878a-1009-5987-a05a-00730751916f'}, {'abstract': 'The jury in the corruption trial of City Councilman Larry B. Seabrook deliberated for a third full day, and comments to the press by Mr. Seabrook’s lawyer prompted a complaint from federal prosecutors.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/07/nyregion/judge-in-larry-seabrooks-case-chides-defense-lawyers.html', 'snippet': 'The jury in the corruption trial of City Councilman Larry B. Seabrook deliberated for a third full day, and comments to the press by Mr. Seabrook’s lawyer prompted a complaint from federal prosecutors.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The jury in the federal corruption trial of City Councilman Larry B. Seabrook was sent home on Tuesday evening after deliberating for a third full day without reaching a verdict. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '29', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/07/nyregion/SEABROOK/SEABROOK-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 684, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/07/nyregion/SEABROOK/SEABROOK-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/07/nyregion/SEABROOK/SEABROOK-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Judge Chides Defense in Official’s Trial', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Judge Chides Defense in Official’s Trial', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Patterson, Robert P Jr', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Frauds and Swindling', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Seabrook, Larry B', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Manhattan (NYC)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pol