1/12/07/rock-and-roll-hall-of-fame-inducts-guns-n-roses-red-hot-chili-peppers-and-the-beastie-boys/', 'snippet': 'Guns N’ Roses, Red Hot Chili Peppers and the Beastie Boys – three groups who helped to shape pop music in the late 1980s and early ’90s – will be inducted into The Rock and Roll Hall of Fame in April.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Three American groups that helped to shape pop music in the 1980s and early ’90s — Guns N’ Roses, Red Hot Chili Peppers and the Beastie Boys – will be inducted into The Rock and Roll Hall of Fame in the spring, the Hall was to announce Wednesday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Rock Hall Welcomes Guns N’ Roses, Red Hot Chili Peppers and the Beastie Boys', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Rock Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Beck, Jeff', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Charles, Ray', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Clapton, Eric', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Domino, Fats', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Dowd, Tom', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Franklin, Aretha', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jett, Joan', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Little Richard', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nyro, Laura', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rakim', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Santana, Carlos', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Stewart, Rod', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Beastie Boys', 'rank': 14, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "Guns N' Roses", 'rank': 15, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Red Hot Chili Peppers', 'rank