-nights-event-2/', 'snippet': 'A link and a comment.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Thanks to a commenter who found the video here. I don’t know if this is official or sanctioned, although it looks like it; I also don’t know why the Times tech people didn’t alert me. But anyway, it seems that those who missed the discussion can watch it via that link.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Last Night’s Event', 'kicker': 'Paul Krugman', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-12-07T14:45:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Paul Krugman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Paul', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Krugman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f28cb7b0-eafc-51d7-8215-4e4267c70e86', 'word_count': 161, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f28cb7b0-eafc-51d7-8215-4e4267c70e86'}, {'abstract': 'Judy Battista, the N.F.L. reporter for The Times, will answer questions from readers.', 'web_url': 'https://fifthdown.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/07/have-n-f-l-questions-judy-battista-has-answers-4/', 'snippet': 'Judy Battista, the N.F.L. reporter for The Times, will answer questions from readers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Will the Lions make the playoffs? Houston? Just how good (or bad) are the Falcons? Judy Battista, the N.F.L. reporter for The Times, will again answer selected questions from readers this week. Use the comment field below to ask your questions, and the answers will appear on The Fifth Down on Friday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Have N.F.L. Questions? Judy Battista Has Answers', 'kicker': 'The Fifth Down', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Footb