f Seattle that is beloved by Northwesterners, was sold last month. It wasn’t big news, unless you noticed the buyer: CNL Lifestyle Properties.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'CNL Adds Stevens Pass to Its Ski Resorts', 'kicker': 'In Transit', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Skiing', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Seattle (Wash)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-07T17:46:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': 'By Christopher Solomon', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Christopher', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Solomon', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/72d13195-fce6-53f2-ad16-ee7d5724453c', 'word_count': 257, 'uri': 'nyt://article/72d13195-fce6-53f2-ad16-ee7d5724453c'}, {'abstract': 'The ad appears to set up a contrast with Newt Gingrich, who has been married three times.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/07/new-romney-ad-highlights-stable-family/', 'snippet': 'The ad appears to set up a contrast with Newt Gingrich, who has been married three times.', 'lead_paragraph': '11:35 p.m. | Updated  Read the full report here. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Romney Ad Highlights Stable Family', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ADVERTISING AND MARKETING', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Marriages', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Political Advertising', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'person