osopher Gideon Rosen on culture and value.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The philosopher Gideon Rosen on culture and value.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/07/opinion/video-stone-rosen/video-stone-rosen-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/12/07/opinion/video-stone-rosen/video-stone-rosen-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/07/opinion/video-stone-rosen/video-stone-rosen-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/07/opinion/video-stone-rosen/video-stone-rosen-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'An Interview With Gideon Rosen', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-12-07T18:22:14+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'Opinion', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'None None', 'person': [{'firstname': 'None', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'None', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Video', '_id': 'nyt://video/7a5f6b6d-49a2-5bcf-8d62-3206220b7de0', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://video/7a5f6b6d-49a2-5bcf-8d62-3206220b7de0'}, {'abstract': 'An ABC News crew that traveled to Dara’a, the Syrian city where the uprising began, was not allowed to work freely, despite personal guarantees from Syria’s president, Bashar al-Assad.', 'web_url': 'https://thelede.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/07/despite-promises-from-assad-abc-news-crew-encountered-restrictions-in-syria/', 'snippet':