ter called I-Pad.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/07/ipad-faces-trademark-trouble-in-china/', 'snippet': 'A Chinese court rejected Apple’s claim to own the iPad trademark in China, which could stifle sales of the popular tablet in some Chinese cities. Apple has been butting heads with Proview Technology, which made an unsuccessful attempt to sell a ta...', 'lead_paragraph': '3:58 p.m. | Updated  Adding quote from lawyer at end. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'IPad Faces Trademark Trouble in China', 'kicker': 'Bits', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'iPad', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Suits and Litigation', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Apple Incorporated', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-07T18:28:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By Brian X. Chen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Brian', 'middlename': 'X.', 'lastname': 'Chen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/afaef1a9-8836-5700-a3da-82f1a4a048ba', 'word_count': 235, 'uri': 'nyt://article/afaef1a9-8836-5700-a3da-82f1a4a048ba'}, {'abstract': 'Christmas and Hanukkah have arrived a bit early, accompanied by carols and Adam Sandler. Must we sing along?', 'web_url': 'https://opinionator.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/07/a-holiday-break/', 'snippet': 'Christmas and Hanukkah have arrived a bit early, accompanied by carols and Adam Sandler. Must we sing along?', 'lead_paragraph': 'Gail Collins: David, let’s talk about something other than the Republican primaries. Newt Gingrich is just not a holiday subject.', 'source': 'The New Yor