011/12/07/gingrichs-unimpeachable-conservative-credential/', 'snippet': 'Why Republicans have so far overlooked the former speaker’s lapses from conservative orthodoxy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I have seen a lot of other commentators bring up versions of this point, but there is a reason why Republicans, especially conservative Republicans, see Newt Gingrich as by far their most qualified nominee and why they have been willing so far to excuse his periodic lapses from conservative orthodoxy.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Gingrich’s Unimpeachable Conservative Credential', 'kicker': 'FiveThirtyEight', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Clinton, Bill', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gingrich, Newt', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'House of Representatives', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-07T19:34:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nate Silver', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nate', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Silver', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d15bc979-c5b7-5b62-8de2-b4e5c82566d0', 'word_count': 556, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d15bc979-c5b7-5b62-8de2-b4e5c82566d0'}, {'abstract': 'A new report aimed at identifying environmental risk factors for breast cancer urges women to avoid unnecessary medical radiation, avoid hormone treatments for menopause that combine estrogen and progestin, limit alcohol intake and minimize weight gain.', 'web_url': 'https://well.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/07/lowering-breast-cancer-risk/', 'snippet': 'A new report aimed at identifying environmental risk factors for breast cancer urges women to avoid unnecessary medical radiation, avoid hormone treatments for menopause that combine estrogen and progestin, limit alcohol intake and minimize weight...', 'lead_paragraph': 'A new report aimed at identifying environmental risk factors for breast cancer urges women to avoid unnecessary medical radiation, avoid certain hormone treatments for menopause, limit alcohol and keep their weight down. As Denise Grady, the New York Times health reporter, writes:', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Lowering Breast Cancer Risk', 'kicker': 'Well', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Breast Cancer', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Medicine and Health', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-07T19:42:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tara Parker-Pope', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tara', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Parker-Pope', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f0246fc3-3787-5f17-82f9-b7ea7c34827c', 'word_count': 212, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f0246fc3-3787-5f17-82f9-b7ea7c34827c'}, {'abstract': 'Jose Reyes said Wednesday that the Mets never demonstrated any real interest in re-signing him as a free agent.', 'web_url': 'https://bats.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/07/reyes-says-mets-never-made-him-an-offer/', 'snippet': 'Jose Reyes said Wednesday that the Mets never demonstrated any real interest in re-signing him as a free agent.', 'lead_paragraph': '8:18 p.m. | Updated ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Reyes Says Mets Never Made Him an Offer', 'kicker': 'Bats', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'nam