umbia-engineering-school-dean-is-criticized.html', 'snippet': 'The school’s dean, Feniosky Peña-Mora, has been a lightning rod for staff criticism since his hiring in 2009, but the university continues to dismiss calls to replace him.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Columbia University is grappling with a rare faculty revolt against the dean of its engineering school, who has helped the school grow in size and stature since his 2009 hiring, but has also been accused of ignoring professors’ concerns and worsening a chronic space shortage. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '30', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/08/nyregion/columbia/columbia-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 800, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/08/nyregion/columbia/columbia-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/08/nyregion/columbia/columbia-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Discord Over Dean Rocks Columbia Engineering School', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Discord Over Dean Rocks Columbia Engineering School', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Columbia College', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Moody-Adams, Michele M', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Steele, Claude M', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bollinger, Lee C', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Columbia University', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Colleges and Universities', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Engineerin