is no substitute for pursuing a criminal investigation against executives at the mining company where 29 miners died.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/08/opinion/unsettled-justice-at-upper-big-branch.html', 'snippet': 'A monetary settlement is no substitute for pursuing a criminal investigation against executives at the mining company where 29 miners died.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The $209 million settlement in fines and restitution in the Upper Big Branch mine disaster should not be considered the end of this tragedy — or the end of the mine owner’s responsibility. The Justice Department must vigorously pursue the criminal investigation of top officials of Massey Energy, the company found grievously at fault. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '38', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Unsettled Justice at Upper Big Branch', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Unsettled Justice at Upper Big Branch', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mines and Mining', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Accidents and Safety', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Upper Big Branch Mine', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Massey Energy Co', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fines (Penalties)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Fatalities)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Law and Legislation', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Senate', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'House of Representatives', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Alpha Natural Resources Inc', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Justice Department', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 12, 'major': 