d on Tuesday. It ordered the agency, the Bonneville Power Administration, to rewrite its rules. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/08/business/Wind/Wind-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 952, 'width': 685, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/08/business/Wind/Wind-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/08/business/Wind/Wind-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'U.S. Agency Is Ordered to Change Wind Rules', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'U.S. Agency Is Ordered To Change Wind Rules', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Federal Energy Regulatory Commission', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Pacific Northwestern States (US)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wind Power', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Columbia River (Pacific Northwest)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bonneville Power Administration', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-08T03:55:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Energy & Environment ', 'byline': {'original': 'By Matthew L. Wald', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Matthew', 'middlename': 'L.', 'lastname': 'Wald', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9047d1f1-f112-5095-a31d-ca3bee3f69ff', 'word_count': 504, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9047d1f1-f11