ent, reaching a 15-year high in 2011.', 'web_url': 'https://mediadecoder.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/08/more-journalists-behind-bars-in-2011/', 'snippet': 'According to a report by the Committee to Protect Journalists issued on Thursday, the number of journalists imprisoned worldwide shot up 20 percent, reaching a 15-year high in 2011.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In times of significant worldwide conflict, everyone is at increased risk, including the journalists who cover those events.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'More Journalists Behind Bars in 2011', 'kicker': 'Media Decoder', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Freelancing, Self-Employment and Independent Contracting', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Prisons and Prisoners', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Committee to Protect Journalists', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-08T17:00:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Carr', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Carr', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/44c19c85-6b9e-54b8-bd74-b86a7179ed54', 'word_count': 250, 'uri': 'nyt://article/44c19c85-6b9e-54b8-bd74-b86a7179ed54'}, {'abstract': 'Cracker Barrel has won the support of Institutional Shareholder Services as the restaurant chain seeks to fend off a proxy fight with the activist investor Sardar Biglari.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2011/12/08/cracker-barrel-gains-support-from-i-s-s-in-fight-against-biglari/', 'snippet': 'Cracker Barrel has won the support of Institutional Shareholder Services as the restaurant chain seeks to fend off a proxy fig