66d-a464-e5ad65551ae4'}, {'abstract': 'Gov. Rick Perry said he would defer to civilian and military leaders on whether to discharge gay military members if “don’t ask, don’t tell” were reinstated.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/08/perry-would-not-demand-discharge-if-dont-ask-returned/', 'snippet': 'Gov. Rick Perry said he would defer to civilian and military leaders on whether to discharge gay military members if “don’t ask, don’t tell” were reinstated.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MOUNT PLEASANT, S.C. — Gov. Rick Perry of Texas has sharply criticized President Obama‘s repeal of the “don’t ask, don’t tell” policy on gays serving in the military. But if the policy were reinstated, he would not demand the expulsion of service members who have disclosed their homosexuality since the policy was repealed in September.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Perry Would Not Demand Discharge if ‘Don’t Ask’ Returned', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Perry, Rick', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Log Cabin Republicans', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'South Carolina', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-08T18:36:58+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Richard A. Oppel Jr', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Richard', 'middlename': 'A.', 'lastname': 'Oppel', 'qualifier': 'Jr', 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e38848bb-f61e-5175-8304-7a9f56ce2dc7', 'word_count': 384, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e38848bb-f61e-5175-8304-7a9f56ce2dc7'}, {'abstract': 'The Knicks should realize Carmelo Anthony is not a great fit on a team that has Amar’e Stoudemire and do what is in their best interests to win a title: explore a trade.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/09/sports/basketball/carmelo-anthony-chauncey-billups-knicks.html', 'snippet': 'The Knicks should realize Carmelo Anthony is not a great fit on a team that has Amar’e Stoudemire and do what is in their best interests to win a title: explore a trade.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Finally and fittingly, the Knicks appear to have woken up to a not-so-harsh reality and to a world of immediate possibility. Gone, apparently, is their three-superstar agenda, replaced by a more original, and practical, championship-contending blueprint.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/09/sports/basketball/09araton-pic/09araton-pic-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/12/09/sports/basketball/09araton-pic/09araton-pic-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/09/sports/basketball/09araton-pic/09araton-pic-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 706, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/09/sports/basketball/09araton-pic/09araton-pic-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/09/sports/basketball/09araton-pic/09araton-pic-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Trading Anthony and