f274b375-abe1-51c8-8593-0538ec6eb3e8'}, {'abstract': 'The period from July to September was the seventh straight quarter of year-over-year growth in state tax revenues, helping states struggling with budget shortfalls.', 'web_url': 'https://economix.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/08/state-taxes-rise-across-the-u-s/', 'snippet': 'The period from July to September was the seventh straight quarter of year-over-year growth in state tax revenues, helping states struggling with budget shortfalls.', 'lead_paragraph': 'State tax revenues rose last quarter compared with a year earlier, according to preliminary data from the Rockefeller Institute of Government at the State University at Albany. This was the seventh straight quarter of growth, and is happy news for states struggling with budget shortfalls in the wake of the Great Recession.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'State Taxes Rise Across the U.S.', 'kicker': 'Economix', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'States (US)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Taxation', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'North Dakota', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-08T19:00:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Economy', 'byline': {'original': 'By Catherine Rampell', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Catherine', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rampell', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b4de6734-1e20-5e6e-9c58-c1c89ae96ca9', 'word_count': 241, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b4de6734-1e20-5e6e-9c58-c1c89ae96ca9'}, {'abstract': 'The company reported $707 million in revenue for the three months ending Sept. 30, down 6 percent from the same period last year. Its net loss for the 