id at the level of a star, but he has played like one.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Free agency officially begins on Dec. 9, but the chase has already begun. There are no traditional superstars in the bunch, but the best relative talents will still land maximum or near-max contracts under the league’s new collective bargaining agreement. Here’s look at one of the terrific — if likely overpaid — candidates for such a deal.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Why Nene Should Be in Demand', 'kicker': 'Off the Dribble', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Free Agents (Sports)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'ANTHONY, CARMELO', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Barron, Earl', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hawes, Spencer', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Iguodala, Andre', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Martin, Kevin', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nene', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wilcox, Chris', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Denver Nuggets', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Basketball Assn', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-08T20:01:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Basketball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rob Mahoney', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rob', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mahoney', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/02c6466b-a288-51e4-a845-714ef195aaa7', 'word_count': 737, 'uri': 'nyt://article/02c6466b-a288-51e4-a845-7