7b-6d6c-5775-893f-e8aa3bcb809e'}, {'abstract': '“I Melt With You” stars Rob Lowe, Jeremy Piven, Thomas Jane and Christian McKay as college friends now in middle age rejoining for a week of debauchery and soul-searching.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/09/movies/i-melt-with-you-with-rob-lowe-and-jeremy-piven-review.html', 'snippet': '“I Melt With You” stars Rob Lowe, Jeremy Piven, Thomas Jane and Christian McKay as college friends now in middle age rejoining for a week of debauchery and soul-searching.', 'lead_paragraph': '“I Melt With You” may set a record for the movie in which the most drugs are consumed and the most tears shed by grown men. That is a dubious distinction for any film but especially for one whose unofficial theme song is the Sex Pistols’ “Pretty Vacant,” which is not exactly a tearjerker.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/09/arts/SUBIMELT/SUBIMELT-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/12/09/arts/SUBIMELT/SUBIMELT-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/09/arts/SUBIMELT/SUBIMELT-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 695, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/09/arts/SUBIMELT/SUBIMELT-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/09/arts/SUBIMELT/SUBIMELT-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Sharing the Regrets, and the Sex and Drugs', 'kicker': "Movie Review | ‘I Melt With You'", 'content_