ative, and this tale of a righteous gentile selflessly assisting in the survival of a handful of persecuted Jews is no exception.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/09/arts/09INDARK/09INDARK-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/12/09/arts/09INDARK/09INDARK-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/09/arts/09INDARK/INDARK-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 647, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/09/arts/09INDARK/09INDARK-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/09/arts/09INDARK/09INDARK-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Unlikely Hero in an Underground Hideout, Away From the Nazis', 'kicker': "Movie Review | 'In Darkness'", 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Unlikely Hero in an Underground Hideout, Away From the Nazis', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Holland, Agnieszka', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-09T01:30:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By A.O. Scott', 'person': [{'firstname': 'A.', 'middlename': 'O.', 'lastname': 'Scott', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/f3a5a03e-7a73-5b05-ba93-d3f92cee1ddd', 'word_count': 924, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f3a5a03e-7a73-5b05-ba93-d3f92cee1ddd'}, {'abstract': 'When Rod Blagojevich, the former governor, received a 14-year prison sentence this week, a prosecutor’s statement about deterring greed seemed overly optimistic.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/09/us/what-blagojevichs-sentence-says-about-corruption-and-greed.html', 'snippet': 'When Rod Blagojevich, the former governor, received a 14-year prison sentence this week, a prosecutor’s statement about deterring greed seemed overly optimistic.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Even as Rod Blagojevich said he was “unbelievably sorry” on Wednesday, one wondered whether he was, unbelievably, sorry — and if a central premise of his 14-year-sentence was as naïve as this glad-handing felon.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '29A', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/09/us/09CNCWARREN/09CNCWARREN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 962, 'width': 693, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/09/us/09CNCWARREN/09CNCWARREN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/09/us/09CNCWARREN/09CNCWARREN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'What Blagojevich’s Sentence Says About Corruption and Greed', 'kicker': 'Chicago News Cooperative', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'What Blagojevich’s Sentence Says About Corruption and Greed', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Blagojevich, Rod R', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sentences (Criminal)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Corruption (I