d', '_id': 'nyt://article/85a1f216-39ad-54b2-bb88-0721ee9fa10b', 'word_count': 802, 'uri': 'nyt://article/85a1f216-39ad-54b2-bb88-0721ee9fa10b'}, {'abstract': 'AAA, the automobile club, said the increase is being illegally used for World Trade Center redevelopment; the authority said the revenue is for transportation.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/09/nyregion/aaa-and-port-authority-fight-over-toll-increases.html', 'snippet': 'AAA, the automobile club, said the increase is being illegally used for World Trade Center redevelopment; the authority said the revenue is for transportation.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When the Port Authority of New York and New Jersey raised bridge and tunnel tolls in September, officials said the increased revenue was necessary to ensure the financial health of the infrastructure the authority controls, including the World Trade Center project.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '34', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Auto Club and Port Authority Fight in Court Over Rise in Toll', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Auto Club and Port Authority Fight in Court Over Rise in Toll', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bridges and Tunnels', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Jersey', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tolls', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AMERICAN AUTOMOBILE ASSN', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Port Authority of New York and New Jersey', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'World Trade Center (NYC)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Suits and Litigation', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Holwell, Richard J', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-09T02