e skeptical.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/10/world/africa/un-chief-pays-surprise-visit-to-somalia.html', 'snippet': 'Ban Ki-moon promised to relocate the United Nation’s political office for Somalia to Mogadishu next year, though other United Nations officials were skeptical.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MOGADISHU, Somalia — Ban Ki-moon became the first United Nations secretary general to set foot in this war-ravaged country in almost 20 years on Friday, and he promised to relocate the United Nations’ political office for Somalia to Mogadishu next year, though other United Nations officials were skeptical. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/10/world/somalia/somalia-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 353, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/12/10/world/somalia/somalia-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 353}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/10/world/somalia/somalia-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/10/world/somalia/somalia-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/10/world/somalia/somalia-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'U.N. Chief Pays Surprise Visit to Somalia', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'U.N. Chief Pays Surprise Visit to Somalia', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Somalia', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ban Ki-moon', 