 around New York.', 'web_url': 'https://dinersjournal.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/09/weekend-fare-71/', 'snippet': 'Food-related events around New York.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Alain Ducasse will be the first chef to be awarded the Trophee des Arts, which the French Institute Alliance Francaise established in 1992 to recognize a person who enhances the cultural relationship between France and the United Sates. The presentation is a black-tie gala at the Institute, 583 Park Avenue (63rd Street), on the Upper East Side, and starts at 7 p.m. Some tickets are still available and can be purchased by calling (646) 388-6632. They are $500 for those 34 and under and $1,500 for patron tickets.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Weekend Fare', 'kicker': 'Diner&#039;s Journal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-12-09T17:59:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bao Ong', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bao', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ong', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f2753ca9-2573-5692-a20d-9cd9a952f546', 'word_count': 763, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f2753ca9-2573-5692-a20d-9cd9a952f546'}, {'abstract': 'A five-bedroom apartment in the new Laureate condominium has 3,500 square feet of space.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/09/big-ticket-sold-for-9-79-million/', 'snippet': 'A five-bedroom apartment in the new Laureate condominium has 3,500 square feet of space.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A five-bedroom penthouse at the Laureate, a new condominium at Broadway and 76th Street, was the biggest sale of the week, going for $9.79 million, according to city records.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Big Ticket | Sold