boyle-and-matthew-long-vows.html', 'snippet': 'After a serious accident and many injuries, he was offered advice on finding a wife: “It can happen to you, man. Just believe.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'DURING the transit strike of 2005, the New York City firefighter Matt Long hopped onto his bike to ride from his East 48th Street apartment to the Randalls Island fire academy where he helped train the city’s bravest. As he crossed 52nd Street, a chartered bus made a right turn from a middle lane and hit him. When he awoke a month later, he learned the grisly details: he had been impaled by his bike and dragged under the bus, his body held together by little more than his bike shorts. He was given 68 pints of blood and a 1 percent chance of survival.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/11/fashion/weddings/11VOWS1/11VOWS1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/12/11/fashion/weddings/11VOWS1/11VOWS1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/11/fashion/weddings/11VOWS1/11VOWS1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 692, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/11/fashion/weddings/11VOWS1/11VOWS1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/11/fashion/weddings/11VOWS1/11VOWS1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Mary Boyle and Matthew Long', 'kicker': 'Vows', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Mary Boyle and Matthew Long', 'name':