t': 980, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6d1436db-3f66-5dea-9942-6bbd667c6e15'}, {'abstract': 'A history of the Great Performers portfolio.', 'web_url': 'https://6thfloor.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/09/this-sunday-actors-turn-villainous/', 'snippet': 'A history of the Great Performers portfolio.', 'lead_paragraph': 'From the moment we asked Bill Murray to let us decorate his beard with fake flowers — an image dreamed up by Inez van Lamsweerde and Vinoodh Matadin, the photographer couple who shot our Great Performers portfolio for the first three years — we’ve had lots of fun with some very game actors. Clint Eastwood endured several rounds of being blasted with huge clouds of smoke. Charlize Theron sat for a portrait in the nude, painted in gold. William Hurt’s face was made up to resemble Francis Bacon’s painting of a death mask of William Blake.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'This Sunday: Actors Turn Villainous', 'kicker': 'The 6th Floor', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Franco, James', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hurt, William', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McGinley, Ryan', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Paltrow, Jake', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sundsbo, Solve', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Theron, Charlize', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Winslet, Kate', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-10T00:19:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kathy Ryan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kathy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ryan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/cbb20372-a5ef-50