e Taliban. The bomber struck just outside a mosque where the officers had gone to pray. Two civilians were also killed, the Kunar governor said. In southern Afghanistan, seven detainees being held on narcotics trafficking charges escaped from a prison in Helmand Province, local officials said. Four employees at the prison, which is inside the police headquarters in Lashkar Gah, the provincial capital, were arrested in connection with the escape. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Afghanistan: Suicide Bomber Kills 6 Security Officers at Prayer', 'kicker': 'World Briefing | Asia', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Afghanistan: Suicide Bomber Kills 6 Security Officers at Prayer', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Taliban', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Prison Escapes', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'North Atlantic Treaty Organization', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'AFGHANISTAN', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Afghanistan War (2001- )', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Helmand Province (Afghanistan)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-10T00:39:59+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alissa J. Rubin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alissa', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': 'Rubin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/76db5f84-c7d6-5b33-b9b2-d470398d1165', 'word_count': 113, 'uri': 'nyt://article/76db5f84-c7d6-5b33-b9b2-d470398d1165'}, {'abstract': 'Readers respond to an editorial, “What About Premium Support?”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/