'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United States Air Force Academy', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'College Athletics', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United States Military Academy', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United States Naval Academy', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-10T01:16:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'College Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dave Caldwell', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dave', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Caldwell', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a832033c-2ba7-5555-99fc-75e1ed3f42d6', 'word_count': 848, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a832033c-2ba7-5555-99fc-75e1ed3f42d6'}, {'abstract': 'Bacchus offers a prix fixe menu Tuesday to Thursday in addition to a regular menu, available daily, and specials.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/11/nyregion/bacchus-restaurant-in-south-norwalk-review.html', 'snippet': 'Bacchus offers a prix fixe menu Tuesday to Thursday in addition to a regular menu, available daily, and specials.', 'lead_paragraph': 'THE first thing to meet your eye as you enter Bacchus is a large trompe l’oeil painting of a wine cellar interior. There was something about those wine barrels that prompted a feel-good response from the moment we arrived at this lively Italian restaurant, which re-opened last April in the historic district of South Norwalk after a two-and-half-year hiatus (a result of a legal dispute). The good food and wine that followed confirmed our initial impression.', 'print_section': 'CT', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'im