 see them fall apart as markets judged they were inadequate or irrelevant to the problem of making good on old debts and generating enough growth to pay off future obligations. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Europe’s Latest Try', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Europe’s Latest Try', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'European Sovereign Debt Crisis (2010- )', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Credit and Debt', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Economic Conditions and Trends', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Europe', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Euro (Currency)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'European Union', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-10T02:21:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/020eaab6-fa24-567c-b1ad-8c9f64bfb2d4', 'word_count': 515, 'uri': 'nyt://article/020eaab6-fa24-567c-b1ad-8c9f64bfb2d4'}, {'abstract': 'Participants in Phil Kline’s Unsilent Night musical parade through the East Village can now download an app and use their phones instead of boomboxes.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/11/nyregion/parade-keeps-its-boom.html', 'snippet': 'Participants in Phil Kline’s Unsilent Night musical parade through the East Village can now download an app and use their phones instead of boomboxes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'APP Unsilent Night', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'u