p of five Nobel laureates has called on China to release Liu Xiaobo, the imprisoned winner of the Nobel Peace Prize last year.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A group of five Nobel laureates has called on China to release Liu Xiaobo, the imprisoned winner of the Nobel Peace Prize last year. In 2009, Mr. Liu was sentenced to 11 years on charges of trying to subvert the state. He was a main author of a manifesto circulated online, Charter 08, that called for gradual democratic reforms. His wife, Liu Xia, is under house arrest in Beijing.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'China: Nobel Winners Demand Release of Imprisoned Dissident', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Liu Xiaobo', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Beijing (China)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Nobel Prizes', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-10T03:25:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Edward Wong', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Edward', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Wong', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/95f1ba23-ab41-502f-ba05-3f1330b66522', 'word_count': 193, 'uri': 'nyt://article/95f1ba23-ab41-502f-ba05-3f1330b66522'}, {'abstract': 'A task force is calculating North Carolina’s obligation to the estimated 7,600 victims of its eugenics program from 1933 to 1977, many of them poor and uneducated.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/10/us/redress-weighed-for-forced-sterilizations-in-north-carolina.html', 'snippet': 'A task force is calculating North Carolina’s obligation to the estimated 7,600 victims of its eugenics program from 1933 to 1977, many of them poor and uneducated.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LINWOOD, N.C. — Charles Holt, 62, spreads a cache of vintage government records across his trailer floor. They are the stark facts of his state-ordered sterilization.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/10/us/EUGENICS/EUGENICS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/12/10/us/EUGENICS/EUGENICS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/10/us/EUGENICS/EUGENICS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/10/us/EUGENICS/EUGENICS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/10/us/EUGENICS/EUGENICS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Thousands Sterilized, a State Weighs Restitution', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Thousands Sterilized, a State Weighs Restitution', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Perdue, Beverly E', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sterilization (Biological)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'North Carolina', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'States (US)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Reparations and Restitution', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-10T03:26:48+0000', 'document_type':