sic, returned to his old Bronx neighborhood with the play’s director.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/11/nyregion/a-wanderer-the-singer-dion-returns-to-the-bronx.html', 'snippet': 'Dion DiMucci, who has been collaborating on a play called “The Wanderer” about his life and music, returned to his old Bronx neighborhood with the play’s director.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DRESSED in black with shades to match, Dion DiMucci stood on East 187th Street and pointed to Grandma Maria’s apartment building. In the 1940s, that corner fire escape was the best perch in Belmont for the street fairs where big guys sang big songs.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/11/nyregion/11DION_SPAN/11DION_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/12/11/nyregion/11DION_SPAN/11DION_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/11/nyregion/11DION_SPAN/11DION-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/11/nyregion/11DION_SPAN/11DION_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/11/nyregion/11DION_SPAN/11DION_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Wanderer, the Singer Dion Returns to the Bronx', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Wanderer, Dion Returns To the Bronx', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'DiMucci, Dion', 'rank':