ttps://intransit.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/10/proposed-gondola-would-link-utah-ski-resorts/', 'snippet': 'Canyons Resort near Park City plans to build a nearly two-mile long gondola that would reach the base of Solitude Mountain in Big Cottonwood Canyon.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A Utah ski lift proposed last month could be the first step in a decades-old vision of interconnecting seven Wasatch Mountain ski resorts near Salt Lake City and creating a European-style valley-to-valley ski experience in North America.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Proposed Gondola Would Link Utah Ski Resorts', 'kicker': 'In Transit', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ALPINE SKIING', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Skiing', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Park City (Utah)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Utah', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-10T15:00:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': 'By Christopher Solomon', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Christopher', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Solomon', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/091667fc-8c3a-5295-9b8c-69605e2ed2a5', 'word_count': 345, 'uri': 'nyt://article/091667fc-8c3a-5295-9b8c-69605e2ed2a5'}, {'abstract': 'Here is a sampling of readers’ responses to the series and to the N.H.L.’s reaction.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/11/sports/hockey/punched-out-readers-have-their-say.html', 'snippet': 'Here is a sampling of readers’ responses to the series and to the N.H.L.’s reaction.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The three-part series by John Branch, “Punched Out: The Life and Death of a Hockey Enforcer,” profiled Derek Boogaard, a six-year N.H.L. veteran who died of an accidental overdose of alcohol and painkillers last May at age 28. A post-mortem study revealed that he had chronic traumatic encephalopathy, a degenerative brain disease. Here is a sampling of readers’ responses to the series and to the N.H.L.’s reaction. (The articles, with videos and slide shows, are at nytimes.com.) ', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Punched Out: Readers Have Their Say', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Boy Who Learned To Brawl: Readers Have Their Say', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Boogaard, Derek', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Concussions', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hockey, Ice', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Hockey League', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bettman, Gary', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Series', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-10T15:39:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Hockey', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Letter', '_id': 'nyt://article/f2756292-e41f-51d1-ad90-d76b8bba4ad0', 'word_count': 1773, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f2756292-e41f-51d1-ad90-d76b8bba4ad0'}, {'abstract': 'Young people in Northern New Jersey are leading a family-driven competitive routine that has surprised longtime running officials.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/11/sports/youngsters-lead-the-way-in-running-families.html', 'snippet': 'Young people in Northern New Jersey are leading a family-driven competitive routine that has surprised longtime running officials.', 'lead_paragraph