d former Minnesota Gov. Tim Pawlenty, who joined him Saturday afternoon.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/10/romney-makes-surprise-appearance-at-iowa-rally/', 'snippet': 'Mitt Romney made a surprise visit to his Iowa headquarters, joining his wife and son, and former Minnesota Gov. Tim Pawlenty, who joined him Saturday afternoon.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DES MOINES — A punchy and jovial Mitt Romney made a surprise visit to his Iowa headquarters just hours before he is set to take the stage at a Republican debate, joking with the crowd and his wife, Ann, and son Josh who joined him Saturday afternoon.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Romney Makes Surprise Appearance at Iowa Rally', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pawlenty, Tim', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Romney, Ann', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Romney, Mitt', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iowa', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-10T20:40:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ashley Parker', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ashley', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Parker', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b9a04167-6785-5a42-83fd-48bbfd7dcb5b', 'word_count': 562, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b9a04167-6785-5a42-83fd-48bbfd7dcb5b'}, {'abstract': 'A satire of the revolution was included in an officially sanctioned film festival in Havana and has become a landmark in the gradual opening of Cuban cinema.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/1