he engineer driving the train is almost certain to suffer from post-traumatic stress disorder.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/11/us/engineers-face-horrible-memories-from-deaths-on-the-tracks.html', 'snippet': 'When someone dies on the railroad tracks, suicide or not, the engineer driving the train is almost certain to suffer from post-traumatic stress disorder.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The number of deaths is spiking this year on the tracks of the 77-mile Caltrain commuter line between San Francisco and Gilroy. With the 15th and 16th fatalities taking place within an hour of each other on Dec. 3, the total is nearing the 1995 high of 20 fatalities.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '37A', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/11/us/11-BC-ENGINEER/11-BC-ENGINEER-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 370, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/12/11/us/11-BC-ENGINEER/11-BC-ENGINEER-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 370}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/11/us/11-BC-ENGINEER/11-BC-ENGINEER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 710, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'For the Engineer, a Death on the Tracks Means Horrifying Memories', 'kicker': 'The Bay Citizen', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'For the Engineer, a Death on the Tracks Means Horrifying Memories', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Railroad Accidents and Safety', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Suicides and Suicide Attempts', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Railroads', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'San Francisco (Calif)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'org