ani, who is coping with a plethora of health problems.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/11/nyregion/coming-to-the-rescue-of-a-sister-in-need.html', 'snippet': 'Sandra Dorne packed her life into a small suitcase and moved many miles to be with her sister, Patricia Trivisani, who is coping with a plethora of health problems.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When Sandra Dorne received a call in 2010 from a niece saying that Ms. Dorne’s older sister was in desperate need of care, she did not think twice. She packed her life into a small suitcase, left her waitressing job in Orlando, Fla., and three days later booked a $150 one-way plane ticket to Allentown, Pa. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '30', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/10/nyregion/Y11NEEDIEST/Y11NEEDIEST-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/12/10/nyregion/Y11NEEDIEST/Y11NEEDIEST-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/10/nyregion/Y11NEEDIEST/Y11NEEDIEST-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/10/nyregion/Y11NEEDIEST/Y11NEEDIEST-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/10/nyregion/Y11NEEDIEST/Y11NEEDIEST-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'From Florida to Brooklyn to Care for Her Ailing Sister', 'kicker': 'The Neediest Cases', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'From Florida to Brooklyn To Care for Ailing Sister', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 's