ed6-802a-2dc75f1c2446'}, {'abstract': 'The rapidly closing window for campaigning puts new pressure on the candidates and their campaigns to respond quickly and aggressively to moments from the debate.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/11/debate-reverberates-going-into-final-stretch/', 'snippet': 'The rapidly closing window for campaigning puts new pressure on the candidates and their campaigns to respond quickly and aggressively to moments from the debate.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Mitt Romney has 23 days to confront any political damage from what may become the most memorable moment of Saturday night’s debate — the image of him offering to wager $10,000 to settle a bet with Rick Perry over the contents of Mr. Romney’s latest book.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Debate Reverberates Going Into Final Stretch', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Debates (Political)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Palestinians', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bachmann, Michele M', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gingrich, Newt', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Huntsman, Jon M Jr', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Perry, Rick', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Reagan, Ronald Wilson', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Romney, Mitt', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Santorum, Rick', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Democratic National Committee', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Drake University', 'rank': 13, 'm