ened a green market in 2008, which drew large crowds of nonresidents, and they scheduled noisy music concerts afterward. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Skating Rink Spurs Residents’ Latest Fight With Management', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Peter Cooper Village (NYC)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Real Estate and Housing (Residential)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Stuyvesant Town (NYC)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Buildings Department (NYC)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'CW Capital Management', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Rose Associates', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Manhattan (NYC)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-11T19:00:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alexis Okeowo', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alexis', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Okeowo', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/00c98792-16dc-5404-b5ac-8b6b44984749', 'word_count': 897, 'uri': 'nyt://article/00c98792-16dc-5404-b5ac-8b6b44984749'}, {'abstract': 'Photos of the concert at Madison Square Garden.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2011/12/12/arts/music/JINGLE.html', 'snippet': 'Photos of the concert at Madison Square Garden.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Photos of the concert at Madison Square Garden.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/12/arts/music/JINGLE-slide-ZHHG/JINGLE-slide-ZHHG-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'widt