a two-hour weekday show on WABC radio in New York City.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Geraldo Rivera’s been called a lot of names in his life. Here’s a new one: radio talk show host.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Geraldo Rivera Gets Talk Deal on WABC Radio', 'kicker': 'Media Decoder', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Radio', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rivera, Geraldo', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Cumulus Media Inc', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'WABC', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-11T21:32:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Brian Stelter', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Brian', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Stelter', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/66ad5991-393d-5098-8bb8-5be4339a8b58', 'word_count': 510, 'uri': 'nyt://article/66ad5991-393d-5098-8bb8-5be4339a8b58'}, {'abstract': 'John Zorn’s hard-won authority as a new-music pioneer was affirmed with performances of his work by other musicians and by the composer himself.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/12/arts/music/john-zorn-at-the-miller-theater-review.html', 'snippet': 'John Zorn’s hard-won authority as a new-music pioneer was affirmed with performances of his work by other musicians and by the composer himself.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For all that the New York composer John Zorn retains his substantial cachet as a maverick, an outlier and a nose-thumbing rebel — and for all that he might prefer to maintain that impression — a sold-out concert at the Miller Theater of Columbia University on Friday night indicated his actual status.