Church added its influential voice over the weekend to calls for a just election process in Russia. The step followed demonstrations across the country that called for a recount or a fresh vote, and outpourings from individual members of the church’s clergy, who reflected popular anger at the flawed Dec. 4 election.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Russian Orthodox Church Adds Influential Voice to Calls for Election Reform', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Russian Orthodox Church Adds Influential Voice to Calls for Election Reform', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Russia', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Russian Orthodox Church', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Putin, Vladimir V', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United Russia', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Demonstrations, Protests, and Riots', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Politics and Government', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-12T04:26:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sophia Kishkovsky', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sophia', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kishkovsky', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d8da9bef-4118-5379-80e1-1a9251b96ad0', 'word_count': 860, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d8da9bef-4118-5379-80e1-1a9251b96ad0'}, {'abstract': 'The elections, in the aftermath of violence after the previous president refused to accept his defeat, are expected to strengthen support for the current one.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/12/world/africa/vote-counting-begins-in-ivory-coast-legislative-elections.html', 'snippet': 'The elections, in the aftermath of violence after the previous president refused to accept his defeat, are expected to strengthen support for the current one.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ballot-counting began on Sunday night in Ivory Coast, in the first legislative election in more than a decade. Results were most likely to shore up support for President Alassane Ouattara as he pushes to overhaul the cocoa industry.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/12/world/IVORY/IVORY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Election Day Is Calm in Ivory Coast', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Election Day Is Calm in Ivory Coast', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Ivory Coast', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ouattara, Alassane D', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cocoa', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gbagbo, Laurent', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'War Crimes, Genocide and Crimes Against Humanity', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Legislatures and Parliaments', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-12T04:30:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Africa', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bloomberg News', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bloomberg', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'News', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0d452717-a3ec-5987-8bc8-2df5548c8777', 'word_count': 221, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0d452717-a3ec-5987-8bc8-2df5548c8777'}, {'abstract': 'The price tag for the fashion house’s initial public offering includes some expectations about future growth that might prove hard to meet.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/12/business/putting-a-price-on-michael-korss-ipo.html', 'snippet': 'The price tag for the fashion house’s initial public offering includes some expectations about future growth that might prove hard to meet.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The fashion designer Michael Kors is seeking a luxury price tag on his stock. His company’s initial public offering, expected this week, would value it at up to $3.6 billion. The metrics are in line with Prada, which listed earlier this year. But Michael Kors Holdings may struggle to sustain the growth needed to stay in style with investors.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/12/business/views/views-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 617, 'width': 649, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Putting a Price on Michael Kors', 'kicker': 'Reuters Breakingviews', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Putting a Price On Michael Kors', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Company Reports', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Texas Instruments Inc', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Initial Public Offerings', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kors, Michael', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'DuPont Company', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-12T04:40:41+0000', 'document_type'