thout-leonhard/', 'snippet': 'Safety Jim Leonhard hurt his right knee after a second-quarter interception, and may have sustained a season-ending injury for the second straight year.', 'lead_paragraph': 'EAST RUTHERFORD, N.J. – At Eric Smith’s locker after the Jets’ victory Sunday, one topic was off-limits, and it had nothing to do with the playoffs. Smith declined to answer any questions about Jim Leonhard, who hurt his right knee after a second-quarter interception. Smith did not know the severity of Leonhard’s injury, he said, so don’t bother asking. He did not want to speculate.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Jets Face a Future Without Leonhard', 'kicker': 'The Fifth Down', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Leonhard, Jim', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Jets', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-12T05:19:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Shpigel', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Shpigel', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fa4b2290-dabb-5ec0-9b26-603be36587e8', 'word_count': 335, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fa4b2290-dabb-5ec0-9b26-603be36587e8'}, {'abstract': 'The Giants snapped a four-game losing streak in the most dramatic of fashions, battling back against the Dallas Cowboys after trailing by 12 with just under six minutes remaining.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/12/sports/football/giants-land-final-blow-in-slugfest-with-the-cowboys.html', 'snippet': 'The Giants snapped a four-game losing streak in the most dramatic of fashions, battling back against the Dallas Cowboys after trailing by 12 with just under six minutes remaining.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ARLINGTON, Tex. — Brandon Jacobs pushed his way through the line, churning his legs and pumping his arms and straining for the end zone, his torso bowed as if the whole of the Giants’ season was lying across his back. And it was.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/13/sports/sub-final-giants/sub-final-giants-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 412, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/12/13/sports/sub-final-giants/sub-final-giants-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 412}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/13/sports/sub-final-giants/sub-final-giants-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 804, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/13/sports/sub-final-giants/sub-final-giants-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/13/sports/sub-final-giants/sub-final-giants-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Giants Ice Cowboys and Their Skid', 'kicker': 'Giants 37, Cowboys 34', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Giants Ice Cowboys and Their Skid', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Manning, Eli', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Dallas Cowboys', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tuck, Justin', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Giants', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 5, 'm