account-of-tax-fight/', 'snippet': 'John H. Sununu, a former New Hampshire governor, disputed Newt Gingrich’s account of an event in 1990  that many believe cost the elder George Bush his re-election.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDONDERRY, N.H. — The rivalry between the surging Newt Gingrich and Mitt Romney in Mr. Romney’s backyard bastion of New Hampshire took a new twist Monday over competing memories of events surrounding the elder George Bush’s breaking of his “no new taxes” pledge. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Sununu Disputes Gingrich Account of Tax Fight', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Taxation', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gingrich, Newt', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Romney, Mitt', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sununu, John H', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-12T16:43:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Trip Gabriel', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Trip', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gabriel', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6ececa76-69e6-55d5-a143-85b6d5f20d7c', 'word_count': 417, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6ececa76-69e6-55d5-a143-85b6d5f20d7c'}, {'abstract': 'Mitch Winehouse says he would never allow his daughter’s music to be used in a movie about her life.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/12/amy-winehouses-father-against-planned-biopic/', 'snippet': 'Mitch Winehouse says he would never allow his daughter’s music to be used in a movie about her life.', 'lead_paragraph':