nied visas to enter the United ...', 'lead_paragraph': 'Organizers hoping to send the Canadian team to play the Ugandan team that was kept from the Little League World Series because the players’ visas were denied have announced they have raised enough money to make the trip happen.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Uganda-Canada Game to Happen After All', 'kicker': 'Bats', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Little League World Series', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hoffman, Ruth', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Little League Baseball and Softball', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Uganda', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-12T21:54:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Lynn Zinser', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Lynn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Zinser', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/532c1a5a-a198-50f4-a823-9135cb17c0c0', 'word_count': 328, 'uri': 'nyt://article/532c1a5a-a198-50f4-a823-9135cb17c0c0'}, {'abstract': 'The Henry Hudson Bridge, which is 75 years old and crosses the Harlem River, seems to be in a constant state of construction.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/12/75-years-old-and-showing-its-age/', 'snippet': 'The Henry Hudson Bridge, which is 75 years old and crosses the Harlem River, seems to be in a constant state of construction.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On Monday, the Henry Hudson Bridge – that triumphalist crossing over the Harlem River, a steel archway slicing through a verdant vista of water, trees and cliffs – celebrates its diamond anniversary, the 75th. And like many older citizens of New York City, the bridge has had its share of wear-and-tear.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'For Bridge Built Long Ago, No End to Repairs', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bridges and Tunnels', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'E-ZPass', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Infrastructure (Public Works)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tolls', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Moses, Robert', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Metropolitan Transportation Authority', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-12T21:59:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael M. Grynbaum', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d82274b3-b9d6-5655-9cdc-49dd2e46ec0d', 'word_count': 903, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d82274b3-b9d6-5655-9cdc-49dd2e46ec0d'}, {'abstract': 'A century at the South Pole, the gift of giving and the dangers of using your head.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/audio/2011/12/13/science/science13.html', 'snippet': 'A century at the South Pole, the gift of giving and the dangers of using your head.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A century at the South Pole, the gift of giving and the dangers of using your head.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A century at the South Pole, the gift of giving and the dangers of using your head.', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': No