': 'Why it’s OK to require drug tests for particular jobs, but not for federal benefits.', 'web_url': 'https://takingnote.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/12/drug-testing-and-probable-cause-a-response-to-readers/', 'snippet': 'Why it’s OK to require drug tests for particular jobs, but not for federal benefits.', 'lead_paragraph': 'My post today about a proposal to allow drug testing of\xa0 anyone collecting unemployment benefits produced a few comments along these lines: I had to submit to a drug test for my new job. What’s the difference?', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Drug-Testing and Probable Cause, a Response to Readers', 'kicker': 'Taking Note', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Unemployment Insurance', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-12T22:54:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Rosenthal', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rosenthal', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6f5efc33-d9ef-575e-9710-306979088a88', 'word_count': 215, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6f5efc33-d9ef-575e-9710-306979088a88'}, {'abstract': 'Revelations, part of the Assassin’s Creed series, is set in 16th-century Constantinople and within the mind of a present-day character.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/13/arts/video-games/revelations-latest-assassins-creed-video-game-by-ubisoft.html', 'snippet': 'Revelations, part of the Assassin’s Creed series, is set in 16th-century Constantinople and within the mind of a present-day character.', 'lead_paragraph': 'And when the game studios come before you, you shall judge them by their sequels.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Tim