d subjected to pat-downs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I TRAVELED from Tampa, Fla., to Manhattan over the weekend. What a pleasure! Nobody hollered at me to sit down or turn off my electronic devices. Nobody warned me to obey all instructions from crew members.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/13/business/Road/Road-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 870, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/13/business/Road/Road-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/13/business/Road/Road-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'On a Long Train Trip, Rare Pleasures Return', 'kicker': 'On the Road', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'On a Long Train Trip, Rare Pleasures Return', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Railroads', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'AIRLINES AND AIRPLANES', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Business Travel', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-12T23:19:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Joe Sharkey', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Joe', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sharkey', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d6a913d1-401f-5938-a167-864a472cee9b', 'word_count': 913, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d6a913d1-401f-5938-a167-864a472cee9b'}, {'abstract': 'A musicians’ union is handing out leaflets at a jazz club as it begins a campaign to gain pension benefits and a minimum wage for jazz artists.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/13/arts/music/jazz-musicians-campaign-for-pensions.html', 'snippet': 'A musicians’ union is handing out leaflets at a jazz club as it begins a campaign to gain pension benefits and a minimum wage for jazz artists.', 'lead_paragraph': 'New York City’s musicians’ union has begun leafleting outside a major jazz club, the first salvo in what union leaders say is a campaign to gain pension benefits and a minimum wage for jazz artists.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/13/arts/SUB-BLUENOTE/SUB-BLUENOTE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/12/13/arts/SUB-BLUENOTE/SUB-BLUENOTE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/13/arts/SUB-BLUENOTE/SUB-BLUENOTE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 617, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/13/arts/SUB-BLUENOTE/SUB-BLUENOTE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/13/arts/SUB-BLUENOTE/SUB-BLUENOTE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Jazz Musicians Start a Pension Push', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Jazz Musicians Start a Pension Push', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Jazz Foundation of America', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Jazz', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'},