onday concluded with the Los Angeles Clippers breaking off a deal to acquire Chris Paul and the Orlando Magic affirming their efforts to keep Dwight Howard.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/13/sports/basketball/proposals-are-traded-but-paul-remains-with-hornets.html', 'snippet': 'A whirlwind of nonactivity Monday concluded with the Los Angeles Clippers breaking off a deal to acquire Chris Paul and the Orlando Magic affirming their efforts to keep Dwight Howard.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LOS ANGELES — The hunt for Chris Paul, also known as the journey to nowhere, was back where it started on Monday, when the Los Angeles Clippers broke off talks about acquiring him.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/13/sports/YJPNBA/YJPNBA-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 393, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/12/13/sports/YJPNBA/YJPNBA-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 393}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/13/sports/YJPNBA/YJPNBA-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 892, 'width': 692, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/13/sports/YJPNBA/YJPNBA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/13/sports/YJPNBA/YJPNBA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'With N.B.A. Apparently Wanting More, the Clippers Halt Talks for Paul', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'With N.B.A. Apparently Wanting More, the Clippers Halt Talks for Paul', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'nam