Chiefs and Dolphins.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'There’s Plenty of Room in Coach', 'kicker': 'Leading Off', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'There’s Plenty of Room in Coach', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Haley, Todd', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Basketball Assn', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Football League', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sparano, Tony', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-13T17:09:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Lynn Zinser', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Lynn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Zinser', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6c42aeab-2cd8-5fc3-9712-9883761e7525', 'word_count': 696, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6c42aeab-2cd8-5fc3-9712-9883761e7525'}, {'abstract': "Many teachers say they are ready to trade in the imagery of apples, A B C's and chalkboards for a more high-tech branding of the classroom. How would you redesign teachers?", 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/schoolbook/2011/12/13/how-would-you-brand-21st-century-teachers/', 'snippet': "Many teachers say they are ready to trade in the imagery of apples, A B C's and chalkboards for a more high-tech branding of the classroom. How would you redesign teachers?", 'lead_paragraph': '', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'How Would You Brand 21st-Century Teachers?', 'kicker': 'SchoolBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-12-13T17:10:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Education', 'byline': {'original':