'abstract': 'A letter writer responds to a column by Charles M. Blow.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/14/opinion/my-brothers-hazing.html', 'snippet': 'A letter writer responds to a column by Charles M. Blow.', 'lead_paragraph': 'To the Editor:', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '34', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'My Brother’s Hazing', 'kicker': 'Letter', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'My Brother&#8217;s Hazing', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hazing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fraternities and Sororities', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-13T23:59:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Letters', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Letter', '_id': 'nyt://article/234a888f-6168-5c0b-9f51-bdb39445b799', 'word_count': 168, 'uri': 'nyt://article/234a888f-6168-5c0b-9f51-bdb39445b799'}, {'abstract': 'Defying a veto threat from President Obama, the House passed a bill extending a cut in Social Security payroll taxes, but the Democratic majority in the Senate vowed to reject it.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/14/us/politics/house-passes-extension-of-payroll-tax-cut.html', 'snippet': 'Defying a veto threat from President Obama, the House passed a bill extending a cut in Social Security payroll taxes, but the Democratic majority in the Senate vowed to reject it.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Defying a veto threat from President Obama, the House on Tuesday passed a bill extending a cut in Social Security payroll taxes for 160 million Americans for another year. But the Democratic majority in the Senate vowed to reject the measure because of objections to other provisions, including one to speed construction of an oil pipeline from Canada to the Gulf Coast.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source