ttan-higher-ceilings-and-lots-of-light-attract-businesses.html', 'snippet': 'The old model of Manhattan office space is fading as companies seek more loftlike accommodations.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The 28th floor of the office building at 499 Park Avenue has 17-foot-high windows that run from floor to ceiling on four sides, and they offer views clear to the George Washington Bridge and to airplanes taking off from La Guardia and Newark airports. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/14/business/ODD/ODD-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 370, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/12/14/business/ODD/ODD-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 370}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/14/business/ODD/ODD-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 636, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Offices With More Breathing Room', 'kicker': 'Square Feet', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Offices With More Breathing Room', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Restoration and Renovation', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'SKIDMORE OWINGS & MERRILL', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Rockefeller Center (NYC)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Jones Lang LaSalle Inc', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Park Avenue (NYC)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Real Estate (Commercial)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Conde Nast Publications Inc', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-14T02:37:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_d