: She managed to escape much of the suffering shared by the millions of sex workers trafficked throughout the world, and even saw two of her traffickers forced out of the country and back to Mexico.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '33', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/14/nyregion/LIVERY/LIVERY-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/12/14/nyregion/LIVERY/LIVERY-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/14/nyregion/LIVERY/LIVERY-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/14/nyregion/LIVERY/LIVERY-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/14/nyregion/LIVERY/LIVERY-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Shining Light on the Role of Drivers in Prostitution', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Shining Light on the Role Of Drivers in Prostitution', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Taxicabs and Taxicab Drivers', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Human Trafficking', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Taxi and Limousine Commission', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Prostitution', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-14T03:08:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'sectio