idential-campaign-strategies.html', 'snippet': 'President Obama’s political strategists have identified a variety of paths to reach the 270 electoral votes he needs to win re-election.', 'lead_paragraph': 'President Obama’s political strategists have identified a variety of paths to reach the 270 electoral votes he needs to win re-election.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Survey of Democratic Presidential Strategies', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kerry, John', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2004', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-14T04:06:55+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'U.S.', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Interactive Feature', '_id': 'nyt://interactive/baff0106-6f70-5da2-91f7-04298a103d64', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://interactive/baff0106-6f70-5da2-91f7-04298a103d64'}, {'abstract': 'The redesign of YouTube is cleaner and more regular, but some of its grab bag charm is gone.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/14/arts/television/youtube-redesign-herds-those-funny-cats.html', 'snippet': 'The redesign of YouTube is cleaner and more regular, but some of its grab bag charm is gone.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If you’re looking for evidence that the world just keeps moving faster, try this:', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/14/arts/youtube-1/youtube-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 901, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/14/arts/youtube-1/youtube-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/14/arts/youtube-1/youtube-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A New YouTube, Herding the Funny Cats', 'kicker': 'Critic’s Notebook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A New YouTube, Herding the Funny Cats', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'YouTube.com', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-14T04:26:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Television', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mike Hale', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mike', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hale', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/57e53c81-7723-5988-944d-b311e89ee74a', 'word_count': 1405, 'uri': 'nyt://article/57e53c81-7723-5988-944d-b311e89ee74a'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Helms, a decorated pilot, helped restore the nation’s crippled air traffic control system under President Reagan, but later resigned under a cloud after charges of unethical behavior.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/14/us/j-lynn-helms-who-led-the-faa-dies-at-86.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Helms, a decorated pilot, helped restore the nation’s crippled air traffic control system under President Reagan, but later resigned under a cloud after charges of unethical behavior.', 'lead_paragraph': 'J. Lynn Helms, who as head of the Federal Aviation Administration supported President Ronald Reagan’s decision to fire more than 11,000 striking air traffic controllers and who subsequently helped restore the nation’s crippled air traffic control system, died on Sunday at his home in Westport, Conn. He was 86.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/14/us/HELMS-obit/HELMS-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 960, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/14/us/HELMS-obit/HELMS-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/14/us/HELMS-obit/HELMS-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'J. Lynn Helms, Who Led the F.A.A., Dies at 86', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'J. Lynn Helms, 86, Dies; Led the F.A.A.', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Federal Aviation Administration', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'AIR TRAFFIC CONTROL', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Reagan, Ronald Wilson', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-14T04:43:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bruce Weber', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bruce', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Weber', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/f4a4c558-b19a-535e-bc89-6da960997cb0', 'word_count': 751, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f4a4c558-b19a-535e-bc89-6da960997cb0'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Schneider’s films, like “Easy Rider” and “The Last Picture Show,” helped define the social unrest of the late 1960s and early ’70s.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/14/movies/bert-schneider-producer-of-easy-rider-dies-at-78.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Schneider’s films, like “Easy Rider” and “The Last Picture Show,” helped define the social unrest of the late 1960s and early ’70s.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Bert Schneider, a producer of “Easy Rider” and other films that reflected and helped define the social unrest of the late 1960s and early ’70s, died on Monday in Los Angeles. He was 78. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/14/arts/SCHNEIDER-obit/SCHNEIDER-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 819, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/14/arts/SCHNEIDER-obit/SCHNEIDER-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/14/arts/SCHNEIDER-obit/SCHNEIDER-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Bert Schneider, Producer Whose Films Reflected an Era, Dies at 78', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Bert Schneider, 78, Producer Whose Films Reflected an Era', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-14T04:46:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By Anita Gates', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Anita', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gates', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/6b3014de-6e49-5af6-ba83-20bf7eac1a67', 'word_count': 638, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6b3014de-6e49-5af6-ba83-20bf7eac1a67'}, {'abstract': 'Ms. Wilson built a public career as a teacher of the domestic arts that paralleled that of Julia Child.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/14/nyregion/erica-wilson-dies-at-83-led-a-rebirth-of-needleworking.html', 'snippet': 'Ms. Wilson built a public career as a teacher of the domestic arts that paralleled that of Julia Child.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Erica Wilson, the Julia Child of needlework, who brought the gentle art of crewel — as well as cross-stitch, needlepoint and other traditional embroidery techniques — to an international audience through her books, television shows, correspondence courses, syndicated column and retail shops, died on Tuesday in Manhattan. She was 83.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/14/nyregion/WILSON-obit/WILSON-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/12/14/nyregion/WILSON-obit/WILSON-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/14/nyregion/WILSON-obit/WILSON-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 628, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/14/nyregion/WILSON-obit/WILSON-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'hei