ecoder.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/14/new-services-at-univision-and-hulu-focus-on-latino-viewers/', 'snippet': 'Univision is introducing a mobile site for its video content, and Hulu announced that it was creating Hulu Latino.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Viewers who don’t get up early enough to watch the latest installment of the morning show Despierta América on Univision will now be able to watch clips from the show on their mobile phones. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'New Services at Univision and Hulu Focus on Latino Viewers', 'kicker': 'Media Decoder', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ADVERTISING AND MARKETING', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Spanish Language', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Hulu.com', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Univision', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-14T21:21:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tanzina Vega', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tanzina', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Vega', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f5e61d3c-6d51-59f6-8222-b18cf69ccb74', 'word_count': 314, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f5e61d3c-6d51-59f6-8222-b18cf69ccb74'}, {'abstract': 'Windows 7 users can make their windows disappear so that they get a clear look at their desktop. Here’s how to turn on — and off — that shortcut.', 'web_url': 'https://gadgetwise.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/14/tip-of-the-week-sneaking-a-peek-at-your-desktop/', 'snippet': 'Windows 7 users can make their windows disappear so that they get a clear look at their desktop. Here’s how to turn on — and off — that shortcut.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For Windows 7 users, passing the cursor over the Show Desktop button (that thin vertical sliver on the far right side of the Taskbar) is a handy way to glance at the computer’s desktop, even with a screen full of open windows. But for those who accidentally brush the mouse over the button and get distracted by the disappearing documents on the screen, there is a way to disable the Show Desktop button — just right-click on the Show Desktop button and remove the checkmark next to “Peek at desktop.” Later, if you want to restore your peeking powers, right-click the Show Desktop button again and re-select the option.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Tip of the Week: Sneaking a Peek at Your Desktop', 'kicker': 'Gadgetwise', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-12-14T21:22:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'subsection_name': 'Personal Tech', 'byline': {'original': 'By J.d. Biersdorfer', 'person': [{'firstname': '', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7cfbae1a-0129-586a-8e96-f5f475f81978', 'word_count': 109, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7cfbae1a-0129-586a-8e96-f5f475f81978'}, {'abstract': 'The Giving Spree continues with more gifts to give and get from T’s friends and family.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/14/the-giving-spree-alison-mosshart/', 'snippet': 'The Giving Spree continues with more gifts to give and get from T’s friends and family.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Who: Alison Mosshart,\xa0 lead singer of the Kills.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Giving Spree | Alison Mosshart', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'su