l', 'snippet': 'Unveiled at a party Tuesday night at the Kiki de Montparnasse shop, the collection of lace-embellished, lace-panel, vintage-style slips, kimonos, satin corselets and fancy underpinnings.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Unveiled at a party Tuesday night at the Kiki de Montparnasse shop, the collection of lace-embellished, lace-panel, vintage-style slips, kimonos, satin corselets and fancy underpinnings.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/15/fashion/20111215-ROITFIELD-slide-KEJZ/20111215-ROITFIELD-slide-KEJZ-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/15/fashion/20111215-ROITFIELD-slide-KEJZ/20111215-ROITFIELD-slide-KEJZ-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/15/fashion/20111215-ROITFIELD-slide-KEJZ/20111215-ROITFIELD-slide-KEJZ-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Carine Roitfeld’s Daughter Builds Her Own Empire', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Models (Professional)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Lingerie and Underwear', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shopping and Retail', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Retoin Roitfeld, Julia', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-14T21:58:30+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'Fashion & Style', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_materi