: 'Building an Empire of Her Own', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Building an Empire of Her Own', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Roitfeld, Carine', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parties (Social)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Lingerie and Underwear', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'SoHo (NYC)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'French Vogue', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-14T21:59:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ruth La Ferla', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ruth', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'La Ferla', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4045abc9-5d7d-527c-8da9-d51ff8fd894f', 'word_count': 880, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4045abc9-5d7d-527c-8da9-d51ff8fd894f'}, {'abstract': 'David Bomford has been acting director of the J. Paul Getty Museum in Los Angeles since 2010.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/14/getty-museums-acting-director-is-leaving/', 'snippet': 'David Bomford has been acting director of the J. Paul Getty Museum in Los Angeles since 2010.', 'lead_paragraph': 'David Bomford, who has been acting director of the J. Paul Getty Museum in Los Angeles since 2010, will be returning to his home in London where he plans to pursue research, scholarship and writing, the institution announced on Tuesday. Mr. Bomford joined the Getty in 2007 as associate director for collections and was named its acting director after Michael Brand resigned in 2010, citing differences with James N. Wood, who was then the president and chief executive of the Getty Trust, the umbrella organization that oversees the museum. Mr. Wood died later that year and was replaced by James Cuno, the former director of the Art Institute of Chicago.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Getty Museum’s Acting Director is Leaving', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Museums', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cuno, James', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wood, James N', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Getty, J Paul, Museum', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Los Angeles (Calif)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-14T22:01:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Carol Vogel', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Carol', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Vogel', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ea657704-57dc-5e85-9887-d56e3b1761e2', 'word_count': 146, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ea657704-57dc-5e85-9887-d56e3b1761e2'}, {'abstract': 'Photographs from Iraq, Congo, Belgium and India.', 'web_url': 'https://lens.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/14/pictures-of-the-day-iraq-and-elsewhere-7/', 'snippet': 'Photographs from Iraq, Congo, Belgium and India.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Photographs from Iraq, Congo, Belgium and India.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Pictures of the Day: Iraq and Elsewhere', 'kicker': 'Lens', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Belgium', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'India', 'rank': 3,