r', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Phillip', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Alder', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/45fa543a-0cc8-5b00-9ae1-19a44f2b9602', 'word_count': 574, 'uri': 'nyt://article/45fa543a-0cc8-5b00-9ae1-19a44f2b9602'}, {'abstract': 'Newt Gingrich said he wanted to give a different kind of speech, and his talk at the University of Iowa lived up to that goal.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/14/gingrich-lecturing-on-brain-science-faces-protesters/', 'snippet': 'Newt Gingrich said he wanted to give a different kind of speech, and his talk at the University of Iowa lived up to that goal.', 'lead_paragraph': 'IOWA CITY – Newt Gingrich, in full professorial mode, stood at a lectern in front of a whiteboard decorated with his campaign signs on Wednesday and told an auditorium of college students that brain science research was not only “fascinating,” but “a way to fix the budget” over the next decades.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Gingrich, Lecturing on Brain Science, Faces Protesters', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gingrich, Newt', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'University of Iowa', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iowa', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-14T22:59:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Susan Saulny', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Susan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Saulny', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/58c7b3ae-2639-52ad-befe-af041a569fa2', 'word_count': 394, 'uri': 'nyt://article/58c7b3ae-2639-52ad-befe-af041a569fa2'}, {'abstract': 'The Yankees submitted a modest posting fee a few hours before the deadline on the chance that no one else made a significant bid for the Japanese pitcher Yu Darvish.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/15/sports/baseball/bidding-closes-on-darvish-with-at-least-one-team-in-the-mix.html', 'snippet': 'The Yankees submitted a modest posting fee a few hours before the deadline on the chance that no one else made a significant bid for the Japanese pitcher Yu Darvish.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Major League Baseball announced that at least one team, which it did not name, submitted a posting bid for the Japanese star pitcher Yu Darvish by the deadline late Wednesday afternoon. It is believed that at least a few teams, most notably the Texas Rangers and the Toronto Blue Jays, submitted bids to win the right to negotiate a contract with Darvish, the 25-year-old ace of the Hokkaido Nippon Ham Fighters.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Yankees Said to Bid for Darvish', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Yankees Said to Bid For Darvish', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Washington Nationals', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Darvish, Yu', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Nippon Professional Baseball', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Texas Rangers', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Toronto Blue Jays', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Major League Baseball', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-14T23:03:17+0000