tion site, for a hefty fee.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/15/fashion/vogues-archives-go-online.html', 'snippet': 'Every page of Vogue since 1892 is now available through a new subscription site, for a hefty fee.', 'lead_paragraph': 'THE ultimate pleasure of taking an online dip into the entirety of the Vogue archives — every issue since 1892 has been digitally scanned, page by page, and made available through a pricey new subscription site — is the sensation that it gives of falling into a fashion time machine and being shot out into different eras at random.', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/15/fashion/15ROW/15zROW-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 958, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/15/fashion/15ROW/15ROW-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/15/fashion/15ROW/15ROW-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': '1892, Now It’s Online', 'kicker': 'Front Row', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '1892, Now It’s Online', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Archives and Records', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Vogue', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Magazines', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-14T23:13:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Eric Wilson'