snippet': 'Discounts on blankets, sheets, rugs, tableware and more.', 'lead_paragraph': 'FTF Design Studio is reducing prices on all trays and accessories by 20 percent, through Wednesday (a small flat tray, regularly $335, is $268; the Umami tray, regularly $145, is $116); 137 Fifth Avenue (20th Street), (212) 925-0847, ftfdesignstudio.com.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/15/garden/15DEALS/15DEALS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 700, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/15/garden/15DEALS/15DEALS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/15/garden/15DEALS/15DEALS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Sales at DwellStudio and Others', 'kicker': 'Currents | Deals', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Sales to Cover Tables and Windows', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-12-14T23:17:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Home', 'section_name': 'Home & Garden', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rima Suqi', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rima', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Suqi', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7822768b-cd81-580f-997a-9d656d6395d1', 'word_count': 217, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7822768b-cd81-580f-997a-9d656d6395d1'}, {'abstract': 'Words With Friends, a Scrabble-like app, counts many celebrity devotees besides Alec Baldwin.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/15/fashion/word-game-app-attracts-the-a-list-noticed.html', 'snippet': 'Words With Friends, a Scrabble-like app, counts many celebrity devotees besides Alec Baldwin.', 'lead_paragraph': 'THERE’S a new addiction in Hollywood, apparently, but this one comes without the court-ordered 30-day rehab. Words With Friends, the Scrabble-like app, is not just popular, it seems, but cool among tastemakers in the entertainment industry and beyond. ', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/15/fashion/15NOTICED/15zNOTICED-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 708, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/15/fashion/15NOTICED/15NOTICED-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/15/fashion/15NOTICED/15NOTICED-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'An App With Friends in High Places', 'kicker': 'Noticed', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'An App With Friends In High Places', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computer and Video Games', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Celebrities', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Social Networking (Internet)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Friendship', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mobile Applications', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Baldwin, Alec', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-14T23:18:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alex Williams', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alex', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Williams', 'qualifie