s last week, a different set of voters expressed a new certainty they would elect a parliament that could stand up to the military council.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/15/world/middleeast/egyption-vote-enters-second-round-in-rural-areas.html', 'snippet': 'Emboldened by the results of the first round of elections last week, a different set of voters expressed a new certainty they would elect a parliament that could stand up to the military council.', 'lead_paragraph': 'GIZA, Egypt — Egyptians turned out to vote again Wednesday with a new confidence in a promised transition to civilian democracy amid signals that the ruling military council may be backing off its efforts to extend its power.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/15/world/egypt/egypt-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/12/15/world/egypt/egypt-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/15/world/egypt/egypt-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1022, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/15/world/egypt/egypt-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/15/world/egypt/egypt-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Egypt’s Rural Voters Get Their Turn in Elections', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Rural Egyptians Take Their Turn in Elections', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'v