lister and Porter Hovey took a Proustian approach to decorating a Brooklyn apartment, filling the space with memory-evoking pieces.', 'lead_paragraph': 'HOLLISTER AND PORTER HOVEY are sisters and bloggers known for their sense of style: their loft in Williamsburg, Brooklyn, layered with memento mori and vintage-store portraits, has attracted scores of admirers online. Still, they had never decorated anyone else’s home.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/15/garden/15LOCATION1_SPAN/15LOCATION1_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/12/15/garden/15LOCATION1_SPAN/15LOCATION1_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/15/garden/15LOCATION1_SPAN/15LOCATION1_SPAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 652, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/15/garden/15LOCATION1_SPAN/15LOCATION1_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/15/garden/15LOCATION1_SPAN/15LOCATION1_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Williamsburg Penthouse Marked With Memories', 'kicker': 'On Location', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Memories He Didn’t Know He Had', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Interior Design and Furnishings', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Williamsburg (NYC)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-14T23:40:23+0000', 'docum