 their nominations on Thursday, it will be clear — or clearer — who will have to start picking out gowns for the Oscars.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/15/movies/awardsseason/possible-nominees-look-toward-oscars.html', 'snippet': 'Wit the Golden Globes announcing their nominations on Thursday, it will be clear — or clearer — who will have to start picking out gowns for the Oscars.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The trophy race that culminates in the Oscars is moving into high gear this week, with a slew of critics’ groups and precursor awards, like the Screen Actors Guild and the Golden Globes, announcing their nominees. Soon enough it will be clear — or clearer — who will have to start picking out gowns and pretending not to have practiced their acceptance speeches.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/15/arts/bagger/bagger-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/12/15/arts/bagger/bagger-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/15/arts/bagger/bagger-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 752, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/15/arts/bagger/bagger-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/15/arts/bagger/bagger-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Oscar Hopefuls’ Campaign Strategies', 'kicker': 'The Carpetbagger', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Oscar Hopefuls’ Campaign Strategies', 'name': None, 'seo': 