e town house. Though the location is a secret (ticket buyers receive an e-mail with the place’s address), it’s a real living room, in a real brick-and-limestone town house built in the late 19th century. Embedding the audience in a living room was crucial to the play, said the producers, but finding one was a challenge.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/15/garden/15ROOMS_SPAN/15ROOMS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/12/15/garden/15ROOMS_SPAN/15ROOMS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/15/garden/15ROOMS_SPAN/15CURR3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/15/garden/15ROOMS_SPAN/15ROOMS_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/15/garden/15ROOMS_SPAN/15ROOMS_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Play That Unfolds in a Real Town House', 'kicker': 'Currents | Rooms', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In a Town House, Is It Staged or Real?', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Upper East Side (NYC)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Real Estate and Housing (Residential)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Rising Phoenix Repertory', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-14T