article/d19c5c3d-3277-5860-9899-5fbbaa45bcee'}, {'abstract': 'Quarterback Eli Manning cannot outsprint many pursuers, but he has bought enough time in the pocket to pass for 4,105 yards this season, a Giants record.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/15/sports/football/far-from-fast-giants-manning-thrives-under-pressure.html', 'snippet': 'Quarterback Eli Manning cannot outsprint many pursuers, but he has bought enough time in the pocket to pass for 4,105 yards this season, a Giants record.', 'lead_paragraph': 'EAST RUTHERFORD, N.J. — By any measure, Eli Manning is not a mobile quarterback. He is slow. He is awkward. He is, as his father, Archie, said, “not a runner.” ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/15/sports/Y-GIANTS/Y-GIANTS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 821, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/15/sports/Y-GIANTS/Y-GIANTS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/15/sports/Y-GIANTS/Y-GIANTS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Not Blessed With Fast Feet, Manning Escapes Heat With Quick Wits', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Slow Afoot, Manning Thrives With Quick Wits', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Manning, Eli', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Manning, Archie', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nicks, Hakeem', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cruz, Victor', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Giants', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'},