 feature called Timeline that makes a user’s entire history of photos, links and other items much more accessible with a single click.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/16/technology/facebook-brings-back-the-past-with-new-design.html', 'snippet': 'The social network is rolling out a revamped profile feature called Timeline that makes a user’s entire history of photos, links and other items much more accessible with a single click.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Remember those karaoke videos from three years ago that somehow wound up on Facebook? They were embarrassing for the few hours they spent at the top of your Facebook profile, and then they were buried under a cascade of new updates.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/16/technology/16facebook-span/16facebook-span-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/12/16/technology/16facebook-span/16facebook-span-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/16/technology/16facebook-span/16facebook-span-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 395, 'width': 720, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/16/technology/16facebook-span/16facebook-span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/16/technology/16facebook-span/16facebook-span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Your Life on Facebook, in Total Recall', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Your Life on Facebook, in Total R