g shindigs, anyway?)', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Host’s Risks at a Holiday Party', 'kicker': 'Bucks', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Holidays and Special Occasions', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parties (Social)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'MetLife Inc', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-15T17:41:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Your Money', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ann Carrns', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ann', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Carrns', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4a976ed2-a6b0-5098-9f92-99dcd8c87ddd', 'word_count': 273, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4a976ed2-a6b0-5098-9f92-99dcd8c87ddd'}, {'abstract': 'A fresh look at tensions over Monsanto and the arrival of “big ag” in Nepal.', 'web_url': 'https://dotearth.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/15/nepal-and-others-mull-monsantos-role-in-advancing-agriculture/', 'snippet': 'A fresh look at tensions over Monsanto and the arrival of “big ag” in Nepal.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Here’s a quick update on efforts to expand access to higher-yielding hybrid seed in Nepal. Even though the country already has lots of different varieties beyond their own traditional supplies, a recent plan to expand access to higher-yielding seed, facilitated by the United States Agency for International Development and involving Monsanto, hit a big roadblock, as was explored here not long ago (“In Nepal, Farmers Struggle as City Dwellers Fight Monsanto“).', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Nepal and Others Mull Monsanto’s Role in Advancing Agriculture', 'kicker': 'Dot Earth', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', '