 '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Interactive Feature', '_id': 'nyt://interactive/576c6a1a-8b5c-51b1-9671-e0653c678dab', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://interactive/576c6a1a-8b5c-51b1-9671-e0653c678dab'}, {'abstract': 'Jon S. Corzine, the former chief executive of the bankrupt MF Global, will be speaking Thursday to a Congressional subcommittee about the collapse of the brokerage and the loss of roughly $1 billion in customer money.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2011/12/15/live-blog-house-panel-hearing-on-mf-global-2/', 'snippet': 'Jon S. Corzine, the former chief executive of the bankrupt MF Global, will be speaking Thursday to a Congressional subcommittee about the collapse of the brokerage and the loss of roughly $1 billion in customer money.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Jon S. Corzine, the former chief executive of the bankrupt MF Global, will be speaking Thursday to a Congressional subcommittee about the collapse of the brokerage and the loss of roughly $1 billion in customer money. In his third trip to Capitol Hill in a week, Mr. Corzine is set to testify before the House Financial Services Oversight and Investigations Subcommittee. The hearing starts at 1 p.m.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Live Blog: House Panel Hearing on MF Global', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'MF Global Ltd', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-15T18:16:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Azam Ahmed and Michael J. de la Merced', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Azam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ahmed', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': 'de la Merced', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 