self time to be gracious.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'AS founder and guiding teacher of the Community Meditation Center in New York, Allan Lokos has an arsenal of tools for coping with stressful situations. When it comes to travel, he said, acceptance and awareness are key. “Accept that you can’t make the plane take off,” he advised; and when dealing with other travelers, “give yourself time to be gracious.”', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/18/travel/18PROFILE/18PROFILE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/18/travel/18PROFILE/18PROFILE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/18/travel/18PROFILE/18PROFILE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Peace While Traveling? Not Impossible.', 'kicker': 'Q&A', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Peace While Traveling? Not Impossible.', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Anxiety and Stress', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-15T21:02:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Travel', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rachel Lee Harris', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rachel', 'middlename': 'Lee', 'lastname': 'Harris', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Question', '_id': 'nyt://article/d365d614-6b68-524c-8174-02dc7b8e3c0d', 'word_count': 673, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d365d614-6b68-524c-8174-02dc7b8e3c0d'}, {'abstract': 'Greece has a reputation for having no surf, but there are in fact swells and a growing surfing scene to be found.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/18/travel/surfing-in-greece-the-waters-fine.html', 'snippet': 'Greece has a reputation for having no surf, but there are in fact swells and a growing surfing scene to be found.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BOLTS of lightning flashed in cobweb patterns overhead, the gray and storming sea sending wave after wave that crashed on the beach behind us. We paddled our borrowed surfboards furiously southward to avoid the whitewash, then, one by one, turned into the arching faces and rode them to shore. ', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/18/travel/18JOURNEYS_SPAN/18JOURNEYS_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/12/18/travel/18JOURNEYS_SPAN/18JOURNEYS_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/18/travel/18JOURNEYS_SPAN/18JOURNEYS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/18/travel/18JOURNEYS_SPAN/18JOURNEYS_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/18/travel/18JOURNEYS_SPAN/18JOURNEYS_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Surfing in Greece? The Water’s Fine', 'kicker': 'Journeys', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Surfing With the Ancients in Greece', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None