g period on Nov. 30, 2012.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Judge Criticizes Fox in Dodgers Rights Case', 'kicker': 'Bats', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bankruptcies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McCourt, Frank H Jr', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Fox Sports', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Los Angeles Dodgers', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Major League Baseball', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-15T22:18:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Richard Sandomir', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Richard', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sandomir', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3c8f750a-453f-5db4-906c-6fbc4c7deea6', 'word_count': 423, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3c8f750a-453f-5db4-906c-6fbc4c7deea6'}, {'abstract': 'With suspended sculptures, hallucinatory drawings and botanical installations, Ms. Bontecou travels to fabulous universes.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/16/arts/design/lee-bontecou-recent-work-sculpture-and-drawing.html', 'snippet': 'With suspended sculptures, hallucinatory drawings and botanical installations, Ms. Bontecou travels to fabulous universes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Freedman Art', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '35', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Lee Bontecou: ‘Recent Work: Sculpture and Drawing’', 'kicker': 'Art In Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Lee Bontecou: ‘Recent Work: Sculpture and Drawing’', 'name': None