i': 'nyt://article/13da1c35-32a9-5a2b-b76e-b40bcfb46a9f'}, {'abstract': 'Hilary Rhoda, Sandra Bullock and Jenna Lyons keep layers light.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/15/winter-wonders-streamlined/', 'snippet': 'Hilary Rhoda, Sandra Bullock and Jenna Lyons keep layers light.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Mild temperatures this fall and winter have driven women to keep layers light and cold-weather accessories (hat, scarf, mitten, muffs) in the closet. Here, the model Hilary Rhoda throws a biker-style shearling jacket over a clean sweater-skirt combination; the actress Sandra Bullock tightens a beautifully unembellished look with a bowed rope belt; and the J. Crew president Jenna Lyons opts for a tailored one-button coat and tricolored palette (black, white, camel; what could be easier?).', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Winter Wonders | Streamlined', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-12-15T22:20:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Edward Barsamian', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Edward', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Barsamian', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9a55ee51-7a7d-5d93-8567-5209e30a897f', 'word_count': 75, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9a55ee51-7a7d-5d93-8567-5209e30a897f'}, {'abstract': 'A selected guide to walks, talks, exhibitions and other events in New York, including holiday-season festivities.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/16/arts/spare-times-for-dec-16-22.html', 'snippet': 'A selected guide to walks, talks, exhibitions and other events in New York, including holiday-season festivities.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Around Town', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '28', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Spare Times for Dec. 16-22', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Spare Times', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parades', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-15T22:21:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Anne Mancuso', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Anne', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mancuso', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Schedule', '_id': 'nyt://article/aac0dcce-7474-5d07-a0eb-0e7235b37485', 'word_count': 2837, 'uri': 'nyt://article/aac0dcce-7474-5d07-a0eb-0e7235b37485'}, {'abstract': 'With Paul, Griffin and Jordan, the Clippers have their own Big Three.', 'web_url': 'https://offthedribble.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/15/how-chris-paul-will-make-deandre-jordan-better/', 'snippet': 'With Paul, Griffin and Jordan, the Clippers have their own Big Three.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Chris Paul’s influence alone will make the job of every single Clippers player significantly easier, a fact that is likely to translate into notable increases in production across the board. That’s good news for the already stellar Blake Griffin (who now has legitimate All-N.B.A. potential), but it’s even better news for the 22-year-old DeAndre Jordan, whom the Clippers recently re-signed (via an offer sheet from the Golden State Warriors) to a deal worth $43 million over four years.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'How Chris Paul Will Make DeAndre Jordan Better', 'kicker': 'Off the Dribble', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bledsoe, Eric', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Griffin, Blake', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Paul, Chris', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Williams, Mo', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Los Angeles Clippers', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Basketball Assn', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-15T22:22:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Basketball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rob Mahoney', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rob', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mahoney', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3cf56cba-5e3c-5cea-94fb-f8e098831fa7', 'word_count': 519, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3cf56cba-5e3c-5cea-94fb-f8e098831fa7'}, {'abstract': '2013 Mercedes-Benz SL-Class embedded slide show', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2011/12/15/automobiles/15mercedes-slideshow.html', 'snippet': '2013 Mercedes-Benz SL-Class embedded slide show', 'lead_paragraph': '2013 Mercedes-Benz SL-Class embedded slide show', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/15/automobiles/15mercedes-slideshow-slide-VNYK/15mercedes-slideshow-slide-VNYK-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 502, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '2013 Mercedes-Benz SL-Class embedded slide show', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Mercedes-Benz', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-15T22:22:05+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'Automobiles', 'section_name': 'Automobiles', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Slideshow', '_id': 'nyt://slideshow/02e4349b-4b46-5037-9a75-6e49a02ffe68', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://slideshow/02e4349b-4b46-5037-9a75-6e49a02ffe68'}, {'abstract': 'The two-man play “Farm Boy” is the plot sequel to and minimalist opposite of “War Horse.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/16/theater/reviews/farm-boy-war-horse-sequel-at-59e59-theaters-review.html', 'snippet': 'The two-man play “Farm Boy” is the plot sequel to and minimalist opposite of “War Horse.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'The theatrical adaptation of Michael Morpurgo’s children’s novel “War Horse” employs maximalist stagecraft, including dazzling puppetry, in the service of emotionally expansive storytelling. “Farm Boy,” the two-man, one-tractor play based on Mr. Morpurgo’s quasi sequel, is its minimalist opposite, a gentle tale of connection across generations, recounted with old-fashioned earnest simplicity.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/16/arts/FARM/FARM-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/12/16/arts/FARM/FARM-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/16/arts/FARM/FARM-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/16/arts/FARM/FARM-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/16/arts/FARM/FARM-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Lad and a Geezer Bond Over a Tractor', 'kick