 a sophisticated American spy drone on national television last week, Iran is said to be planning to invite local reporters and foreign diplomats to an even more spectacular display of pilotless hardware in the near future.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Amid Claims of More Captured Drones, a Report on Their Vulnerability', 'kicker': 'The Lede', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cyberwarfare', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drones (Pilotless Planes)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Military Aircraft', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United States Air Force', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iran', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-15T23:32:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By J. David Goodman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'J.', 'middlename': 'David', 'lastname': 'Goodman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2e6263f9-3fe8-59dd-b480-b732db4e5cdf', 'word_count': 977, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2e6263f9-3fe8-59dd-b480-b732db4e5cdf'}, {'abstract': 'The city’s rate rose to 8.9 percent in November, despite an increase in holiday-related hiring.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/15/city-jobless-rate-rises-exceeding-the-nations/', 'snippet': 'The city’s rate rose to 8.9 percent in November, despite an increase in holiday-related hiring.', 'lead_paragraph': 'New York City’s unemployment rate edged up to 8.9 percent in November despit