in Sioux City, Iowa, for the final debate before the Jan. 3 caucuses.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/15/live-blogging-the-fox-news-debate-in-iowa/', 'snippet': 'Seven candidates take the stage tonight in Sioux City, Iowa, for the final debate before the Jan. 3 caucuses.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Seven candidates take the stage tonight in Sioux City, Iowa, for the final debate before the Jan. 3 caucuses.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Live Blogging the Fox News Debate in Iowa', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-12-15T23:48:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fe4e0eb3-eee3-574c-9282-6be0ae261b34', 'word_count': 5406, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fe4e0eb3-eee3-574c-9282-6be0ae261b34'}, {'abstract': 'Alex Stapleton’s “Corman’s World: Exploits of a Hollywood Rebel” is a fond look at the influence of Roger Corman, a prolific director and prodigious nurturer of talent.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/16/movies/cormans-world-by-alex-stapleton-review.html', 'snippet': 'Alex Stapleton’s “Corman’s World: Exploits of a Hollywood Rebel” is a fond look at the influence of Roger Corman, a prolific director and prodigious nurturer of talent.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Near the end of Alex Stapleton’s affectionate and informative documentary “Corman’s World: Exploits of a Hollywood Rebel,” Martin Scorsese laments that young people these days are unaware of Roger Corman’s work and influence. Mr. Scorsese’s complaint is apt, and also kind of funny, since usually when people bemoan the cultural ignorance of the young they mean that the kids aren’t reading great literature or listening to classical music. Rarely will anyone express concern that our youth is insufficiently acquainted with “Caged Heat,” “The Cry Baby Killer” or “Monster From the Ocean Floor.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/16/arts/16SUBCORMAN/16SUBCORMAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/12/16/arts/16SUBCORMAN/16SUBCORMAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/16/arts/16SUBCORMAN/SUBCORMAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 868, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/16/arts/16SUBCORMAN/16SUBCORMAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/16/arts/16SUBCORMAN/16SUBCORMAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The King of the B-Movie and His A-List Following', 'kicker': "Movie Review | 'Corman’s World: Exploits of a Hollywood Rebel'", 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The King of the B-Movie And His A-List Following', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Documentary Films and Programs', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Corman, Roger', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-15T23:50:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By A.O. Scott', 'person': [{'firstname': 'A.', 'middlename': 'O.', 'lastname': 'Scott', 'qu