rth Africa Unrest (2010- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tear Gas', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Bahrain', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Manama (Bahrain)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-16T00:39:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Robert Mackey', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Robert', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mackey', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1e86cb05-42fa-5bb2-b2d8-1913ea008d5c', 'word_count': 534, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1e86cb05-42fa-5bb2-b2d8-1913ea008d5c'}, {'abstract': 'The Giants hope that a strong game from Brandon Jacobs last week at Dallas signals a revival of the team’s rushing attack.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/16/sports/football/the-giants-offense-is-on-the-upswing-as-jacobs-runs-downhill.html', 'snippet': 'The Giants hope that a strong game from Brandon Jacobs last week at Dallas signals a revival of the team’s rushing attack.', 'lead_paragraph': 'EAST RUTHERFORD, N.J. — For the past two seasons, Brandon Jacobs’s relationship with the Giants has been unsettled and seemingly changing all the time. He has moved to backup from his role as a starter. After flashes of success came periods of inconsistency. He has routinely found a way to upset the Giants’ order with his words and his actions.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/16/sports/y-giants/y-giants-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/12/16/sports/y-giants/y-giants-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}