rested in a police officer’s death, but it is unfair to portray her as indifferent to public safety.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/16/nyregion/as-mayor-lays-blame-on-judge-a-courts-chaotic-context-is-lost.html', 'snippet': 'It is fair to question Judge Evelyn Laporte’s handling of a defendant who was later arrested in a police officer’s death, but it is unfair to portray her as indifferent to public safety.', 'lead_paragraph': 'To hear Michael R. Bloomberg tell it, a judge put a dangerous criminal back on the streets because she couldn’t be bothered to make a simple phone call. “It’s not a lot of work to do to protect the public,” Mr. Bloomberg said Wednesday.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '34', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/16/nyregion/ABOUT1/ABOUT1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 987, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'As Mayor Lays Blame on Judge, a Court’s Chaotic Context Is Lost', 'kicker': 'About New York', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'As the Mayor Lays Blame on a Judge, a Court’s Chaotic Context Is Lost', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bloomberg, Michael R', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Brooklyn (NYC)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Figoski, Peter J', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pride, Lamont', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Police Department (NYC)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders and Attempted Murders', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Attacks on Police', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-16T02:58:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jim Dwye