gun and its ammunition in his luggage.', 'lead_paragraph': 'An influential Tea Party leader was arrested at La Guardia Airport early Thursday after he tried to board a flight with a semi-automatic handgun and its ammunition in his luggage, the authorities said. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '38', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Tea Party Group Leader Is Arrested at La Guardia', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Airport Arrest For Leader In Tea Party', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Firearms', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'LaGuardia Airport (NYC)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Port Authority of New York and New Jersey', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tea Party Movement', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-16T04:02:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sarah Maslin Nir', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sarah', 'middlename': 'Maslin', 'lastname': 'Nir', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2c272971-23b7-5d6e-b3dc-2d8babd29f08', 'word_count': 359, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2c272971-23b7-5d6e-b3dc-2d8babd29f08'}, {'abstract': 'The Irish author’s massive tomb in Paris has been cleansed of decades of lipstick markings and graffiti, and a plate glass wall erected as a deterrent.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/16/world/europe/oscar-wildes-tomb-sealed-from-admirers-kisses.html', 'snippet': 'The Irish author’s massive tomb in Paris has been cleansed of decades of lipstick markings and graffiti, and a plate glass wall erected as a deterrent.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARIS — In his dark comedy of 1893, “A Woman of No Importance,” Oscar Wilde has Mrs. Arbut