s so enamored with the dawn of cinema in new pictures like “The Artist,” which led the Golden Globe nominations on Thursday, and “Hugo,” which picked up a few nods as well. Watch and learn. Roll tape!', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Oh for the Early Days of  Film (and Film Promotion)', 'kicker': 'Carpetbagger', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-12-16T13:00:59+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Melena Ryzik', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Melena', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ryzik', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4e69972b-45b3-5c59-8cf0-05666c070e10', 'word_count': 138, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4e69972b-45b3-5c59-8cf0-05666c070e10'}, {'abstract': 'Carlyle is selling Diversified Machine after building up the car parts maker from assets purchased in a 2005 bankruptcy auction.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2011/12/16/carlyle-sells-diversified-machine-to-platinum-equity/', 'snippet': 'Carlyle is selling Diversified Machine after building up the car parts maker from assets purchased in a 2005 bankruptcy auction.', 'lead_paragraph': '9:44 a.m. | Updated The Carlyle Group announced on Friday that it had sold Diversified Machine, a maker of car parts, to Platinum Equity after a six-year effort to expand the business.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Carlyle Sells Diversified Machine to Platinum Equity', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mergers, Acquisitions and Divestitures', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Carlyle Group', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 