rl': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/18/arts/dance/looking-back-cunningham-morris-ratmansky-hallberg-and-cojocaru.html', 'snippet': 'From Cunningham to Alexei Ratmansky to David Hallberg and Alina Cojocaru, the dance names that made history and headlines in the past year.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ALTHOUGH it was evident that the final year of the Merce Cunningham Dance Company would be historic, there was no knowing which of his dances in 2011 would prove most rewarding in performance. Who would have known that “Quartet” (1982) would reveal itself to be an enduring masterpiece at the company’s Joyce Theater season in March? Robert Swinston, the company’s director of choreography, now dancing the role once inextricably linked to Cunningham himself onstage, kept the drama’s ambiguities alive on many levels. ', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/18/arts/18MACAULAY/18MACAULAY-jumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/18/arts/18MACAULAY/18MACAULAY-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/18/arts/18MACAULAY/18MACAULAY-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Grand Entrances and a Long Goodbye', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Grand Entrances And a Long Goodbye', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Mikhailovsky Opera and Ballet Theater', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Cunningham, Merce, Dance Co', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dancing', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'