, but when a car’s main attraction is the memories it evokes, rather than its outstanding performance or styling, the price will be low. And indeed they are.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/18/automobiles/collectibles/cheap-and-likely-to-remain-so.html', 'snippet': 'Vegas, Pintos and Gremlins still have their fans, but when a car’s main attraction is the memories it evokes, rather than its outstanding performance or styling, the price will be low. And indeed they are.', 'lead_paragraph': 'THOUGH millions of Vegas, Pintos and Gremlins were made during their production runs of nearly a decade, most are gone now, long since sent to the shredder. ', 'print_section': 'AU', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/18/automobiles/18COLL1/18COLL1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 210, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/12/18/automobiles/18COLL1/18COLL1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 210}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/18/automobiles/18COLL1/18COLL1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 357, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/18/automobiles/18COLL1/18COLL1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/18/automobiles/18COLL1/18COLL1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Cheap, and Likely to Remain So', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Cheap, and Likely to Remain So', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Ford Motor Co', 'rank': 1,