will promote traditional marriage, “between one man and one woman.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'LE MARS, Iowa — Laura Bush, a former librarian, dedicated herself as first lady to improving reading. Michelle Obama wants to help children become healthier. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Marcus Bachmann Outlines ‘First Spouse’ Agenda', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bachmann, Marcus', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bachmann, Michele M', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-16T18:49:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael D. Shear', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6a22412c-9594-50e4-a241-e2b241f4c090', 'word_count': 134, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6a22412c-9594-50e4-a241-e2b241f4c090'}, {'abstract': 'A selection of events this week.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/18/arts/dec-18-24.html', 'snippet': 'A selection of events this week.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Television', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/18/arts/18GUIDE2_SPAN/18GUIDE2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 300, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/12/18/arts/18GUIDE2_SPAN/18GUIDE2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 300}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/18/arts/18G