gs.nytimes.com/2011/12/16/avoiding-the-holidays-take-the-ferry/', 'snippet': 'Mayor Michael R. Bloomberg said the city’s Transportation Department did the right thing by skipping the Christmas trees, menorahs and holiday lights that in past years festooned the terminals used by the Staten Island Ferry.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Staten Island Ferry’s terminals are bereft of holiday décor this year. Commuters may grouse, but Mayor Michael R. Bloomberg said Friday that the city’s Transportation Department did the right thing by skipping the Christmas trees, menorahs and holiday lights that had festooned the terminals in previous years.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Avoiding the Holidays? Take the Ferry', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Christmas', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ferries', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bloomberg, Michael R', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Transportation Department (NYC)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-16T22:58:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kate Taylor', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kate', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Taylor', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c064872c-4f6f-5589-9639-7918cf6046d7', 'word_count': 457, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c064872c-4f6f-5589-9639-7918cf6046d7'}, {'abstract': 'All the fashion news of the week that’s fit to reprint.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/16/chic-in-review-lanvin-the-next-generation/', 'snippet': 'All the fashion news of the week that’s fit to reprint.', 'lead_paragraph': 'All the fashion news of the week that’s