County.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/18/nyregion/fruitcakes-that-are-destined-for-the-table-not-the-trash.html', 'snippet': 'Fruitcakes and plum pudding, perennial favorites for re-gifting or worse, find a much kinder fate when made from the best ingredients by three gifted bakers in Westchester County.', 'lead_paragraph': 'FRUITCAKES and plum pudding are holiday traditions right up there with inflatable reindeer and aerosol snow. These boozy variations on a theme of candied fruits, nuts, spices and extracts are generally garish and heavy-handed, a perennial favorite for re-gifting.', 'print_section': 'WE', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/18/nyregion/18DINEWE2/18DINEWE2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 673, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/18/nyregion/18DINEWE2/18DINEWE2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/18/nyregion/18DINEWE2/18DINEWE2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Gifts Destined for the Table, Not the Trash', 'kicker': 'Westchester Dining | Holiday Desserts', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Gifts Destined for the Table, Not the Trash', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kramer, Mark', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bakeries and Baked Products', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rose, Jill', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Westchester County (NY)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': '