, 'snippet': 'A weekly roundup of news reported from the country’s Bollywood industry.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In the upcoming “Don 2,” Priyanka Chopra plays Roma, a cop in hot pursuit of the mastermind criminal Don (played by Shah Rukh Khan) but also perhaps a little bit in love with him. His special name for her is “junglee bili,” or wild cat. Priyanka tells us what makes the action-thriller franchise special.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Newswallah: Bollywood Edition', 'kicker': 'India Ink', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bhansali, Sanjay Leela', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gowariker, Ashutosh', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Khan, Salman', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rukh Khan, Shah', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-17T05:43:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Anupama Chopra', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Anupama', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Chopra', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/062aab26-5042-5db6-969e-d49074120cd3', 'word_count': 543, 'uri': 'nyt://article/062aab26-5042-5db6-969e-d49074120cd3'}, {'abstract': 'Critics faulted the legislation, which doubles the maximum fines for safety violations on oil and gas pipelines, as weak.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/17/us/congress-passes-bill-bolstering-pipeline-safety-rules.html', 'snippet': 'Critics faulted the legislation, which doubles the maximum fines for safety violations on oil and gas pipelines, as weak.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A bill doubling the maximum fines that pipeline operators face for violations easily cleared the House and Senate this week, along with other provisions intended to strengthen rules on oil and gas pipeline safety that critics have faulted as weak. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Congress Passes Bill Bolstering Pipeline Safety Rules', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Congress Passes Bill Bolstering Pipeline Safety Rules', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Natural Gas', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Oil Spills', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Accidents and Safety', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Oil (Petroleum) and Gasoline', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Law and Legislation', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pipelines', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-17T05:45:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dan Frosch', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Frosch', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ceedf2d1-48b1-54fc-be5b-269e6d03da0b', 'word_count': 706, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ceedf2d1-48b1-54fc-be5b-269e6d03da0b'}, {'abstract': 'Economic growth and hiring will slow next year if the cuts expires, forecasters predict.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/17/us/analysts-say-economic-recovery-might-suffer-if-tax-break-is-allowed-to-expire.html', 'snippet': 'Economic growth and hiring will slow next year if the cuts expires, forecasters predict.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Economists are warning that the looming expiration of a temporary payroll tax 