 'uri': 'nyt://article/383c9f46-1b31-5d43-bd3d-76885aa25972'}, {'abstract': 'The Iraq war has informed, and sometimes limited, President Obama’s use of American power, including a lethal counterterrorism strategy and the effort to regain status in Asia.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/18/us/politics/iraq-war-shaped-obamas-foreign-policy-white-house-memo.html', 'snippet': 'The Iraq war has informed, and sometimes limited, President Obama’s use of American power, including a lethal counterterrorism strategy and the effort to regain status in Asia.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — President Obama has made good on his campaign pledge to end the Iraq war, portraying the departure of the last troops as a chance to turn to nation-building at home.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/18/world/DIPLO/DIPLO-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 857, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/18/world/DIPLO/DIPLO-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/18/world/DIPLO/DIPLO-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Iraq, a War Obama Didn’t Want, Shaped His Foreign Policy', 'kicker': 'White House Memo', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Iraq, a War Obama Didn’t Want, Shaped His Foreign Policy', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Far East, South and Southeast Asia and Pacific Areas', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Middle East and North Africa Unrest (2010- )', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'North Atlantic Treaty Organization', '