/2011/12/18/us/politics/how-newt-gingrich-saved-republican-primary-campaign.html', 'snippet': 'Abandoned by top aides, Newt Gingrich used the Republican debates, and a good deal of luck, to climb back into the primary race.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Early in October, Newt Gingrich was completing a busy three-day swing through South Carolina. He had met with Tea Party members and others, and despite bad poll numbers — fallout from a disastrous summer after his top aides quit en masse — he was beginning to sense a change in his fortunes. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '33', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/18/us/GINGRICH/GINGRICH-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/12/18/us/GINGRICH/GINGRICH-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/18/us/GINGRICH/GINGRICH-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 819, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/18/us/GINGRICH/GINGRICH-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/18/us/GINGRICH/GINGRICH-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Gingrich Survives Glare to Exploit the Spotlight', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Gingrich Survives Glare to Exploit the Spotlight', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gingrich, Newt', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presi