-15a0-52bf-9b32-2675a37ae943'}, {'abstract': 'Legions of veterans have a harder time finding work than other people their age, a situation officials say will worsen in coming years.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/18/business/for-youngest-veterans-the-bleakest-of-job-prospects.html', 'snippet': 'Legions of veterans have a harder time finding work than other people their age, a situation officials say will worsen in coming years.', 'lead_paragraph': 'COLUMBUS, Ohio — In Afghanistan, Cpl. Clayton Rhoden earned about $2,500 a month jumping into helicopters to chase down improvised explosive devices or check out suspected bomb factories.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/18/us/SUB-VETERANS-1/SUB-VETERANS-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/12/18/us/SUB-VETERANS-1/SUB-VETERANS-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/18/us/SUB-VETERANS-1/SUB-VETERANS-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 696, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/18/us/SUB-VETERANS-1/SUB-VETERANS-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/18/us/SUB-VETERANS-1/SUB-VETERANS-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'As Wars End, Young Veterans Return to Scant Jobs', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'As Wars End, Young Return To Scant Jobs', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', '