 seemed, from the moment the Knicks appeared before fans in their home arena for the first time since the end of the lockout.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/19/sports/basketball/garden-roars-for-real-as-knicks-practice.html', 'snippet': 'All was forgiven, it seemed, from the moment the Knicks appeared before fans in their home arena for the first time since the end of the lockout.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The lights dimmed just before noon Sunday at the newly remodeled Madison Square Garden, and 10,500 Knicks fans, eager to see their newly remodeled team after the long N.B.A. lockout, began to roar. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/19/sports/YKNICKS/YKNICKS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/12/19/sports/YKNICKS/YKNICKS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/19/sports/YKNICKS/YKNICKS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/19/sports/YKNICKS/YKNICKS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/19/sports/YKNICKS/YKNICKS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Garden’s Roar Sounds Genuine as Retooled Knicks Work Out', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Garden’s Roar Sounds Genuine As Retooled Knicks Work Out', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Madison Square Garden', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'