Havel, the Czech author, playwright and president, it is impossible to separate the artist’s politics from the politician’s art.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/19/theater/vaclav-havel-an-intertwining-of-artist-and-politician.html', 'snippet': 'With Vaclav Havel, the Czech author, playwright and president, it is impossible to separate the artist’s politics from the politician’s art.', 'lead_paragraph': 'With Vaclav Havel, the Czech author and playwright, it is impossible to separate the artist’s politics from the politician’s art. He was both a witness and a communicant, repeatedly exploring, in the words of the title of one of his essays, “the power of the powerless.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/19/theater/19havelside1/19havelside1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 843, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/19/theater/19havelside1/19havelside1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/19/theater/19havelside1/19havelside1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Melding of the Artist’s Politics and the Politician’s Art', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Melding of the Artist’s Politics and the Politician’s Art', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Havel, Vaclav', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Writing and Writers', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Politics and Government', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name'