 Kim remained an unknowable figure but fostered perhaps the last personality cult in the Communist world.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/19/world/asia/Kim-Jong-il-Dictator-Who-Turned-North-Korea-Into-a-Nuclear-State-Dies.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Kim remained an unknowable figure but fostered perhaps the last personality cult in the Communist world.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Called the “Dear Leader” by his people, Kim Jong-il presided with an iron hand over a country he kept on the edge of starvation and collapse, fostering perhaps the last personality cult in the Communist world even as he banished citizens deemed disloyal to gulags or sent assassins after defectors.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/19/world/asia/20111219_HTML_KIM-slide-B6HH/20111219_HTML_KIM-slide-B6HH-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 340, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/12/19/world/asia/20111219_HTML_KIM-slide-B6HH/20111219_HTML_KIM-slide-B6HH-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 340}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/19/world/asia/20111219_HTML_KIM-slide-B6HH/20111219_HTML_KIM-slide-B6HH-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 739, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/19/world/asia/20111219_HTML_KIM-slide-B6HH/20111219_HTML_KIM-slide-B6HH-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/19/world/asia/20111219_HTML_KIM-slide-B6HH/20111219_HTML_KIM-slide-B6HH-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Kim Jong-il, Dictator Who Turned North Korea Into a Nuclear State, Dies', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Kim Jong-il, Dictator Who Turned North Korea Into a Nuclear State, Dies', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kim Jong Il', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'International Relations', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'North Korea', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Nuclear Weapons', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-19T03:35:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By David E. Sanger', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': 'E.', 'lastname': 'Sanger', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/f2e4b20a-0a74-5e21-a14f-df0abe14d484', 'word_count': 2707, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f2e4b20a-0a74-5e21-a14f-df0abe14d484'}, {'abstract': 'In a report examining the quality and availability of legal representation in deportation cases, judges give a rating of “inadequate” to many lawyers who appeared before them.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/19/nyregion/judges-give-low-marks-to-lawyers-in-immigration-cases.html', 'snippet': 'In a report examining the quality and availability of legal representation in deportation cases, judges give a rating of “inadequate” to many lawyers who appeared before them.', 'lead_paragraph': 'They are often poorly prepared or make incoherent arguments in court. Some fail to present key evidence or witnesses. Others simply do not show up.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/19/nyregion/IMMIG/IMMIG-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 684, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/19/nyregion/IMMIG/IMMIG-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/19/nyregion/IMMIG/IMMIG-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'In a Study, Judges Express a Bleak View of Lawyers Representing Immigrants', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In a Study, Judges Express a Bleak View of Lawyers Representing Immigrants', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Judges', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Legal Profession', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Courts and the Judiciary', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Immigration and Emigration', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Katzmann, Robert A', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deportation', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-19T03:36:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kirk Semple', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kirk', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Semple', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/65db7f19-3ee1-51ec-b750-9cc5e7598ad4', 'word_count': 882, 'uri': 'nyt://article/65db7f19-3ee1-51ec-b750-9cc5e7598ad4'}, {'abstract': 'For the companies and entrepreneurs involved, a private market may be great, but that may not be the case for public market investors.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/19/business/private-investment-rounds-weaken-ipos.html', 'snippet': 'For the companies and entrepreneurs involved, a private market may be great, but that may not be the case for public market investors.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Facebook’s initial public offering will grab plenty of headlines in 2012. But as Zynga’s tepid debut last week shows, multiple private investment rounds and the ability to trade shares before going public mean slim pickings when public market investors finally get their chance to own Silicon Valley’s emerging heavyweights. That is one reason the average I.P.O. this year has wound up trading about 10 percent below its offer price.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/19/business/views/views-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 851, 'width': 895, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Private Investment Rounds Weaken I.P.O.’s', 'kicker': 'Reuters Breakingviews', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Private Markets Threaten I.P.O.’s', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mergers, Acquisitions and Divestitures', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'NStar', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Northeast Utilities', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'NRG Energy Inc', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Stocks and Bonds', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Electric Light and Power', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Initial Public Offerings', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-19T03:38:45+0000', 'document_type'