ee-online-courses-offering-certificates.html', 'snippet': 'The new online learning platform will provide access to online laboratories, self-assessments and student-to-student discussions.', 'lead_paragraph': 'While students at the Massachusetts Institute of Technology pay thousands of dollars for courses, the university will announce a new program on Monday allowing anyone anywhere to take M.I.T. courses online free of charge — and for the first time earn official certificates for demonstrating mastery of the subjects taught. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'M.I.T. Expands Its Free Online Courses', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'M.I.T. Plans to Expand Its Free Online Courses', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Massachusetts Institute of Technology', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Colleges and Universities', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'E-Learning', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-19T05:04:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'Education', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tamar Lewin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tamar', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lewin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ae53bb26-8e28-5b65-aa17-856ef41f9076', 'word_count': 556, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ae53bb26-8e28-5b65-aa17-856ef41f9076'}, {'abstract': 'Abdulla Chowdhury’s accounting degree meant little when he moved to the United States from Bangladesh; then his vision began to deteriorate.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/19/nyregion/little-to-show-for-work-ethic.html', 'snippet': 'Abdulla Chowdhury’s accounting degree meant little when he moved to the United States from Bangladesh; then his vision began to deteriorate.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Abdulla Chowdhury was telling the story of how he took his young daughter shopping recently for a winter coat, and the memory was enough to make him bury his head in his hands. In his wallet had been a $20 bill. On the coat rack, many options sure to please his daughter. But the cheapest coat cost $50. So the money stayed in his pocket and the coat remained on the rack. The moment crystallized one of Mr. Chowdhury’s worst fears: his inability to provide for his two children the way his parents had provided for him. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '27', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/19/nyregion/19NEEDIEST/19NEEDIEST-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/12/19/nyregion/19NEEDIEST/19NEEDIEST-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/19/nyregion/19NEEDIEST/19NEEDIEST-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 680, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/19/nyregion/19NEEDIEST/19NEEDIEST-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/19/nyregion/19NEEDIEST/19NEEDIEST-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Little to Show for Strong Work Ethic and a Degree', 'kicker': 'The Neediest Cases', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Little to Show for Strong Work Ethic and a Degree', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{