 throughout Rome will be open during Christmas and New Year’s, including Il Sanlorenzo, Roscioli, Nonna Betta  and Pipero al Rex.', 'web_url': 'https://intransit.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/19/dining-during-a-roman-holiday/', 'snippet': 'Many worthy restaurants throughout Rome will be open during Christmas and New Year’s, including Il Sanlorenzo, Roscioli, Nonna Betta  and Pipero al Rex.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Contrary to popular belief, visitors to Rome during the winter holidays are not doomed to eat in tourist traps or at McDonald’s. Many worthy restaurants throughout the city will be open during Christmas and New Year’s, albeit on abbreviated schedules. To handle the busy holiday season, many restaurants offer large, prix fixe tasting menus and, with a bit of planning, one can eat very well, for a price.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Dining During a Roman Holiday', 'kicker': 'In Transit', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Christmas', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'New Year', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Restaurants', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Rome (Italy)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-19T11:00:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': 'By Katie Parla', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Katie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Parla', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b3e7baa7-73aa-5bf3-9a6c-af395938352b', 'word_count': 360, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b3e7baa7-73aa-5bf3-9a6c-af395938352b'}, {'abstract': 'For all the progress women have made on many fronts in the United States, 