parately, under the planned regulatory overhaul.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — The British government plans stricter banking regulations that would force banks to separate their investment banking operations from those businesses that take deposits.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Britain Backs Banking Overhaul', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Banking and Financial Institutions', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Regulation and Deregulation of Industry', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Osborne, George', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "British Bankers' Association", 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Financial Services Authority', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Great Britain', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-19T18:00:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Julia Werdigier', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Julia', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Werdigier', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7d3f394d-c666-5adc-8e57-4a71d17367f5', 'word_count': 525, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7d3f394d-c666-5adc-8e57-4a71d17367f5'}, {'abstract': 'David Fincher’s adaptation of “The Girl With the Dragon Tattoo,” starring Rooney Mara and Daniel Craig, holds onto the vivid and passionate essence of the book.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/20/movies/the-girl-with-dragon-tattoo-movie-review.html', 'snippet': 'David Fincher’s adaptation of “The Girl With the Dragon Tattoo,” starring Rooney Mara and Daniel Craig, holds onto the vivid and passionate essence of the book.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Tiny as a sparrow, fierce as an eagle, Lisbeth Salander is one of the great Scandinavian avengers of our time, an angry bird catapulting into the fortresses of power and wiping smiles off the faces of smug, predatory pigs. The animating force in Stieg Larsson’s “Millennium” trilogy — incarnated on screen first by Noomi Rapace and now, in David Fincher’s adaptation of “The Girl With the Dragon Tattoo,” by Rooney Mara — Lisbeth is an outlaw feminist fantasy-heroine, and also an avatar of digital antiauthoritarianism.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/20/movies/20girl-span/20girl-span-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/12/20/movies/20girl-span/20girl-span-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/20/movies/20girl-span/20girl-span-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/20/movies/20girl-span/20girl-span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/20/movies/20girl-span/20girl-span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Tattooed Heroine Metes Out Slick, Punitive Violence', 'kicker': "Movie Review | 'The Girl With the Dragon Tattoo'", 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Brains, Beauty and No Lack of Beasts', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fincher, David', 'rank': 