 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/20/health/research/greater-behavioral-risks-for-preemies-at-preschool-age.html', 'snippet': 'Preterm boys in a study had more sleep and attention troubles than their full-term peers, and preterm girls were significantly more emotionally reactive, depressed and withdrawn.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Babies born only three weeks prematurely face an increased risk of behavioral and emotional problems as preschoolers, a new analysis has found. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Risks: More Woes for Preemies at Preschool Age', 'kicker': 'Vital Signs', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Risks: More Woes for Preemies at Preschool Age', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mental Health and Disorders', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Women and Girls', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Education (Pre-School)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Medicine and Health', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pregnancy and Obstetrics', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Premature Babies', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Children and Childhood', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-19T19:37:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Science', 'section_name': 'Health', 'subsection_name': 'Research', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nicholas Bakalar', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nicholas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bakalar', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e02ff41b-badc-5c6e-acd3-69be93d71df2', 'word_count': 230, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e02ff41b-badc-5c6e-acd3-69be93d71df2'}, {'abstract': 'Statins, among the most prescribed drugs for the preve