ath of a marching band member, possibly by hazing.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/20/us/spurning-governor-scott-florida-am-declines-to-suspend-ammons.html', 'snippet': 'Florida A&M’s trustees decided not to suspend the university’s president, James. H. Ammons, until the end of an investigation into the death of a marching band member, possibly by hazing.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MIAMI — Rebuffing the governor, Florida A&M’s board of trustees on Monday decided not to suspend the university’s president and asserted that it would “stand firm against outside influences, no matter how well intended.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/20/us/FLORIDA/FLORIDA-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 760, 'width': 684, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/20/us/FLORIDA/FLORIDA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/20/us/FLORIDA/FLORIDA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Rebuffing Governor, Florida A&M Declines to Suspend President in Student Death', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Rebuffing Governor, Florida A&M Declines to Suspend President in Student Death', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ammons, James H', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Suspensions, Dismissals and Resignations', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hazing', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Colleges and Universities', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Miami (Fla)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'person