aniasis: Extend Friendly American Hand to Iran? Doctor Says a Vaccine Is a Place to Start', 'kicker': 'Global Update', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Leishmaniasis: Extend Friendly American Hand to Iran? Doctor Says a Vaccine Is a Place to Start', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Baylor College of Medicine', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Medicine and Health', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Vaccination and Immunization', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iran', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-19T20:33:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Science', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Donald G. McNeil Jr', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Donald', 'middlename': 'G.', 'lastname': 'McNeil', 'qualifier': 'Jr', 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b5056aaa-eeb1-53bb-8ff2-5b3137b7b45a', 'word_count': 254, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b5056aaa-eeb1-53bb-8ff2-5b3137b7b45a'}, {'abstract': 'Among the perennial tools of battlefield underdogs, the 107-millimeter rocket has a secure place. First fielded by China and known as a Type 63,  it has been a consistent presence in recent wars.', 'web_url': 'https://atwar.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/19/more-on-maos-rockets-and-modern-war-part-iii/', 'snippet': 'Among the perennial tools of battlefield underdogs, the 107-millimeter rocket has a secure place. First fielded by China and known as a Type 63,  it has been a consistent presence in recent wars.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Among the perennial tools of battlefield underdogs, the 107-millimeter rocket has a secure place. Like the assault rifle, the rocket-propelled grenade and the makeshift bomb, this class of weapon, first fielded by China and known as a Type 63, has been a consistent presence in recent wars, used