ied on Friday at his home in Manhattan. He was 90.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/20/arts/television/20frazer-photo/20frazer-photo-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 793, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/20/arts/television/20frazer-photo/20frazer-photo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/20/arts/television/20frazer-photo/20frazer-photo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Dan Frazer, Fretful Supervisor on ‘Kojak,’ Dies at 90', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Dan Frazer, 90, Fretful Supervisor on ‘Kojak’', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-20T02:52:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Television', 'byline': {'original': 'By Paul Vitello', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Paul', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Vitello', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/6a5719d3-0c20-566a-add9-c91049191f58', 'word_count': 507, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6a5719d3-0c20-566a-add9-c91049191f58'}, {'abstract': 'A firefighter whose head and back became covered in flames as he battled a blaze at a Brooklyn brownstone escaped from a third-floor window Monday morning, but with