ashington.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/20/the-early-word-rejection/', 'snippet': 'Political news from today’s Times and around the Web, plus a look at what’s happening in Washington.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Today’s Times', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Early Word:  Rejection', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-12-20T11:00:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jada F. Smith', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jada', 'middlename': 'F.', 'lastname': 'Smith', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/15861cb8-36e2-5e2c-a950-1b7fdbdcfa48', 'word_count': 235, 'uri': 'nyt://article/15861cb8-36e2-5e2c-a950-1b7fdbdcfa48'}, {'abstract': 'A guide to traditional Christmas sweets to be found in Madrid’s bakeries.', 'web_url': 'https://intransit.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/20/a-guide-to-holiday-sweets-in-madrid/', 'snippet': 'A guide to traditional Christmas sweets to be found in Madrid’s bakeries.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In a nation collectively obsessed with the enjoyment of food, Spaniards make no exception for Christmas, especially those harboring a sweet tooth. With the holiday season in full swing, children and adults alike seek traditional Christmas sweets in Madrid’s bakeries.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Guide to Holiday Sweets in Madrid', 'kicker': 'In Transit', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bakeries and Baked Products', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Christmas', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'De