pet': 'A pizzeria with two outposts, one in Williamsburg and another in NoHo, offers pies that are baked and flash-fried, but the more traditional pizzas are mixed.', 'lead_paragraph': 'GIULIO Adriani is still trying to make his mark on New York. Mr. Adriani, an Italian pizzaiolo, seemed ready to teach the city a thing or two about authentic Naples-style pizza when he appeared on the scene last year — here was a man with four pizza world championships under his belt, a blistering-hot wood-burning oven and a chef’s coat with his name stitched on the back just in case you forgot who was working the peel.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/21/dining/21UNDER_SPAN/21UNDER-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/12/21/dining/21UNDER_SPAN/21UNDER-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/21/dining/21UNDER_SPAN/21UNDER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 685, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/21/dining/21UNDER_SPAN/21UNDER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/21/dining/21UNDER_SPAN/21UNDER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Forcella in NoHo, Pizza, Fired and Fried', 'kicker': '$25 and Under', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Fried, Fired, It’s Pizza', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pizza', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'NoHo (N