 a weekend together, the script hits its mark early and often. Yet shortly into the second act the humor begins to get recycled, and even the excellent cast can’t keep you from wishing that the writer had wrapped things up while his audience was laughing away. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/21/arts/21kiss/21kiss-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 726, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/21/arts/21kiss/21kiss-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/21/arts/21kiss/21kiss-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Two Lonely People Fumbling for Love', 'kicker': "Theater Review | 'Kissing Sid James'", 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Two Lonely People Fumbling for Love', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Brits Off Broadway Festival', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Farquhar, Robert', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-20T21:07:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Theater', 'subsection_name': 'Theater Reviews', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ken Jaworowski', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ken', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Jaworowski', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/15b287dd-0d68-5bc7-8937-473e50af3678', 'word_count': 315, 'uri': 'nyt://article/15b287dd-0d68-5bc7-8937-473e50af3678'}, {'abstract': 'A proposal from the Bloomberg administration and City Council would make it easier for property owners to add insulation to  exterior walls, for example, and install awnings, skylights, green roofs, solar panels and greenhouses.', 'web_url': 'https://green.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/20/new-york-plans-greener-zoning-rules/', 'snippet': 'A proposal from the Bloomberg administration and City Council would make it easier for property owners to add insulation to  exterior walls, for example, and install awnings, skylights, green roofs, solar panels and greenhouses.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Next month community boards around New York City will ring in the year by holding hearings on a proposal that city officials say will give buildings more freedom to increase their energy efficiency and produce their own power.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'New York Plans Greener Zoning Rules', 'kicker': 'Green', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fuel Efficiency', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Greenhouse Gas Emissions', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Real Estate and Housing (Residential)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Regulation and Deregulation of Industry', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Solar Energy', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Zoning', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Quinn, Christine C', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-20T21:09:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Science', 'subsection_name': 'Environment', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mireya Navarro', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mireya', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Navarro', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'orga