_count': 325, 'uri': 'nyt://article/71170da8-92c6-5752-8256-c08455017d70'}, {'abstract': 'Philadelphia has sustained an unusual number of head injuries in an unusual number of ways: a stick to the face, a puck to the helmet and a knee to the head among them.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/21/sports/hockey/flyers-dealing-with-more-head-injuries-than-other-nhl-teams.html', 'snippet': 'Philadelphia has sustained an unusual number of head injuries in an unusual number of ways: a stick to the face, a puck to the helmet and a knee to the head among them.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PHILADELPHIA — A standing-room-only crowd had already been forced to absorb an uncharacteristically merciless drubbing of the beloved Philadelphia Flyers on Saturday afternoon when a jarring replay flashed on the big screens above the ice late in the second period.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/21/sports/FLYERS/FLYERS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 240, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/12/21/sports/FLYERS/FLYERS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 240}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/21/sports/FLYERS/FLYERS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 410, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/21/sports/FLYERS/FLYERS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/21/sports/FLYERS/FLYERS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'First-Place Flyers Are Coping With Various Head Injuries', 'kicker': None, 'content_k