yarns with titles like “Cigars of the Pharaoh.” It was only a matter of time before Tintin went Hollywood. And, yowza, has he hit it big and hard in “The Adventures of Tintin,” a marvel of gee-wizardry and a night’s entertainment that can feel like a lifetime.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/21/arts/21jp-advent/21jp-advent-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/12/21/arts/21jp-advent/21jp-advent-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/21/arts/21jp-advent/21jp-advent-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 572, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/21/arts/21jp-advent/21jp-advent-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/21/arts/21jp-advent/21jp-advent-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Intrepid Boy on the Trail of Mysteries', 'kicker': "Movie Review | 'The Adventures of Tintin'", 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Intrepid Boy In Pursuit Of Mysteries', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Spielberg, Steven', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Remi, Georges', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bell, Jamie', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Frost, Nick', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Serkis, Andy', 'rank': 6, '