 heyday of the Capitol Theater here there were appearances by the likes of Traffic, Jefferson Airplane, Pink Floyd and Santana. The Grateful Dead logged 18 shows over an 11-month period, and Janis Joplin played her next-to-last show at the Capitol on Aug. 8, 1970, two months before she died. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/21/arts/capital-1/capital-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/12/21/arts/capital-1/capital-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/21/arts/capital-1/capital-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 747, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/21/arts/capital-1/capital-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/21/arts/capital-1/capital-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Live Music to Return to a Storied Theater', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Live Music to Return to a Storied Theater', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Port Chester (NY)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lamb, Thomas W', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Restoration and Renovation', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Rock Music', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Historic Buildings and Sites