organizations that serve the homeless in New York.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/21/arts/music/comfort-ye-with-lauren-flanigan-at-symphony-space-review.html', 'snippet': 'The soprano Lauren Flanigan leads a roster of singers a lively mix of opera arias, musical-theater standards and more in “Comfort Ye,” the annual concert to benefit organizations that serve the homeless in New York.', 'lead_paragraph': '“This year, my career took an interesting turn,” the soprano Lauren Flanigan said from the stage as she greeted an admiring throng at Symphony Space on Monday evening. “Rather than murder my numerous husbands onstage, I murdered a child.” The ensuing ripple of laughter from the hall had an uncertain edge. “I know,” Ms. Flanigan continued. “I wasn’t drunk, either. I did it all by myself.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/21/arts/comfort/comfort-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 718, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Concert Ranges From Happy to Happier', 'kicker': 'Music Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Concert Ranges From Happy to Happier', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Flanigan, Lauren', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Classical Music', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-20T22:57:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Steve Smith', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Steve', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Smith', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/31dcafd