ri': 'nyt://article/56c1db4c-2c26-5f5b-85e6-20085063ba21'}, {'abstract': 'Phil Simms and Marty Lyons remember a 27-21 Jets’ victory that deprived the Giants of the N.F.C. East title and the playoffs.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/21/sports/football/recalling-1988-when-jets-dashed-giants-hopes.html', 'snippet': 'Phil Simms and Marty Lyons remember a 27-21 Jets’ victory that deprived the Giants of the N.F.C. East title and the playoffs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There are precious few pivotal moments in Giants-Jets history, mostly because a majority of the meetings between the teams — particularly in recent years — have been casual preseason games, listless affairs that had about as much substance as a lecture on the last day of school. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/21/sports/YHISTORY1/YHISTORY1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 870, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/21/sports/YHISTORY1/YHISTORY1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/21/sports/YHISTORY1/YHISTORY1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Recalling 1988, When Jets Dashed Giants’ Hopes', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Last Time It Mattered This Much', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Simms, Phil', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Jets', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Giants', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'va