ibernation for extended stretches.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The 12 Games of Christmas: Americans Abroad on TV', 'kicker': 'Goal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soccer', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Dempsey, Clint', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Donovan, Landon', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Friedel, Brad', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Guzan, Brad', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Fulham (Soccer Team)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'West Ham United (Soccer Team)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Germany', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'London (England)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-21T16:15:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Soccer', 'byline': {'original': 'By John Godfrey', 'person': [{'firstname': 'John', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Godfrey', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5cb72fc4-424e-5fb3-92ca-82dad2f2975a', 'word_count': 1078, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5cb72fc4-424e-5fb3-92ca-82dad2f2975a'}, {'abstract': 'Keep it clean.', 'web_url': 'https://krugman.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/21/golly-gee/', 'snippet': 'Keep it clean.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I have to post this every once in a while: a lot of comments are being rejected because they contain obscenities that violate Times rules. And the sad thing, based on a random sample, is that many of the comments would have been useful contributions to the discussion except for one or two words.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'he