ayoffs approach.', 'web_url': 'https://fifthdown.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/21/thursday-matchup-texans-at-colts/', 'snippet': 'The Texans will try hard not to fade as the playoffs approach.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Texans at ColtsThursday, 8:20Line: Texans by 5 ½. It only took one loss to for the euphoria of the Texans’ first-ever division title to fade into pessimism about their playoff chances. The Texans are relying on third-string quarterback T.J. Yates to remain viable, top receiver Andre Johnson’s recovery from a pulled hamstring has been slow (he has been ruled out for Sunday), top pass rusher Mario Williams (torn pectoral muscle) is long gone, defensive coordinator Wade Philips is recovering from surgery, and Arian Foster has fumbled three times in four games as the strain of carrying the offense has taken its toll.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Thursday Matchup: Texans at Colts', 'kicker': 'The Fifth Down', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Johnson, Andre', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Manning, Peyton', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Williams, Mario', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Yates, T J', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Baltimore Ravens', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Houston Texans', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Indianapolis Colts', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Jets', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Pittsburgh Steelers', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Tennessee Titans', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-21T17:39:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 