pe, Apple’s FaceTime and Google chat to do things together that would otherwise require a plane ticket.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/22/garden/video-chat-reshapes-domestic-rituals.html', 'snippet': 'Far-flung families are increasingly using Skype, Apple’s FaceTime and Google chat to do things together that would otherwise require a plane ticket.', 'lead_paragraph': 'AFTER nightfall on Tuesday, the Darvick family of Birmingham, Mich., began their Hanukkah rituals, just as they had done for years.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/22/garden/22SKYPE_SPAN/22SKYPE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/12/22/garden/22SKYPE_SPAN/22SKYPE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/22/garden/22SKYPE_SPAN/22SKYPE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 824, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/22/garden/22SKYPE_SPAN/22SKYPE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/22/garden/22SKYPE_SPAN/22SKYPE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Video Chat Reshapes Domestic Rituals', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Comfort of One’s Screen', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Families and Family Life', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Holidays and Special Occasions', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Social