tto, a third-year defenseman, is flourishing this season and Brad Richards’s guidance is a primary reason.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/22/sports/hockey/rangers-del-zotto-rebounds-with-help-from-richards.html', 'snippet': 'Michael Del Zotto, a third-year defenseman, is flourishing this season and Brad Richards’s guidance is a primary reason.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As usual, Michael Del Zotto had dinner at a Manhattan restaurant Wednesday night with Brad Richards. The meal, on the eve of the Rangers’ game against the Islanders at Madison Square Garden, has become a ritual for the teammates. They also live in the same downtown apartment building. For Del Zotto, a third-year defenseman, Richards’s guidance is a primary reason he is flourishing after a season so disastrous, he could not even dismiss it as a sophomore slump.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/22/sports/RANGERS/RANGERS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 936, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/22/sports/RANGERS/RANGERS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/22/sports/RANGERS/RANGERS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Young Ranger Rebounds With Help From Richards', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Young Ranger Rebounds With Help From Richards', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tortorella, John', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hockey, Ice', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Rangers', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'nam