rk on Christmas Eve and Christmas Day. After that? No promises.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/22/christmas-may-offer-respite-for-gingrich/', 'snippet': 'The most brutal attack ads against Newt Gingrich will go dark on Christmas Eve and Christmas Day. After that? No promises.', 'lead_paragraph': '10:40 p.m. | Updated  The full report of this article is available here.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Christmas May Offer Respite for Gingrich', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Christmas', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gingrich, Newt', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Huckabee, Mike', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Romney, Mitt', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iowa', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Hampshire', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-22T13:30:59+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael D. Shear', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/66458e08-06dd-5b5e-9d08-c9cdcaec6d28', 'word_count': 746, 'uri': 'nyt://article/66458e08-06dd-5b5e-9d08-c9cdcaec6d28'}, {'abstract': 'A summary of what’s on today’s editorial page.', 'web_url': 'https://takingnote.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/22/opinion-report-power-plant-emissions/', 'snippet': 'A summary of what’s on today’s editorial page.', 'lead_paragraph': 'From the editorial page', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Opinion Report: Power Plant Emissions', 'kicker': 'Taking Note', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Greenhouse Gas Emissions', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Maliki, Nuri Kamal al-', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-22T13:41:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Rosenthal', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rosenthal', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f5617afe-580e-5640-8a2d-fba5037b22e2', 'word_count': 94, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f5617afe-580e-5640-8a2d-fba5037b22e2'}, {'abstract': 'In Thursday’s New York Times, Julie Scelfo writes about how Skype, an eight-year-old technology, is being used in new ways in growing numbers of American homes.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/22/daily-report-new-uses-for-skype/', 'snippet': 'In Thursday’s New York Times, Julie Scelfo writes about how Skype, an eight-year-old technology, is being used in new ways in growing numbers of American homes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In Thursday’s New York Times, Julie Scelfo writes about how Skype, an eight-year-old technology, is being used in new ways in growing numbers of American homes. The Darvick family of Birmingham, Mich., for example, celebrates what they call “Skypanukkah,” to observe the Jewish holiday; with family members spread out in three different cities, they light the Hanukkah candles together through video chat.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/11/30/technology/