etelling of the story of Easter, up to the Crucifixion, and the Passover seder that was the Last Supper. But the producers of the coming Broadway revival of that Andrew Lloyd Webber/Tim Rice musical are using the Christmas season to announce the cast, which will keep intact the lineup from its La Jolla Playhouse incarnation in San Diego and retain most of the performers who originated the production at the Stratford Shakespeare Festival in Ontario, Canada.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '‘Jesus Christ Superstar’ Announces Its Broadway Cast', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Jesus Christ Superstar (Play)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mcanuff, Des', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'La Jolla Playhouse', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-22T16:23:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dave Itzkoff', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dave', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Itzkoff', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/52318e61-e8f2-5b5e-a047-c1d4f05ce80c', 'word_count': 225, 'uri': 'nyt://article/52318e61-e8f2-5b5e-a047-c1d4f05ce80c'}, {'abstract': 'This week Ben Ratliff, Jon Pareles and Nate Chinen discuss some of the most memorable songs of 2011.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/audio/2011/12/22/arts/music/22popcast_pod.html', 'snippet': 'This week Ben Ratliff, Jon Pareles and Nate Chinen discuss some of the most memorable songs of 2011.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This week Ben Ratliff, Jon Pareles and Nate Chinen discuss some of the most memorable songs of 2011.', 'source': 'The New York Ti