anization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8d68390a-166c-5340-a7de-bd86a5749c63', 'word_count': 552, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8d68390a-166c-5340-a7de-bd86a5749c63'}, {'abstract': 'The game-day uniforms of the Giants, the Jets and the Eagles owe their brightness to Barry Barone of Park Cleaners in Rutherford, N.J.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/23/sports/football/uniform-launderer-roots-for-a-clean-game.html', 'snippet': 'The game-day uniforms of the Giants, the Jets and the Eagles owe their brightness to Barry Barone of Park Cleaners in Rutherford, N.J.', 'lead_paragraph': 'RUTHERFORD, N.J. — On Saturday afternoon at MetLife Stadium, there will be a large (and loud) contingent of Jets fans wearing green. The Giants fans, clad in blue, will surely be heard, too.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/23/sports/football/23dryclean-pic/23dryclean-pic-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/12/23/sports/football/23dryclean-pic/23dryclean-pic-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/23/sports/football/23dryclean-pic/23dryclean-pic-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 694, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/23/sports/football/23dryclean-pic/23dryclean-pic-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/23/sports/football/23dryclean-pic/23dryclean-pic-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight'