2/22/if-car-companies-were-run-like-tech-companies/', 'snippet': 'What if the car companies were as innovative as the tech industry?  That alternative industry may not be as wonderful as you would think.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As we plow into 2012, it has become clear that the technology industry is like no other. Its changes come faster. Its marketing hits us more deeply. Its business models would look absurd in any other industry. Can you imagine what the world would look like if another industry worked like the tech industry? Like, say, cars?', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'If Car Companies Were Run Like Tech Companies …', 'kicker': 'Pogue&#039;s Posts', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-22T20:13:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Pogue', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pogue', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fda220e5-3b26-5cac-89ab-47f17abe7321', 'word_count': 443, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fda220e5-3b26-5cac-89ab-47f17abe7321'}, {'abstract': 'Many of Europe’s largest banks will have to raise billions of euros to meet the new capital requirement of 9 percent of total assets.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/interactive/2011/12/22/business/global/european-banks-that-must-raise-capital.html', 'snippet': 'Many of Europe’s largest banks will have to raise billions of euros to meet the new capital requirement of 9 percent of total assets.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Many of Europe’s largest banks will have to raise billions of euros to meet the new capital requirement of 9 percent of total assets.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multi