een discipline and abuse.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/23/nyregion/army-hazing-charges-where-discipline-crosses-line.html', 'snippet': 'The charges against eight soldiers in the death of Pvt. Danny Chen have focused attention on the line between discipline and abuse.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Under Army rules, a superior is allowed to subject a soldier to certain kinds of “corrective measures,” including “verbal reprimands and a reasonable number of repetitions of authorized physical exercises.” ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'After Charging 8, Army Is Scrutinized on Hazing', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'After Charging 8, Army Is Scrutinized on Hazing', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Suicides and Suicide Attempts', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Chen, Danny', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United States Army', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Afghanistan War (2001- )', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hazing', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Asian-Americans', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Discrimination', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders and Attempted Murders', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-23T01:19:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kirk Semple', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kirk', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Semple', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a808c161-0447-55a5-b2dd-c9935026c488', 'word_count': 609, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a808c161-0447-55a5-b2dd-c9935026c488'}, {'abstract': 'Looking toward what may be a warmer-than-usual summer in 2012 and working to avoid future blackouts, the people in charge of the state’s electric grid face more than the usual number of challenges.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/23/business/energy-environment/electric-grid-in-texas-faces-multiple-challenges.html', 'snippet': 'Looking toward what may be a warmer-than-usual summer in 2012 and working to avoid future blackouts, the people in charge of the state’s electric grid face more than the usual number of challenges.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Will the lights stay on in 2012? Texas electricity experts cannot say for certain. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '25A', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/23/us/23TTElectricity2/23TTElectricity2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 660, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/23/us/23TTElectricity2/23TTElectricity2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/23/us/23TTElectricity2/23TTElectricity2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Electric Grid in Texas Faces Multiple Challenges', 'kicker': 'The Texas Tribune', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The State’s Electric Grid Faces Multiple Challenges', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Weather', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Texas', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Environmental Protection Agency', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Power Outa