ates-in-us-military.html', 'snippet': 'About one-third of the women in the United States military are black, according to a survey, about double their percentage in the civilian female population.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Black women are enlisting in the military at far higher rates than are white or Hispanic women, and they now represent nearly a third of all the women in the armed forces, a new study by the Pew Research Center has found.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Black Women Enlisting at Higher Rates in U.S. Military', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Black Women Are Joining the American Military at a Disproportionate Rate', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Pew Research Center', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Women and Girls', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Blacks', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Black People', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Defense Department', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Draft and Recruitment (Military)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-23T02:12:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By James Dao', 'person': [{'firstname': 'James', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Dao', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5547b38b-5517-5c05-8123-fe3bceb34eb3', 'word_count': 531, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5547b38b-5517-5c05-8123-fe3bceb34eb3'}, {'abstract': 'New loans from the European Central Bank will help, but more is needed to address the underlying issue of the financial crisis.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/23/opinion/timely-aid-for-europes-banks.html', 'snippet': 'New loans from the European Central Bank will help, but more is needed to address the underlying issue of the financial crisis.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This week, the European Central Bank, under the energized leadership of Mario Draghi, took the desperately needed step of injecting hundreds of billions of euros into the Continent’s tottering banking system. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '30', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Timely Aid for Europe’s Banks', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Timely Aid for Europe&#8217;s Banks', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'European Central Bank', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Banking and Financial Institutions', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'European Sovereign Debt Crisis (2010- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Politics and Government', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Government Bonds', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Economic Conditions and Trends', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Merkel, Angela', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Draghi, Mario', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Europe', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-23T02:15:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/8de5c5b4-6a15-50ff-8a66-d185e3507616', 'word_count': 425, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8de5c5b4-6a15-50ff-8a66-d185e3507616'}, {'abstract': 'Struggling to balance motherhood and work and confident she would be able to find employment closer to home, Tahesha Calder left her job of four years in 2008. Then the bottom fell out of the economy.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/23/nyregion/blindsided-by-financial-crisis-a-mother-fights-on.html', 'snippet': 'Struggling to balance motherhood and work and confident she would be able to find employment closer to home, Tahesha Calder left her job of four years in 2008. Then the bottom fell out of the economy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'To Tahesha Calder, her bond with her young son was slipping away. It seemed as if whenever she had a chance to see him, he was asleep.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '27', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/23/nyregion/NEEDIEST/NEEDIEST-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/12/23/nyregion/NEEDIEST/NEEDIEST-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/23/nyregion/NEEDIEST/NEEDIEST-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/23/nyregion/NEEDIEST/NEEDIEST-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/23/nyregion/NEEDIEST/NEEDIEST-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Blindsided by Financial Crisis, and Trying to Rebuild', 'kicker': 'The Neediest Cases', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Blindsided by Financial Crisis, and Trying to Rebuild', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'orga