 the area in Pennsylvania where his body was found.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/23/nyregion/death-of-brooklyn-coffee-shop-owner-joshua-rubin-leaves-questions.html', 'snippet': 'The authorities in Pennsylvania and New York City say they have made no connection between Joshua Rubin, the owner of Whisk Bakery Cafe, and the area in Pennsylvania where his body was found.', 'lead_paragraph': 'His body was found on the edge of a 70-acre apple orchard, slowly burning amid the brush, twigs and trash just off the shoulder of a rural road in Pennsylvania. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/23/nyregion/RUBIN1/RUBIN1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/12/23/nyregion/RUBIN1/RUBIN1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/23/nyregion/RUBIN1/RUBIN1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 688, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/23/nyregion/RUBIN1/RUBIN1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/23/nyregion/RUBIN1/RUBIN1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Communities in Two States Are Puzzled Over a Killing', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Communities In Two States Are Puzzled Over a Killing', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rubin, Joshua', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Whisk Bakery Cafe', 'rank