ill display the ad only in areas where there is a high incidence of the flu and only to mothers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/23/business/media/using-googles-data-to-sell-thermometers-to-mothers.html', 'snippet': 'A mobile advertising campaign for a new thermometer will display the ad only in areas where there is a high incidence of the flu and only to mothers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'THE viruses that Google researchers usually focus on are those that strike computers, but in recent years, they have studied those that infect people, too. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/23/business/subAdco2/subAdco2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 773, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/23/business/subAdco2/subAdco2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/23/business/subAdco2/subAdco2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Using Google’s Data to Reach Consumers', 'kicker': 'Advertising', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Using Google’s Data to Reach Consumers', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ADVERTISING AND MARKETING', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shopping and Retail', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Google Inc', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Smartphones', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Babies and Infants', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Influenza', 'r