r Kay Bailey Hutchison after a fire that left his San Antonio home heavily damaged.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SAN ANTONIO — Ricardo S. Sanchez rummaged through a pile of charred rubble in the backyard of his home here one recent morning. He picked up a small book with ripped and stuck-together pages. It was a prayer book one of his children had given his wife. He found what appeared to be a blackened, soggy rag. Unfolding it, he realized he was holding his daughter’s baptismal dress. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/23/us/SANCHEZ-1/SANCHEZ-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/12/23/us/SANCHEZ-1/SANCHEZ-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/23/us/SANCHEZ-1/SANCHEZ-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 685, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/23/us/SANCHEZ-1/SANCHEZ-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/23/us/SANCHEZ-1/SANCHEZ-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Fire at Home in Texas Ends Former Iraq Commander’s Run for the Senate', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Fire at Home in Texas Ends Former Iraq Commander’s Run for the Senate', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'San Antonio (Tex)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Senate', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fires and 