eber brings out a new edition of his “All-American” series, soft-bound books of photos and essays on his Little Bear Press that reflect his curiosity about other people’s lives.', 'web_url': 'https://runway.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/23/a-homecoming-for-bruce-weber/', 'snippet': 'For the last 11 years, at Christmas, the photographer Bruce Weber brings out a new edition of his “All-American” series, soft-bound books of photos and essays on his Little Bear Press that reflect his curiosity about other people’s lives.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For the last 11 years, at Christmas, the photographer Bruce Weber brings out a new edition of his “All-American” series, softbound books of photos and essays from his Little Bear Press that reflect his curiosity about other people’s lives. Mr. Weber has a passion for the kinds of stories that often don’t appear in the mainstream media, and he tells them in full. You can find his books at bruceweber.com.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Homecoming for Bruce Weber', 'kicker': 'On the Runway', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-12-23T18:18:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Cathy Horyn', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Cathy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Horyn', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4f3d0f85-f76a-5a73-bb61-e6dcffbcf858', 'word_count': 531, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4f3d0f85-f76a-5a73-bb61-e6dcffbcf858'}, {'abstract': 'Taking the pulse of the electorate at Robie’s Country Store in Hooksett, New Hampshire.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/us/politics/100000001243261/the-caucus--new-hampshire-voices.html', 'snippet': 'Taking the pulse of the electorate at Robie’s Country Store in Hooksett, New Hampshire