 with an advanced aerial intelligence system, a move that appeared to reflect a strategic reassessment of ties with the nation.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/24/world/middleeast/israel-cancels-military-contract-with-turkey.html', 'snippet': 'The Israeli government canceled a $141 million contract to supply Turkey with an advanced aerial intelligence system, a move that appeared to reflect a strategic reassessment of ties with the nation.', 'lead_paragraph': 'JERUSALEM — The Israeli government has canceled a $141 million contract to supply Turkey with an advanced aerial intelligence system, Israeli officials confirmed on Friday. The move appeared to reflect a profound reassessment of strategic ties with Turkey, a former ally, months after Turkey downgraded diplomatic relations with Israel. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Israel Cancels Military Contract With Turkey to Supply Aerial System', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Israel Cancels Military Contract With Turkey to Supply Aerial System', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Espionage and Intelligence Services', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'International Relations', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Turkey', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Israel', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Defense Contracts', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Politics and Government', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-23T18:24:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Isabel Kershner', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Isabel', 'middlename': None, 'last