-6899c26b34d9', 'word_count': 1162, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4cc1c0c1-4ede-5c51-9862-6899c26b34d9'}, {'abstract': 'How far should we go to prove to our children that Santa Claus is real?', 'web_url': 'https://parenting.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/23/to-fib-or-not-about-santa-claus/', 'snippet': 'How far should we go to prove to our children that Santa Claus is real?', 'lead_paragraph': 'Of course, you eat the cookies. If your child leaves cookies and milk for Santa (with a straw, because Santa has that beard, and he likes a straw), you have to eat and drink up. And leave a note. And maybe chew on the carrots left for the reindeer, just a bit.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'To Fib — or Not — About Santa Claus', 'kicker': 'Motherlode', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Children and Childhood', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Christmas', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parenting', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Santa Claus', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-23T19:41:59+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': "By Kj Dell'Antonia", 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kj', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': "Dell'Antonia", 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b7c288ae-9c9d-59aa-9673-2579162612a3', 'word_count': 970, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b7c288ae-9c9d-59aa-9673-2579162612a3'}, {'abstract': 'A presidential vow to kill the pipeline if Congress rushes a decision will hardly be a death knell, officials say.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/24/us/provision-may-halt-keystone-pipeline-but-oil-is-still-likely-to-flow.html', 'snippet': 'A presidential vow to kill the pipeline if Congress rushes a decision will hardly be a death knell, officials say.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The Obama administration confirmed this week that a provision in the payroll tax bill requiring a quick decision on the proposed Keystone XL oil pipeline from western Canada to the Gulf Coast will probably lead to cancellation of the project.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Politics Stamps Out Oil Sands Pipeline, Yet It Seems Likely to Endure', 'kicker': 'News Analysis', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Politics Stamps Out Oil Sands Pipeline, Yet It Seems Likely to Endure', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Keystone Pipeline System', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Payroll Tax', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'TransCanada Corporation', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Canada', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Oil Sands', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pipelines', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-23T19:42:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By John M. Broder and Dan Frosch', 'person': [{'firstname': 'John', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News Analysis', '_id': 'nyt://article/1a15a6f3-78aa-55ae-a348-36c44bab2384', 'word_count': 1177, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1a15a6f3-78aa-55ae-a348-36c44bab2384'}, {'abstract': 'A Murray Hill duplex, A Sutton area co-op and a Williamsburg Penthouse.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2011/12/21/realestate/10111225OTMNYC.html', 'snippet': 'A Mu