d the death of a woman in an elevator accident.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/23/week-in-pictures-for-dec-23/', 'snippet': 'Subjects include the return of a Christmas tradition, the killing of a police officer and the death of a woman in an elevator accident.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Here is a slide show of photographs from the past week in New York City and the region. Subjects include the return of a Christmas tradition, the killing of a police officer and the death of a woman in an elevator accident.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Week in Pictures for Dec. 23', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Police Department (NYC)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-23T22:26:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/09bc3609-395e-595e-9c56-6e4bb65de513', 'word_count': 89, 'uri': 'nyt://article/09bc3609-395e-595e-9c56-6e4bb65de513'}, {'abstract': 'We’ll return with our regular coverage on Dec. 27.', 'web_url': 'https://wheels.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/23/happy-holidays-from-wheels/', 'snippet': 'We’ll return with our regular coverage on Dec. 27.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Wheels will take a short break and return to our regular coverage on Tuesday, Dec. 27. If you’re on the move this weekend, the editors and contributors at Wheels wish you safe and happy travels.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Happy Holidays From Wheels', 'kicker': 'Wheels', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-12-23T22:29:42+00