e’s railway station, BosphoRus makes healthful food, perfect for sharing, that draws on cooking traditions from the scattered former regions of the Ottoman Empire.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BOSPHORUS brings new flavors to the county with a compendium of dishes reflecting cooking traditions from far-ranging regions that were once part of the vast Ottoman Empire.', 'print_section': 'WE', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/23/nyregion/25DINEWE1/23DINEWE1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/23/nyregion/25DINEWE1/23DINEWE1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/23/nyregion/25DINEWE1/23DINEWE1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Healthful Dishes in the Ottoman Tradition', 'kicker': 'Westchester Dining | Hartsdale', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Healthful Dishes In the Ottoman Tradition', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Restaurants', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Westchester County (NY)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-24T00:22:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By M. H. Reed', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7e49619a-490f-58b9-8f52-392e62693d77', 'word_count': 905, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7e49619a-490f-58b9-8f52-392e62693d77'}, {'abstract': 'A federal district court judge Friday granted a request by Fox Sports to stop, for now, the Los Angeles Dodgers’ sale of their TV rights and wrot