ve Feature', '_id': 'nyt://interactive/f6f958ce-2a9a-54f0-a929-45f820b95964', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://interactive/f6f958ce-2a9a-54f0-a929-45f820b95964'}, {'abstract': 'It was a silent Wednesday night at St Patrick’s Cathedral until several dozen choir members belted out, “Gloria!” during rehearsals for Midnight Mass on Christmas Eve.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/24/nyregion/at-st-patricks-choir-practice-fiddling-while-drums-boomed.html', 'snippet': 'It was a silent Wednesday night at St Patrick’s Cathedral until several dozen choir members belted out, “Gloria!” during rehearsals for Midnight Mass on Christmas Eve.', 'lead_paragraph': 'We had a backstage pass for a rehearsal for one of the most celebrated birthday concerts of the year: Midnight Mass at St. Patrick’s Cathedral. On Wednesday, we were invited to slip between the pews and ride up in a hidden elevator to a loft to watch the choir prepare.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/24/nyregion/NOCTURNALIST1/NOCTURNALIST1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/12/24/nyregion/NOCTURNALIST1/NOCTURNALIST1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/24/nyregion/NOCTURNALIST1/NOCTURNALIST1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 700, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/24/nyregion/NOCTURNALIST1/NOCTURNALIST1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/24/nyregion/NOCTURNALIST1/NOCTURNALIST1-thumbStan