ead reputable companies to make foolish judgment calls. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'An All-American Misstep', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'An All-American Misstep', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Florida Family Assn', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "Lowe's Companies Inc", 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Kayak.com', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Muslim-Americans', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ADVERTISING AND MARKETING', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Discrimination', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-24T01:56:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/f6befea5-6afa-5b49-a37e-65a9ae7e8c3a', 'word_count': 231, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f6befea5-6afa-5b49-a37e-65a9ae7e8c3a'}, {'abstract': 'Representative Denny Rehberg of Montana has been an aggressive advocate for the coal and minerals mining industry, a big employer in Montana.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/24/us/denny-rehberg-gets-mining-industry-backing-in-montana-senate-bid.html', 'snippet': 'Representative Denny Rehberg of Montana has been an aggressive advocate for the coal and minerals mining industry, a big employer in Montana.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NYE, Mont. — The violation notices keep coming in: broken safety equipment, underground roof collapses, dangerous levels of carbon monoxide — each a hint of the federal enforcement blitz set off more than a year ago by a series of deadly mining accidents across the nation.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/24/us/JP-REHBERG-1/JP-REHBERG-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/12/24/us/JP-REHBERG-1/JP-REHBERG-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/24/us/JP-REHBERG-1/JP-REHBERG-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 676, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/24/us/JP-REHBERG-1/JP-REHBERG-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/24/us/JP-REHBERG-1/JP-REHBERG-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Mining Companies Back Friend’s Bid for Senate', 'kicker': 'The Champions', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Mining Companies Back Friend’s Bid for Senate', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Series', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mines and Mining', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coal', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Montana', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tester, Jon', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Law and Legislation', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections, Senate', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rehberg, Dennis R', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-24T01:56:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Eric Lipton', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Eric', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lipton', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/cd6cc74e-5f53-549e-9c40-6c6b516074c3', 'word_count': 1733, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cd6cc74e-5f53-549e-9c40-6c6b516074c3'}, {'abstract': 'Looking, not always successfully, for some balm amid the season’s annoyances.', 'web_url': 'https://opinionator.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/23/deck-the-halls-with-boughs-of-nutty/', 'snippet': 'Looking, not always successfully, for some balm amid the season’s annoyances.', 'lead_paragraph': 'You may see this as a companion to my last year’s bittersweet Christmas entry. Some found that one a bit too poignant.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Deck the Halls With Boughs of Nutty', 'kicker': 'Dick Cavett', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Christmas', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-24T02:00:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dick Cavett', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cavett', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/51e47b4b-0421-5094-a9c9-0bc3607bdca0', 'word_count': 1146, 'uri': 'nyt://article/51e47b4b-0421-5094-a9c9-0bc3607bdca0'}, {'abstract': 'The Von Zedtwitz Double Knockout is an annual event organized by the Greater New York Bridge Association.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/24/crosswords/bridge/the-von-zedtwitz-double-knockout-bridge.html', 'snippet': 'The Von Zedtwitz Double Knockout is an annual event organized by the Greater New York Bridge Association.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Von Zedtwitz Double Knockout is an annual event organized by the Greater New York Bridge Association. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/24/crosswords/bridge/24card-pic/24card-pic-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 526, 'width': 279, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A What-If as Two Teams Square Off in New York', 'kicker': 'Bridge', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A What-If As Two Teams Square Off In New York', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bridge (Card Game)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cards and Card Games', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-24T02:01:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Crosswords & Games', 'subsection_name': 'Bridge', 'byline': {'original': 'By Phillip Alder', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Phillip', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Alder', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a0e8d4be-5464-5e93-becf-037b5fb8a47e', 'word_count': 535, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a0e8d4be-5464-5e93-becf-037b5fb8a47e'}, {'abstract': 'An Elvis Christmas is just as valid as a Bing Crosby Christmas, “A Charlie Brown Christmas” or a Lady Gaga Christmas.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/24/opinion/this-eclectic-season.html', 'snippet': 'An Elvis Christmas is just as valid as a Bing Crosby Christmas, “A Charlie Brown Christmas” or a Lady Gaga Christmas.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Surely there is a Christmas tree, somewhere in this land, decorated with zombie ornaments or figurines from Battlestar Galactica. Just as surely, someone will be celebrating the holiday traditionally, with real candles burning on a real tree, in Scandinavian fashion. In some houses, Bob Dylan’s “Must Be Santa” is playing in a loop with Rosemary Clooney, Asleep at the Wheel and the choir of King’s College, Cambridge. On Christmas Eve, some will read the Grinch aloud, some will read David Sedaris and many will re-read the first verses of the second chapter of Luke, only to be moved by their beauty all over again. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'This Eclectic Season', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'This Eclectic Season', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Christmas', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-24T02:04:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/e0253eb9-3c30-53aa-ab6d-a204da0b4dd8', 'word_count': 286, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e0253eb9-3c30-53aa-ab6d-a204da0b4dd8'}, {'abstract': 'The winning numbers for Dec. 23, 2011, for New York, New Jersey and Connecticut.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/24/nyregion/lottery-numbers-for-new-york-new-jersey-and-connecticut.html', 'snippet': 'The winning numbers for Dec. 23, 2011, for New York, New Jersey and Connecticut.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Dec. 23, 2011', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Lottery Numbers', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Lottery Numbers', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keyw