o changing a perception that Maine, more than most states, encouraged dependency.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/24/us/medicaid-cuts-are-part-of-larger-battle-in-maine.html', 'snippet': 'Gov. Paul LePage said the cuts were crucial to changing a perception that Maine, more than most states, encouraged dependency.', 'lead_paragraph': 'AUGUSTA, Me. — At a town hall meeting in the rural western part of the state last week, a woman asked Gov. Paul R. LePage if he could confirm a worrying rumor she had heard: that poor out-of-staters flock here because the public benefits are so generous. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/24/us/MAINE-2/MAINE-2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 879, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/24/us/MAINE-2/MAINE-2-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/24/us/MAINE-2/MAINE-2-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Medicaid Cuts Are Part of a Larger Battle in Maine', 'kicker': 'State House Journal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Medicaid Cuts Are Part of a Larger Battle in Maine', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Budgets and Budgeting', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Medicaid', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'LePage, Paul R', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Maine', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-24T03:55:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Abby Goodnough', 'p