ed to help find such unusual...', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ever get to the end of a road trip and realize you were just a few miles away from the shoe of the world’s tallest man but you missed it? Maybe not, but On the Way, a new online travel site for road trippers, was designed to help find such unusual attractions. When you enter your start and destination, the program will populate a map of your route with restaurants, museums and\xa0less traditional tourist sites using programming interfaces like Google Places, Foursquare, Yelp and Lonely Planet’s Points of Interest. It can help you find a Starbucks between New York and Washington, but it’s better for\xa0local alternatives like Miss Shirley’s Cafe in Baltimore.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Mapping Your Drive And the Odd Stops on It', 'kicker': 'In Transit', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Road Trips', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Foursquare', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Yelp', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-24T15:00:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rachel Lee Harris', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rachel', 'middlename': 'Lee', 'lastname': 'Harris', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/737dd368-78d7-5d11-adf9-40431021e0b9', 'word_count': 272, 'uri': 'nyt://article/737dd368-78d7-5d11-adf9-40431021e0b9'}, {'abstract': 'Newt Gingrich’s failure to get on the ballot in the critical state of Virginia is a bad signal to his supporters.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/24/gingrich-ballot-failure-highlights-challenge-to-campaign/', 'snippet': 'Newt Gingrich’s failure to get on the ballot in the critical state of Virginia is a bad signal to his supporters.', 'lead_paragraph': ' Newt Gingrich had declared confidently the other day that he would get his name on the ballot for the Republican primary in Virginia. In fact, he said he already had the requisite 10,000 signatures plus an additional few thousand for safety’s sake and would probably collect even more at events in Arlington and Richmond.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Gingrich Ballot Failure Highlights Challenge to Campaign', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Primaries and Caucuses', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gingrich, Newt', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Paul, Ron', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Perry, Rick', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Romney, Mitt', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Twitter', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iowa', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Hampshire', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Virginia', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-24T15:05:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Katharine Q. Seelye', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Katharine', 'middlename': 'Q.', 'lastname': 'Seelye', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organiza