0 years of tradition and their 24 Stanley Cups, the Canadiens are the standard-bearers of a people, a culture and a certain idea about Quebec. Anything involving le club de hockey Canadien can easily end up being about French and English.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Unspeakable: A Canadiens Coach Not Knowing French', 'kicker': 'Slap Shot', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hockey, Ice', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Montreal Canadiens', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Hockey League', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-24T17:53:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Hockey', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jeff Z. Klein and Stu Hackel', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jeff', 'middlename': 'Z.', 'lastname': 'Klein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Stu', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hackel', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8559fd26-e6ee-5371-9345-dc555b716014', 'word_count': 835, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8559fd26-e6ee-5371-9345-dc555b716014'}, {'abstract': 'Seeing an opportunity to fix the structural problems that have kept Haiti stuck in poverty, planners are trying to revive the country’s desiccated, disused farmland.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/25/world/americas/in-countryside-stricken-haiti-seeks-both-food-and-rebirth.html', 'snippet': 'Seeing an opportunity to fix the structural problems that have kept Haiti stuck in poverty, planners are trying to revive the country’s desiccated, disused farmland.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PAPAYE, Haiti — For months after the earthquake that struc