of Changes', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Basketball Assn', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-24T19:59:22+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Basketball', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Interactive Feature', '_id': 'nyt://interactive/127c4b08-8a21-5ccc-a5b3-3de529963567', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://interactive/127c4b08-8a21-5ccc-a5b3-3de529963567'}, {'abstract': 'The Haggler again asks the writer, raconteur and humorist Adam Corolla to sound off on his own woes as a consumer — and to propose changes for the new year.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/25/your-money/yielding-my-time-to-a-comedians-grousing-the-haggler.html', 'snippet': 'The Haggler again asks the writer, raconteur and humorist Adam Corolla to sound off on his own woes as a consumer — and to propose changes for the new year.', 'lead_paragraph': 'FOR the second consecutive year the Haggler steps aside and cedes the podium to the comedian, storyteller, author and ranter extraordinaire, Adam Carolla. If you’re not listening to his podcast, “The Adam Carolla Show,” you’re missing out on some peerless, portable entertainment — and the chance to hear a truly original mind complain, muse and theorize for a couple of hours a week. ', 'print_section': 'BU', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/25/business/25-HAGGLER/25-HAGGLER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/20