s, free of pesticides, that could remain beautiful even as the seasons changed.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/25/us/wolfgang-oehme-free-form-landscape-architect-dies-at-81.html', 'snippet': 'For 30 years, Mr. Oehme, with James van Sweden, developed self-sustaining gardens, free of pesticides, that could remain beautiful even as the seasons changed.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Wolfgang Oehme, a landscape architect who drew from a palette of feathery grasses and black-eyed Susans to create what he called “horticultural explosions,” free-form landscapes that some called exemplars of “the new American garden,” died on Dec. 15 at his home in Towson, Md. He was 81. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '28', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/25/us/dog-OEHME1-obit/dog-OEHME1-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 633, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/25/us/dog-OEHME1-obit/dog-OEHME1-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/25/us/dog-OEHME1-obit/dog-OEHME1-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Wolfgang Oehme, a Free-Form Landscape Architect, Dies at 81', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Wolfgang Oehme, 81, a Free-Form Landscape Architect', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ARCHITECTURE', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Design', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-24T22:40:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'