ly three decades who brought his dramatic expertise to a second career as an opera director.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/25/arts/music/paul-emile-deiber-french-theater-director-dies-at-86.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Deiber was an actor and director with the Comédie-Française for nearly three decades who brought his dramatic expertise to a second career as an opera director.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Paul-Emile Deiber, an actor and director with the Comédie-Française for nearly three decades who brought his dramatic expertise to a second career as an opera director, died on Dec. 14. He was 86. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '28', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/25/arts/dog-DEIBER-obit/dog-DEIBER-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 709, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/25/arts/dog-DEIBER-obit/dog-DEIBER-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/25/arts/dog-DEIBER-obit/dog-DEIBER-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Paul-Emile Deiber, Actor Who Became an Opera Director, Dies at 86', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Paul-Emile Deiber, 86, Actor Who Became an Opera Director', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Opera', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Comedie Francaise', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-24T22:57:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bruce Weber', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bruce', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Weber', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/cfb56ecf-b722-5a5d-83fd-0118838775fe', 'word_count': 658, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cfb56ecf-b722-5a5d-83fd-0118838775fe'}, {'abstract': 'A mouth-watering snack from Liz Gorski.', 'web_url': 'https://wordplay.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/24/sweet-2/', 'snippet': 'A mouth-watering snack from Liz Gorski.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SUNDAY’S PUZZLE — The tree has been decorated, the presents have been opened, the eggs have been nogged, and the wassails have been, well … wassailed. To those who celebrate, I hope you had a very happy Christmas.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Sunday: Ain’t He Sweet?', 'kicker': 'Wordplay', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-12-24T23:00:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Crosswords & Games', 'byline': {'original': 'By Deb Amlen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Deb', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Amlen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a8683a16-80a1-5cef-8c52-f12c90ee64e4', 'word_count': 387, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a8683a16-80a1-5cef-8c52-f12c90ee64e4'}, {'abstract': 'We at the E.R. come from different religious and ethnic backgrounds and so did the victims. This wasn’t an attack on Baghdadi Muslim Shias or Muslim Sunnis, this was an attack on all Baghdadis.', 'web_url': 'https://atwar.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/24/life-and-death-in-a-baghdad-e-r/', 'snippet': 'We at the E.R. come from different religious and ethnic backgrounds and so did the victims. This wasn’t an attack on Baghdadi Muslim Shias or Muslim Sunnis, this was an attack on all Baghdadis.', 'lead_paragraph': ' BAGHDAD — I did really want to cry, but the tears wouldn’t come down.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Life and Death in a Baghdad E.R.', 'kicker': 'At War', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Emergency Medical Treatment', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hospitals', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Baghdad (Iraq)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-24T23:02:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By Lubna Naji', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Lubna', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Naji', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/82d48edd-cefd-5660-87f2-9b777ff4ae79', 'word_count': 912, 'uri': 'nyt://article/82d48edd-cefd-5660-87f2-9b777ff4ae79'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Campo provided comedy and brought rippling syncopation to Jack Paar’s “Morning Show” in the 1950s.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/25/arts/music/pupi-campo-cuban-bandleader-and-the-rumba-maestro-dies-at-91.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Campo provided comedy and brought rippling syncopation to Jack Paar’s “Morning Show” in the 1950s.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Pupi Campo, a Cuban bandleader who brought rippling syncopation to Jack Paar’s “Morning Show” on CBS television in the early 1950s and to his long career in nightclubs around the country, died on Dec. 12 at a hospice in Las Vegas. He was 91.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '28', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/25/arts/dog-CAMPO--obit/dog-CAMPO--obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 546, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/25/arts/dog-CAMPO--obit/dog-CAMPO--obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/25/arts/dog-CAMPO--obit/dog-CAMPO--obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Pupi Campo, Cuban Bandleader and ‘the Rumba Maestro,’ Dies at 91', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Pupi Campo, 91, Cuban Bandleader and ‘the Rumba Maestro’', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Paar, Jack', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'NIGHTCLUBS AND CABARETS', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-24T23:02:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dennis Hevesi', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dennis', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hevesi', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/358ebedf-dac2-5e4d-864e-fba081f18853', 'word_count': 456, 'uri': 'nyt://article/358ebedf-dac2-5e4d-864e-fba081f18853'}, {'abstract': 'The Washington city council passed an ethics overhaul package, including a new process for expelling members accused of wrongdoing, after a series of damaging accusations.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/25/us/politics/image-tarnished-by-scandals-washington-council-overhauls-ethics-rules.html', 'snippet': 'The Washington city council passed an ethics overhaul package, including a new process for expelling members accused of wrongdoing, after a series of damaging accusations.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — It was a sunny Friday morning when federal agents in bulletproof vests and F.B.I. windbreakers pulled up to the brick home on a quiet cul-de-sac. As spectators watched from across yellow police tape, the agents loaded an S.U.V. and a motorcycle emblazoned with decals onto a flatbed truck and took them away.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/25/us/ETHICS/ETHICS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 401, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/12/25/us/ETHICS/ETHICS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 401}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/25/us/ETHICS/ETHICS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 728, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Image Tarnished by Scandals, Washington Council Overhauls Ethics Rules', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Image Tarnished by Scandals, Washington Council Overhauls Ethics Rules', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ethics (Institutional)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Frauds and Swindling', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Washington (DC)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Thomas, Harry', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Politics and Government', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'City Councils', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-24T23:03:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Theo Emery', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Theo', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Emery', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a872ebba-cb24-5d23-a88d-6ef6e8f5d584', 'word_count': 935, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a872ebba-cb24-5d23-a88d-6ef6e8f5d584'}, {'abstract': 'Beekeeping is exploding in the Bay Area, but look closely at local laws before setting up a colony.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/25/us/many-rules-surround-beekeeping-in-the-bay.html', 'snippet': 'Beekeeping is exploding in the Bay Area, but look closely at local laws before setting up a colony.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When Round Rock Honey decided to expand its Beekeeping Academy beyond Texas, its first stop was San Mateo County. Through Groupon, the company signed up nearly 1,000 new students in just a few days. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '27A', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Many Rules Surround Beekeeping in the Bay', 'kicker': 'The Bay Citizen', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Many Rules Surround Beekeeping In the Bay', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bees', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hobbies', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Regulation and Deregulation of Industry', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'San Francisco Bay Area (Calif)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-24T23:08:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jessica Parks', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jessica', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Parks', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_