not get that here. Not sweet potatoes. Not cranberry sauce. Not eggnog. Definitely not eggnog.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BAGHDAD – Nobody can guarantee you a peaceful Christmas dinner in Iraq. Things explode. Riots break out. Angry politicians quit the government. As a reporter roosting in Baghdad over the holidays, all you can do is plan a menu, start cooking early and be ready to abandon your turkey if mayhem erupts.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Art of the Possible: Christmas Dinner in Baghdad', 'kicker': 'Diner&#039;s Journal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Christmas', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Iraq War (2003-11)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iraq', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-26T01:18:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jack Healy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jack', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Healy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7cd36c92-5ebc-5d83-a135-f00005299924', 'word_count': 706, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7cd36c92-5ebc-5d83-a135-f00005299924'}, {'abstract': 'The Saints have no choice but to stay in full-throttle mode: for them, a No. 3 seeding could be disastrous.', 'web_url': 'https://fifthdown.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/25/monday-night-matchup-falcons-at-saints/', 'snippet': 'The Saints have no choice but to stay in full-throttle mode: for them, a No. 3 seeding could be disastrous.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Falcons (9-5) at Saints (11-3), 8:20 p.m. Eastern, ESPN', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Monday Night Matchup: Falcons at Saints', 'kicker': 'The Fifth Down', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headli