', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Expanding Internet Domains', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Domain Names (Internet)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Internet Corp for Assigned Names and Numbers', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Trademarks and Trade Names', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Frauds and Swindling', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Consumer Protection', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-26T02:12:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/6b95ed6a-d06d-58e0-8ab5-d41c1750ebf8', 'word_count': 486, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6b95ed6a-d06d-58e0-8ab5-d41c1750ebf8'}, {'abstract': 'Eli Manning will be coming off two straight poor performances when the Giants face the Cowboys in a must-win game Sunday night.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/26/sports/football/manning-loses-his-hot-hand-and-doesnt-have-much-time-to-find-it.html', 'snippet': 'Eli Manning will be coming off two straight poor performances when the Giants face the Cowboys in a must-win game Sunday night.', 'lead_paragraph': 'EAST RUTHERFORD, N.J. — Of all the questions lingering over the Giants as they prepare for a winner-take-all game against the Dallas Cowboys — including “will Coach Tom Coughlin need crutches on the sideline?” — the most critical one is obvious: which Eli Manning will show up Sunday night?', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/26/sports/YGIANTS/YGIANTS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 368, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/12/26/sports/YGIANTS/YGIANTS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 368}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/26/sports/YGIANTS/YGIANTS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/26/sports/YGIANTS/YGIANTS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/26/sports/YGIANTS/YGIANTS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Manning Loses His Hot Hand, and Doesn’t Have Much Time to Find It', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Manning Loses His Hot Hand, and Doesn’t Have Much Time to Find It', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Giants', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Manning, Eli', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Dallas Cowboys', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-26T02:15:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sam Borden', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Borden', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/512c5b27-a3a6-5ecf-a374-dac5a6bc6704', 'word_count': 900, 'uri': 'nyt://article/512c5b27-a3a6-5ecf-a374-dac5a6bc6704'}, {'abstract