d to be related and the gunman was among the dead, the police in Grapevine, Tex., said.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/26/us/near-dallas-7-found-shot-to-death-amid-their-unwrapped-gifts.html', 'snippet': 'The victims were believed to be related and the gunman was among the dead, the police in Grapevine, Tex., said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Police officers responding to a silent call from someone who dialed 911 in a Dallas suburb on Sunday morning found seven people dead in an apartment, all shot shortly after opening their Christmas presents. The gunman, who was wearing a Santa suit, was among the dead, the police said, and the seven appeared to be related.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Near Dallas, 7 Found Shot to Death Amid Their Unwrapped Gifts', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Near Dallas, 7 Found Shot to Death Amid Their Unwrapped Gifts', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Dallas (Tex)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Police', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Nine-One-One (911) (Emergency Phone Number)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders and Attempted Murders', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-26T03:46:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sarah Maslin Nir', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sarah', 'middlename': 'Maslin', 'lastname': 'Nir', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0d3d8089-570d-58b1-8da9-8f9b05d104f5', 'word_count': 355, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0d3d8089-570d-58b1-8da9-8f9b05d104f5'}, {'abstract': 'A look at season-opening games played in Dallas, Los Angeles and Oklahoma City.', 'web_url': 'https://