k at the U.S. national team roster for its January training camp and two upcoming friendlies.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Now that Jurgen Klinsmann has named his roster for the United States soccer team’s January training camp and for its two friendly matches against Venezuela and Panama, it’s time to roll up our sleeves, stare at the list and start reading between the lines.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'U.S.: Roster Rumblings and Ramblings', 'kicker': 'Goal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soccer', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Klinsmann, Jurgen', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-26T11:00:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Soccer', 'byline': {'original': 'By John Godfrey', 'person': [{'firstname': 'John', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Godfrey', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ade839f2-6ca8-5207-a366-8f06e1a17f72', 'word_count': 1244, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ade839f2-6ca8-5207-a366-8f06e1a17f72'}, {'abstract': '“A Living Man Declared Dead and Other Chapters I-XVIII 2011,” which contains more than 800 portraits by Taryn Simon, as well as extensive annotations and footnotes, is on display through Jan. 2 at the Tate Modern in London.', 'web_url': 'https://intransit.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/26/in-london-a-taryn-simon-show-nears-its-end/', 'snippet': '“A Living Man Declared Dead and Other Chapters I-XVIII 2011,” which contains more than 800 portraits by Taryn Simon, as well as extensive annotations and footnotes, is on display through Jan. 2 at the Tate Modern in London.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For four years, Taryn Simon traveled the world photographing 18 family bloodlines and their related stories. The resulting images document victims of genocide in Bosnia, a polygamist family in Kenya, the alleged body double of Saddam Hussein’s son, Uday, Filipino farmers and miners, children with no known bloodline from a Ukrainian orphanage, and many more.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In London, a Taryn Simon Show Nears Its End', 'kicker': 'In Transit', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Simon, Taryn', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Tate Modern', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'London (England)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-26T11:00:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': 'By Gary Moskowitz', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Gary', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Moskowitz', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9735e1a9-28df-552c-b19b-74d8ee6a61aa', 'word_count': 424, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9735e1a9-28df-552c-b19b-74d8ee6a61aa'}, {'abstract': 'It’s time to contemplate new economic systems to remove the destructive incentives embodied in our modern capitalism, an economist writes.', 'web_url': 'https://economix.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/26/utopian-capitalism/', 'snippet': 'It’s time to contemplate new economic systems to remove the destructive incentives embodied in our modern capitalism, an economist writes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Nancy Folbre is an economics professor at the University of Massachusetts, Amherst.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': 