th a new television advertisement stressing his conservative economic credentials and promising to get rid of President Obama‘s health care program.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Romney Pushes Economic Agenda in New Ad', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Political Advertising', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Romney, Mitt', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iowa', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-26T16:34:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael D. Shear', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bb008df2-04c7-59a0-8c4f-33e96d752ed1', 'word_count': 307, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bb008df2-04c7-59a0-8c4f-33e96d752ed1'}, {'abstract': 'Jenson Button’s hair ad wins the worst celebrity ad of the year, among other bits of year-end F1 news.', 'web_url': 'https://rendezvous.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/26/merry-christmas-roundup-featuring-jensons-horrible-ad/', 'snippet': 'Jenson Button’s hair ad wins the worst celebrity ad of the year, among other bits of year-end F1 news.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There is not much new in the world of Formula One racing, as the teams finally take a real break and prepare for the new year and the testing of new cars, which begins in February. This is when the media receives a slew of Christmas greetings from the teams and other F1 related people, like circuits and promoters