ning provides a realistic template for the choice that will face the Jets about whether Mark Sanchez is a keeper.', 'web_url': 'https://fifthdown.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/27/sanchez-and-eli-manning-a-year-3-comparison/', 'snippet': 'Eli Manning provides a realistic template for the choice that will face the Jets about whether Mark Sanchez is a keeper.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Rex Ryan stood by Mark Sanchez on Monday, saying he has “a huge amount of confidence in him.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Sanchez and Eli Manning, a Year 3 Comparison', 'kicker': 'The Fifth Down', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Manning, Eli', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sanchez, Mark', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Jets', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-27T13:36:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Toni Monkovic', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Toni', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Monkovic', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/408ae314-2e27-5d90-8cc4-375264ddf963', 'word_count': 671, 'uri': 'nyt://article/408ae314-2e27-5d90-8cc4-375264ddf963'}, {'abstract': 'Another inflation panic bites the dust.', 'web_url': 'https://krugman.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/27/the-core-not-rotten/', 'snippet': 'Another inflation panic bites the dust.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There have been many news reports the past few days about declining inflation — very different from this time last year, when warnings of higher inflation (and higher interest rates) abounded. As I’ve written many times, events amount to