{'firstname': 'Binyamin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Appelbaum', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/51517c6a-9630-5615-ab13-6bbb6ebcdc34', 'word_count': 803, 'uri': 'nyt://article/51517c6a-9630-5615-ab13-6bbb6ebcdc34'}, {'abstract': 'With winter’s arrival comes an annual reality check, this time in the form of a visit to the Dunderdon Workshop, which has some of the most handsome styles of coats around.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/29/fashion/dunderdon-workshop-in-soho-critical-shopper.html', 'snippet': 'With winter’s arrival comes an annual reality check, this time in the form of a visit to the Dunderdon Workshop, which has some of the most handsome styles of coats around.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I DON’T do winter. Not that I leave town, mind you, but I try to dress in February as I do in October or April, maybe hiding a layer or three. No cold snap can freeze my mind to the point where I feel like bundling up beyond all shape recognition. Bulk bad. Slim good.', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/29/fashion/29zCRITICAL1/29zCRITICAL1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/12/29/fashion/29zCRITICAL1/29zCRITICAL1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/29/fashion/29zCRITICAL1/29zCRITICAL1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 634, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/29/fashion/29zCRITICAL1/29zCRITICAL1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'heig