uban defector Yoennis Cespedes, who has an athletic body and a home run bat.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/28/sports/baseball/the-cuban-yoenis-cespedes-could-be-baseballs-hottest-free-agent.html', 'snippet': 'At least a dozen teams have an interest in the Cuban defector Yoennis Cespedes, who has an athletic body and a home run bat.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Now that the Texas Rangers have won the right to negotiate with the Japanese pitching phenom Yu Darvish, Major League Baseball has turned its attention to Yoennis Cespedes, a captivating Cuban outfielder with a running back’s body whom scouts have been following for years. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/28/sports/JPCUBAN/JPCUBAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 393, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/12/28/sports/JPCUBAN/JPCUBAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 393}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/28/sports/JPCUBAN/JPCUBAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/28/sports/JPCUBAN/JPCUBAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/28/sports/JPCUBAN/JPCUBAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Cuban Free Agent Is Next Hot Commodity', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Cuban Free Agent Is Next Hot Commodity', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Darvish, Yu', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organization