panache to holiday entertaining. Guests will not miss the caviar if you garnish and season canapés, desserts, ceviche and even drinks with Cocktail Pearls, glistening globules of flavor and color about the size of salmon roe. The pearls are made with fruit pulp treated with xanthan gum and sodium alginate, those essentials of the molecular pantry. So, no surprise, they are from Spain. Versions in strawberry, apple-ginger and lemon-lime add bright sweetness. Shallot-vinegar, lemon-pepper and chile are sharp and tangy.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/28/dining/28STUFF2_CAVIAR/28STUFF2_CAVIAR-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 922, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/28/dining/28STUFF2_CAVIAR/28STUFF2_CAVIAR-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/28/dining/28STUFF2_CAVIAR/28STUFF2_CAVIAR-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Ways to Get Guests to Say, ‘Ooooh!’', 'kicker': 'Food Stuff', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Ways to Get Guests to Say, ‘Ooooh!’', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Salmon', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Food', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-27T21:36:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Florence Fabricant', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Florence', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fabricant', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organizatio