Daytona Beach, Fla., for $143 million in cash.', 'lead_paragraph': '6:00 p.m. | Updated The New York Times Company announced on Tuesday that it had reached an agreement to sell the company’s Regional Media Group to Halifax Media Holdings, of Daytona Beach, Fla., for $143 million in cash.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Times Co. Agrees to Sell Regional Newspaper Group', 'kicker': 'Media Decoder', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Newspapers', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sulzberger, Arthur Jr', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Halifax Media Group', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Times Company', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-27T22:06:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tanzina Vega', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tanzina', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Vega', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bccefa4f-566e-518e-a5b4-46c349a82ca8', 'word_count': 491, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bccefa4f-566e-518e-a5b4-46c349a82ca8'}, {'abstract': 'The unexpected pleasures of 2011, from the Champagnes of the Aube to the rhums agricoles of the French West Indies.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/28/dining/reviews/a-year-of-acquired-tastes-the-pour.html', 'snippet': 'The unexpected pleasures of 2011, from the Champagnes of the Aube to the rhums agricoles of the French West Indies.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NO doubt about it, I’ve had the privilege of drinking some spectacular wines in 2011. Most astounding of all was a summer evening that I spent with the sort of great old Burgundies that I never imagined I would see in the first place and that I never expect to drink again. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/28/dining/28POUR1_SPAN/28POUR1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/12/28/dining/28POUR1_SPAN/28POUR1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/28/dining/28POUR1_SPAN/28POUR1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/28/dining/28POUR1_SPAN/28POUR1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/28/dining/28POUR1_SPAN/28POUR1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Year of Acquired Tastes', 'kicker': 'The Pour', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Year of Acquired Tastes', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Liquor', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wines', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Beer', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-27T22:10:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'subsection_name': 'Dining & Wine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Eric Asimov', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Eric', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Asimov', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/8e65ace3-6286-584c-a8ec-dc3483f6bae8', 'word_