 died as a part of the Afghan war and related operations. It confirmed the death of the following American this week: ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Names of the Dead', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Names of the Dead', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Afghanistan War (2001- )', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Fatalities)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'AFGHANISTAN', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-28T00:21:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'List', '_id': 'nyt://article/9d3f8ebd-c132-5e07-8d55-399e981e12e1', 'word_count': 45, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9d3f8ebd-c132-5e07-8d55-399e981e12e1'}, {'abstract': 'Gov. Rick Perry of Texas filed a federal lawsuit on Tuesday challenging his exclusion from the Republican primary ballot in Virginia.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/27/in-lawsuit-perry-challenges-his-exclusion-from-virginia-ballot/', 'snippet': 'Gov. Rick Perry of Texas filed a federal lawsuit on Tuesday challenging his exclusion from the Republican primary ballot in Virginia.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Gov. Rick Perry of Texas filed a federal lawsuit on Tuesday challenging his exclusion from the Republican primary ballot in Virginia, a state known for having some of the most restrictive ballot access rules in the country.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In Lawsuit, Perry Challenges His Exclusion From Virginia Ballot', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords':