11/12/28/sports/football/crowded-sidelines-leave-coaches-nowhere-to-run.html', 'snippet': 'Faster players and spread offenses now carry football’s contact to the sideline and beyond, as several coaches can painfully attest.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Marv Levy can vividly recall the play some 40 years later: a sweep to the right, Bears linebacker Dick Butkus running full speed toward the sideline, then Levy landing on his back. The feared Butkus had bowled over Levy, then an assistant coach just starting his career in the N.F.L., when his momentum carried him out of bounds. It became one of Levy’s favorite war stories. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/28/sports/collision5/collision5-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 366, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/12/28/sports/collision5/collision5-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 366}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/28/sports/collision5/collision5-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 554, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/28/sports/collision5/collision5-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/28/sports/collision5/collision5-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Crowded Sidelines Leave Coaches Nowhere to Run', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Nowhere To Run', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Payton, Sean', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'F