d place in the Iowa Republican caucuses, complicating the forecast.', 'web_url': 'https://fivethirtyeight.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/28/polling-gridlock-in-iowa-could-produce-last-minute-momentum/', 'snippet': 'Polls suggest a four-way tie for third place in the Iowa Republican caucuses, complicating the forecast.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The most interesting thing about the latest polls in Iowa (which are the basis for our forecasts) is that they essentially show a four-way tie for third place among the Republican presidential contenders, with Newt Gingrich, Michele Bachmann, Rick Santorum and Rick Perry all projected to receive between 11 and 14 percent of the vote.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Polling Gridlock in Iowa Could Produce Last-Minute Momentum', 'kicker': 'FiveThirtyEight', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-12-28T11:56:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nate Silver', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nate', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Silver', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/52798deb-e02f-5f82-b93e-ece7d011e769', 'word_count': 675, 'uri': 'nyt://article/52798deb-e02f-5f82-b93e-ece7d011e769'}, {'abstract': 'According to NFL-Forecast.com, the Jets have a 9.3 percent chance of advancing to the playoffs.', 'web_url': 'https://fifthdown.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/28/jets-long-shot-chance-is-put-at-9-percent/', 'snippet': 'According to NFL-Forecast.com, the Jets have a 9.3 percent chance of advancing to the playoffs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Jets fans know it doesn’t look good, and we’re here to put a number on that feeling: According to NFL-Forecast.com, the Jets have a 9.3 percent chance of advancing to the playoffs.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Jets’ Long-Shot Chance Is Put at 9 Percent', 'kicker': 'The Fifth Down', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Jets', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-28T12:00:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Toni Monkovic', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Toni', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Monkovic', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/606c8758-6802-5ded-8cd4-3aa0918c899e', 'word_count': 284, 'uri': 'nyt://article/606c8758-6802-5ded-8cd4-3aa0918c899e'}, {'abstract': 'This year, some of the best small-business bloggers in the business took us inside their companies and showed us what life is really like in the trenches.', 'web_url': 'https://boss.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/28/the-best-of-the-boss/', 'snippet': 'This year, some of the best small-business bloggers in the business took us inside their companies and showed us what life is really like in the trenches.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Here at You’re the Boss, we believe that most small-business owners are really good at a few things, the things that allowed them to get their businesses off the ground. Inevitably, however, most owners are unprepared for the dozens of other tasks that are essential to running a business. We hope to help with those. But we don’t try to make it look easy.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Best of the Boss', 'kicker': 'You&#039;re the Boss', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Entrepreneurship', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Small Business', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Start-ups', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-28T12:00:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Entrepreneurship', 'byline': {'original': "By You're the Boss Editors", 'person': [{'firstname': '', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/afc11926-6882-59b7-bf08-2fc31d87b798', 'word_count': 937, 'uri': 'nyt://article/afc11926-6882-59b7-bf08-2fc31d87b798'}, {'abstract': 'The activist Anna Hazare ended his three-day hunger fast to protest corruption in India, a day after Parliament passed an anti-corruption law that he said was too weak.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/29/world/asia/activist-anna-hazare-ends-fast-for-health-reasons.html', 'snippet': 'The activist Anna Hazare ended his three-day hunger fast to protest corruption in India, a day after Parliament passed an anti-corruption law that he said was too weak.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MUMBAI, India — A day after the lower house of the Indian Parliament passed an anticorruption law that the activist Anna Hazare has dismissed as weak, he called an early end on Wednesday to a three-day fast for health reasons.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/29/world/29hazare-image/29hazare-image-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 720, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/29/world/29hazare-image/29hazare-image-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subT