': 'nyt://article/a8a2d4c2-c4c4-53a7-8f3e-eb07fe8d3075'}, {'abstract': 'Whether it’s cost cutting, work responsibilities or the allure of a suddenly quiet city, more Hollywood executives are staying put this holiday season.', 'web_url': 'https://mediadecoder.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/28/holiday-surprise-holllywood-is-at-work/', 'snippet': 'Whether it’s cost cutting, work responsibilities or the allure of a suddenly quiet city, more Hollywood executives are staying put this holiday season.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LOS ANGELES — Gone are those glory days when everyone who was anyone in Hollywood decamped to Aspen or Kahala for the holidays, leaving a few nobodies (and some underpaid journalists) to keep the home fires burning.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Holiday Surprise: Hollywood Is at Work', 'kicker': 'Media Decoder', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Hollywood', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Grazer, Brian', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'ACADEMY OF MOTION PICTURE ARTS AND SCIENCES', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Beverly Hills (Calif)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Los Angeles (Calif)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-28T14:32:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael Cieply', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cieply', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ab421326-0dbb-545f-943c-8f7e864fc10d', 'word_count': 697, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ab421326-0dbb-545f-943c-8f7e864fc10d'}, {'abstract': 'In The New York Times on Wednesday, Stephanie Clifford  reports about the phenomenon of alcohol-induced online shopping.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/28/daily-report-clicking-checkout-while-under-the-influence/', 'snippet': 'In The New York Times on Wednesday, Stephanie Clifford  reports about the phenomenon of alcohol-induced online shopping.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In The New York Times on Wednesday, Stephanie Clifford reports about the phenomenon of alcohol-induced online shopping. Reliable data is scarce, but one comparison-shopping site says that nearly half the people it surveyed in Britain had shopped online after drinking.\xa0 And online retailers suspect that enough shoppers buy online goods in the evening while they are drunk, or even just tipsy, that they are aiming promotions for later hours, hoping to tempt buyers after the bars close.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/11/30/technology/bits-daily-report/bits-daily-report-articleLarge-v4.png', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/11/30/technology/bits-daily-report/bits-daily-report-articleLarge-v4.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/11/30/technology/bits-daily-report/bits-daily-report-jumbo-v6.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/11/30/technology/bits-daily-report/bits-daily-report-superJumbo-v3.png', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail'