w York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Colosseum May Be a Fixer-Upper but It’s Not Collapsing, Italian Officials Say', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Della Valle, Diego', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "Tod's Group", 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Italy', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Rome (Italy)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-28T14:35:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Elisabetta Povoledo', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Elisabetta', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Povoledo', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/90eca9e3-f5cf-591e-9012-725d62570e73', 'word_count': 189, 'uri': 'nyt://article/90eca9e3-f5cf-591e-9012-725d62570e73'}, {'abstract': 'Online shoppers drink and buy, artificial hips fail at a cost to the public, bankrupt restaurant chains keep locations open and others consumer-focused news from The New York Times.', 'web_url': 'https://bucks.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/28/wednesday-reading-life-expectancy-for-new-yorkers-reaches-all-time-high/', 'snippet': 'Online shoppers drink and buy, artificial hips fail at a cost to the public, bankrupt restaurant chains keep locations open and others consumer-focused news from The New York Times.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A variety of consumer-focused articles appears daily in The New York Times and online in our blogs. Each weekday morning, we gather them together here so you can quickly scan the news that could hit you in your wallet.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Wednesday Reading: Life Expectancy for New Yorkers Reaches All-Time High', 'kicker': 'Bucks