esday morning.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Romney on Ayatollahs, and Parenthood', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Romney, Mitt', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-28T17:46:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ashley Parker', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ashley', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Parker', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3426252e-d8f1-57fd-9996-3f2eb033c12d', 'word_count': 519, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3426252e-d8f1-57fd-9996-3f2eb033c12d'}, {'abstract': 'The exercise routines and diets of Janice and Adam Bridges, who have lost about 165 and 110 pounds and struggle daily to keep the weight off.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2011/12/28/magazine/bridges-span.html', 'snippet': 'The exercise routines and diets of Janice and Adam Bridges, who have lost about 165 and 110 pounds and struggle daily to keep the weight off.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The exercise routines and diets of Janice and Adam Bridges, who have lost about 165 and 110 pounds and struggle daily to keep the weight off.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Day With the Bridges', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Obesity', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Diet and Nutrition', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-28T17:49:40+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'Magazine', 'section_name': 'Magazine', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Slideshow', '_id': 'nyt://slideshow/696d0daa-eef9-5fe0-bea3-3211e0f1ef64', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://slideshow/696d0daa-eef9-5fe0-bea3-3211e0f1ef64'}, {'abstract': 'The Jets need a lot of help to make the playoffs, so the writer gave Coach Rex Ryan’s midweek news conference a makeover.', 'web_url': 'https://fifthdown.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/28/one-more-what-if-for-jets-fans/', 'snippet': 'The Jets need a lot of help to make the playoffs, so the writer gave Coach Rex Ryan’s midweek news conference a makeover.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The beleaguered, blustery coach of the Jets takes the podium for his midweek news conference, his team coming off a critical loss and facing depressingly long playoff odds of their own making. He faces down the skeptical news media, a glint of defiance in his eyes, firm resolve in his lower jaw, bear claw and stale coffee on his breath. He did not give the following speech, but the world would be a lot more fun if he had:', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'One More What-if for Jets Fans', 'kicker': 'The Fifth Down', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ryan, Rex', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Jets', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-28T17:52:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mike Tanier', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mike', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Tanier', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b586d704-27f4-57a4-9e1b-d7af2d5be53a', 'word_count': 1133, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b586d704-27f4-57a4-9e1b-d7af2d5be53a'}, {'abstract': 'The celebrated Dutch photo team Inez van Lamsweerde and Vinoodh Matadin release their first comprehensive monograph, published by Taschen.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/28/photographers-without-borders/', 'snippet': 'The celebrated Dutch photo team Inez van Lamsweerde and Vinoodh Matadin release their first comprehensive monograph, published by Taschen.', 'lead_paragraph': 'var data;function jsonSlideshowCallback(response){data = response;}NYTD.options = {source: data,cropType: \'blog480\',appendTo: \'fullScreenSlideShow\',showHeadLine: \'false\', renderstyle: "embeddedSlideShowTmag"}', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Photographers Without Borders', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-12-28T18:00:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Stephen Heyman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Stephen', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Heyman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e6255e11-6905-580d-aaa4-b937b7f500d1', 'word_count': 1128, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e6255e11-6905-580d-aaa4-b937b7f500d1'}, {'abstract': 'The former Mrs. Rudolph W.Giuliani will play a presidential campaign reporter in the revival of the Gore Vidal play, which will also star John Larroquette and Eric McCormack.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/28/donna-hanover-to-make-broadway-debut-in-gore-vidals-the-best-man/', 'snippet': 'The former Mrs. Rudolph W.Giuliani will play a presidential campaign reporter in the revival of the Gore Vidal play, which will also star John Larroquette and Eric McCormack.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As first lady of New York City during much of the 1990s, Donna Hanover – the former Mrs. Rudolph W. Giuliani – surely developed an opinion or two about the ferocity of the City Hall press corps. This spring, in an instance of art imitating life, she’ll have a chance to show what she thinks of the Fourth Estate when she makes her Broadway debut playing a presidential campaign reporter in the revival of “Gore Vidal’s The Best Man,” the producers announced on Wednesday. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Donna Hanover to Make Broadway Debut in ‘Gore Vidal’s The Best Man’', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hanover, Donna', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Larroquette, John', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McCormack, Eric', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Vidal, Gore', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-28T18:06:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Patrick Healy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Patrick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Healy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/18010a72-325c-5425-8050-961bc39cd3aa', 'word_count': 284, 'uri': 'nyt://article/18010a72-325c-5425-8050-961bc39cd3aa'}, {'abstract': 'A preliminary report indicated that the pilot of a plane that crashed last week on a highway in New Jersey requested clearance to climb higher because of icing conditions.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/28/in-i-287-plane-crash-an-abbreviated-climb-then-a-steep-descent/', 'snippet': 'A preliminary report indicated that the pilot of a plane that crashed last week on a highway in New Jersey requested clearance to climb higher because of icing conditions.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Updated 4:36 p.m. | Minutes before a single-engine plane crashed onto Interstate 287 in northern New Jersey last week, its pilot radioed air-traffic control to say that he was in “icing conditions” and requested clearance to climb higher, according to a preliminary report from the National Transportation Safety Board.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Pilot Got Permission to Fly Higher Just Before I-287 Crash', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'AIRLINES AND AIRPLANES', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Aviation Accidents and Safety', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pilots', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Roads and Traffic', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Buckalew, Jeffrey F', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Chawla, Rakesh', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Transportation Safety Board', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Teterboro Airport (NJ)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Jersey', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-28T18:08:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Al Baker and Matthew L. Wald', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Al', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Baker', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Matthew', 'middlename': 'L.', 'lastname': 'Wald', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c9b23ade-6954-585f-864b-a8256aa97637', 'word_count': 452, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c9b23ade-6954-585f-864b-a8256aa97637'}, {'abstract': 'Scientists and a filmmaker weigh in on the evidence for, and against, a substantial role for Arctic methane in gauging climate risk.', 'web_url': 'https://dotearth.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/28/more-views-on-global-warmin-and-arctic-methane/', 'snippet': 'Scientists and a filmmaker weigh in on the evidence for, and against, a substantial role for Arctic methane in gauging climate risk.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In trying to clarify what’s known, unknown and learnable about the possible contribution to global warming from vast methane deposits beneath Arctic seas, I reached out to a host of scientists working on this question. I also received a lot of reader input, as you can see from the comment threads in the string of posts on this important issue. Here’s a roundup of some additional views from the scientific community and one filmmaker focused on question:', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'More Views on Climate Risk and Arctic Methane', 'kicker': 'Dot Earth', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Geology', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Global Warming', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Greenhouse Gas Emissions', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Methane', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'ARCTIC OCEAN', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'ARCTIC REGIONS', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Siberia', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-28T18:13:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew C. Revkin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': 'C.', 'lastname': 'Revkin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt