NCIS” on CBS.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/28/networks-on-cruise-control-with-post-holiday-repeats/', 'snippet': 'And the winning rerun is an epsiode of “NCIS” on CBS.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It was another low-key post-holiday night for television on Tuesday as the broadcast networks filled the schedule with more repeats. CBS was the No. 1 network over all in viewers and tied Univision for the top spot in the 18-to-49-year-old demographic.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Networks on Cruise Control With Post-Holiday Repeats', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'CBS Corporation', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Kennedy, John F, Center for the Performing Arts', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Univision', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-28T21:51:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Adam W. Kepler', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Adam', 'middlename': 'W.', 'lastname': 'Kepler', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9e50e5b5-802d-5e72-8021-9179ab5cb4e5', 'word_count': 118, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9e50e5b5-802d-5e72-8021-9179ab5cb4e5'}, {'abstract': 'Nurses at Montefiore Medical Center say more nurses are needed to alleviate demands placed on them, but the hospital says it faces financial challenges.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/28/montefiore-nurses-may-strike-on-jan-10/', 'snippet': 'Nurses at Montefiore Medical Center say more nurses are needed to alleviate demands placed on them, but the hospital says it faces financial challenges.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In an unexpected move, nurses at Montefiore Medical Center in the Bronx said Wednesday that they would strike on Jan. 10 if they could not resolve issues involving staffing levels and salaries.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Montefiore Nurses May Strike on Jan. 10', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-12-28T21:52:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Anemona Hartocollis', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Anemona', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hartocollis', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e5151340-9048-5037-ba18-74f664b54417', 'word_count': 614, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e5151340-9048-5037-ba18-74f664b54417'}, {'abstract': 'Fox News, MSNBC and CNN plan to cover the one-night Iowa caucus for a stretch of several days, maximizing both their investments in the state and the ratings potential of a Republican presidential campaign.', 'web_url': 'https://mediadecoder.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/28/cable-channels-set-to-begin-election-year-coverage/', 'snippet': 'Fox News, MSNBC and CNN plan to cover the one-night Iowa caucus for a stretch of several days, maximizing both their investments in the state and the ratings potential of a Republican presidential campaign.', 'lead_paragraph': '5:17 p.m. | Updated America’s trifecta of cable news channels, Fox News, MSNBC and CNN, are just about ready to show off their election year staffs.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Cable Channels Set to Begin Election Year Coverage', 'kicker': 'Media Decoder', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'News and News Media', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Primaries and Caucuses', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'CNN', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Current TV', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Fox News Channel', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'MSNBC', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-28T21:53:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Brian Stelter', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Brian', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Stelter', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8dcf8c31-b105-535b-a75e-6138f993a6e4', 'word_count': 723, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8dcf8c31-b105-535b-a75e-6138f993a6e4'}, {'abstract': 'Airplane pilots bring their interest in technology and fuel efficiency down to the ground with electric vehicles.', 'web_url': 'https://wheels.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/28/early-adopter-pilots-drive-volts-and-leafs/', 'snippet': 'Airplane pilots bring their interest in technology and fuel efficiency down to the ground with electric vehicles.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The first person to take delivery of a Chevrolet Volt was Jeff Kaffee, a retired airline pilot. Mr. Kaffee was only first in line. A number of other current or former pilots are owners of either the Volt or the Nissan Leaf.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Early-Adopter Pilots Drive Volts and Leafs', 'kicker': 'Wheels', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Electric and Hybrid Vehicles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pilots', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Williams, Tony