', 'lead_paragraph': 'CLINTON, Iowa — Since landing in Iowa, Mitt Romney has been experiencing the problems of a candidate surging in polls — and they are not bad problems to have.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Romney Enjoys the Growing Crowds in Iowa', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Politics and Government', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'AHMADINEJAD, MAHMOUD', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Romney, Mitt', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schock, Aaron', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iowa', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iran', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Hampshire', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Strait of Hormuz', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-28T23:19:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ashley Parker', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ashley', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Parker', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/60dc6985-ec16-5c55-8b1b-ae0ef27fce09', 'word_count': 658, 'uri': 'nyt://article/60dc6985-ec16-5c55-8b1b-ae0ef27fce09'}, {'abstract': 'As the Merce Cunningham Dance Company wraps up its final tour, the artist Daniel Arsham recalls working with its founder.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/29/arts/dance/daniel-arsham-on-designing-sets-for-merce-cunningham.html', 'snippet': 'As the Merce Cunningham Dance Company wraps up its final tour, the artist Daniel Arsham recalls working with its founder.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Daniel Arsham was barely aware of Merce Cunningham in 2005, when he got a call telling him that he was being considered as the set designer for the next work by Cunningham’s dance company. Mr. Arsham was 25 and just two years out of art school at the Cooper Union. “I knew him from my studies,” he said recently, “but as a passing name.” A few months later Mr. Arsham — who at first didn’t even know the concept of “stage right” — was at work on the set for Cunningham’s 2007 piece “eyeSpace.” ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/29/arts/29arsham/29arsham-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 767, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/29/arts/29arsham/29arsham-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/29/arts/29arsham/29arsham-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Cunningham Fostered Serendipity in Set Design', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Cunningham Fostered Serendipity In Set Design', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cunningham, Merce', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Cunningham, Merce, Dance Co', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Culture (Arts)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dancing', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Design', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-28T23:20:58+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Dance', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ted Loos', 'per