opher Wheeldon in 2012.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/30/arts/dance/in-dance-ratmansky-wheeldon-paul-taylor-and-mark-morris.html', 'snippet': 'Dance lovers can look forward to premieres of works by Mark Morris, Alexei Ratmansky, Paul Taylor and Christopher Wheeldon in 2012.', 'lead_paragraph': 'What choreography in 2012 whets the appetite in advance? It’s dismayingly hard to know. The choreographers Mark Morris, Alexei Ratmansky, Paul Taylor and Christopher Wheeldon will all present premieres in New York. But while Mr. Morris and Mr. Taylor are capable of real greatness, and Mr. Ratmansky and Mr. Wheeldon are the most important choreographers in ballet today, experience has taught us that each can disappoint.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/30/arts/30DANCEyr_SPAN/30DANCEyr_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/12/30/arts/30DANCEyr_SPAN/30DANCEyr_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/30/arts/30DANCEyr_SPAN/30DANCEyr_SPAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/30/arts/30DANCEyr_SPAN/30DANCEyr_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/30/arts/30DANCEyr_SPAN/30DANCEyr_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Tackling Beethoven and the ‘Firebird’', 'kicker': 'Dance | The Year Ahead', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Tackling Beethoven