 Chrysler.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Many judges are lucky to handle just one era-defining case during their tenures on the bench. In his 16 years as a federal bankruptcy judge, Arthur J. Gonzalez has handled three.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Judge Who Reshaped the Corporate Landscape', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bankruptcies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gonzalez, Arthur J', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Chrysler Group LLC', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Enron Corp', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Worldcom Inc', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-29T23:07:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael J. de la Merced', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': 'de la Merced', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ef06ddda-ae64-5605-a4bf-ac57e593efb8', 'word_count': 979, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ef06ddda-ae64-5605-a4bf-ac57e593efb8'}, {'abstract': 'Rick Santorum can make a credible claim of having momentum in Iowa, and would benefit beyond Iowa if other social conservatives drop out, though the deck is mostly stacked against him in a two-man race against Mitt Romney.', 'web_url': 'https://fivethirtyeight.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/29/the-santorum-surge-in-iowa-and-beyond/', 'snippet': 'Rick Santorum can make a credible claim of having momentum in Iowa, and would benefit beyond Iowa if other social conservatives drop out, though the deck is mostly stacked against him in a two-man race against Mitt Romney.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The extent to which Rick Santorum has gained in Iowa polling is not entirely clear. Although two polls have him with 16 percent of the vote, two others that were in the field at the same time have him at 10 and 11 percent, respectively. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Santorum Surge in Iowa and Beyond', 'kicker': 'FiveThirtyEight', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Santorum, Rick', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iowa', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-29T23:10:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nate Silver', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nate', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Silver', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/19af2405-79cc-541d-82a2-959e364d7722', 'word_count': 1023, 'uri': 'nyt://article/19af2405-79cc-541d-82a2-959e364d7722'}, {'abstract': 'The buses are being phased out in favor of something decidedly more vanilla and benign, a “Metro Bus” system with generic boxy white vehicles.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/30/world/americas/in-panama-city-red-devil-buses-yield-to-paler-safer-kind.html', 'snippet': 'The buses are being phased out in favor of something decidedly more vanilla and benign, a “Metro Bus” system with generic boxy white vehicles.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PANAMA — Here comes the Diablo Rojo, the Red Devil bus blasting its air horn and fishtailing around a fellow “demon” just in time to claim Irma Betancourt and other morning commuters. Suffice it to say the Red Devils earn their name.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', '