ssword Puzzles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-30T03:00:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Crosswords & Games', 'byline': {'original': 'By Deb Amlen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Deb', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Amlen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/beab5251-a00b-5a2d-a8d5-ea373f38833a', 'word_count': 230, 'uri': 'nyt://article/beab5251-a00b-5a2d-a8d5-ea373f38833a'}, {'abstract': 'What drives people to collect things? And when does collecting become a problem?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/roomfordebate/2011/12/29/why-we-collect-stuff/', 'snippet': 'What drives people to collect things? And when does collecting become a problem?', 'lead_paragraph': '', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Why We Collect Stuff', 'kicker': 'Room for Debate', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-12-30T03:07:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f9d9e3d1-f6cb-5dda-a9a4-ac9bfb402418', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f9d9e3d1-f6cb-5dda-a9a4-ac9bfb402418'}, {'abstract': 'Iran’s threat to block oil shipping by shutting the Strait of Hormuz is a sign of desperation and a reminder of its recklessness.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/30/opinion/iran-and-the-strait.html', 'snippet': 'Iran’s threat to block oil shipping by shutting the Strait of Hormuz is a sign of desperation and a reminder of its recklessness.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Iran’s threat to shut the Strait of Hormuz — one-fifth of the world’s oil trade passes through there — if the United States and Europe press ahead with new sanctions is unacceptabl