ng “student athletes,” as the N.C.A.A. likes to call them.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '30', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/01/magazine/01football_span/01football_span-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 449, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/01/01/magazine/01football_span/01football_span-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 449}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/01/magazine/01football_span/mag-01Football-t_CA0-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/01/magazine/01football_span/mag-01Football-t_CA0-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/01/magazine/01football_span/mag-01Football-t_CA0-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Let’s Start Paying College Athletes', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Here’s How TO Pay Up Now', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football (College)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Emmert, Mark', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Draft and Recruitment (Sports)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Scholarships and Fellowships', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'College Athletics', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Health Insurance and Managed Care', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'va