ically, potential.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Merce Cunningham Dance Company is ending its 58-year career this week by looking forward as well as back: time present contains time past and time to come. There were to be six performances of a 50-minute Event at the Park Avenue Armory. I wrote this after the two performances on Thursday; there were two more on Friday, and the last two will be on Saturday. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/31/arts/31cunningham-span/31cunningham-span-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 331, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/12/31/arts/31cunningham-span/31cunningham-span-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 331}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/31/arts/31cunningham-span/31cunningham-span-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 612, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/31/arts/31cunningham-span/31cunningham-span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/31/arts/31cunningham-span/31cunningham-span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'For Cunningham Dance Company, Contentment and Finality at Armory', 'kicker': 'Dance Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '50 Years, 50 Minutes, One Creator: A Valediction', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Cunningham, Merce, Dance Co', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Park Avenue Armory (NYC)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'v