iginal': 'By Bruce Japsen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bruce', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Japsen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5bbaedf5-24ca-5c0c-9e19-ce274008fd94', 'word_count': 488, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5bbaedf5-24ca-5c0c-9e19-ce274008fd94'}, {'abstract': 'Jon Banner, who was the top producer of “This Week” when George Stephanopoulos started moderating the program in 2002, is returning to the show.', 'web_url': 'https://mediadecoder.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/30/jon-banner-returns-as-producer-of-abcs-this-week/', 'snippet': 'Jon Banner, who was the top producer of “This Week” when George Stephanopoulos started moderating the program in 2002, is returning to the show.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When George Stephanopoulos returns to ABC’s Sunday morning public affairs program “This Week” in January, one of his former executive producers will be back in his earpiece.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Jon Banner Returns as Producer of ABC’s ‘This Week’', 'kicker': 'Media Decoder', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Stephanopoulos, George', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'ABC News', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-30T18:22:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Brian Stelter', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Brian', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Stelter', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/61168d6b-db1d-5ae9-9d71-e043a559aa7a', 'word_count': 306, 'uri': 'nyt://article/61168