Sundays, pairs big hair with outsize style.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/01/fashion/susanne-bartsch-night-life-impresario-what-i-wore.html', 'snippet': 'The night-life impresario Susanne Bartsch, who oversees a Vandam party at Greenhouse nightclub on Sundays, pairs big hair with outsize style.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Born in Bern, Switzerland, Susanne Bartsch has been a night-life impresario in New York since 1986, founding the Love Ball, which raised $2.5 million to fight AIDS and H.I.V. from 1989 to 1992. She currently oversees a Vandam party at Greenhouse nightclub on Sundays. Ms. Bartsch has a son, Bailey, 17, with David Barton, of David Barton Gyms.  BEE-SHYUAN CHANG', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/01/fashion/01WIW/01WIW-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 682, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/01/fashion/01WIW/01WIW-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/01/fashion/01WIW/01WIW-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Wig to Match Every Look', 'kicker': 'What I wore | Susanne Bartsch', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Wig to Match Every Look', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hair', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'NIGHTCLUBS AND CABARETS', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Leather and Leather Goods', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bartsch, Susanne', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'va