nonproliferation heads nodding with grudging approval as it shows a converted rocket launcher that could never be fired at planes.', 'web_url': 'https://atwar.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/30/in-libya-modified-weapon-becomes-less-of-a-threat/', 'snippet': 'A little video from the Libyan war has a few nonproliferation heads nodding with grudging approval as it shows a converted rocket launcher that could never be fired at planes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'An article in The New York Times last week discussed an American proposal to buy heat-seeking, shoulder-fired anti-aircraft missiles from the many armed groups and people in Libya who are holding them. Even the older variants of these missiles, known in nonproliferation circles as Manpads, are a threat to civilian aviation; the American proposal is intended to take as many of them as possible out of circulation, with hopes of trimming the number available on black markets.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In Libya, Modified Weapon Becomes Less of a Threat', 'kicker': 'At War', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Missiles and Missile Defense Systems', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Libya', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-31T00:03:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By C. J. Chivers', 'person': [{'firstname': 'C.', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': 'Chivers', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b732d0db-b5a9-535a-9f71-a042f92b719a', 'word_count': 971, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b732d0db-b5a9-535a-9f71-a042f92b719a'}, {'abstract': 'An example of how companies can treat stock options and yield a tax benefit.', 'web_url': 'https://economix.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/30/more