rticle/4328cdba-db3a-5545-b9e8-d536cb56ef38', 'word_count': 1265, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4328cdba-db3a-5545-b9e8-d536cb56ef38'}, {'abstract': 'The string of fires came the night after a man was arrested and accused of setting three blazes on Sunset Boulevard.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/12/31/us/19-car-fires-are-set-around-hollywood.html', 'snippet': 'The string of fires came the night after a man was arrested and accused of setting three blazes on Sunset Boulevard.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LOS ANGELES — The first car fire began on Friday shortly after midnight, in the underground parking garage of a West Hollywood apartment building. Three minutes later, the Fire Department received reports of a similar fire just blocks away. Then another, and another.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/31/us/FIRES/FIRES-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 381, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/12/31/us/FIRES/FIRES-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 381}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/31/us/FIRES/FIRES-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 611, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/31/us/FIRES/FIRES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/31/us/FIRES/FIRES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': '19 Car Fires Are Set Around Hollywood', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '19 Car Fires Are Set Around Hollywood', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ARSON', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Los Angeles (Calif)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fires and Firefighters', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Hollywood (Calif)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'West Hollywood (Calif)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-31T02:01:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jennifer Medina', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jennifer', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Medina', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/764dbcf5-3b39-51bd-90e3-30b808f77392', 'word_count': 328, 'uri': 'nyt://article/764dbcf5-3b39-51bd-90e3-30b808f77392'}, {'abstract': 'Polpettina, in the Crestwood section of Eastchester, has fabulous food, including other-worldly meatballs, but the dining experience can be rough around the edges.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/01/nyregion/eastchesters-polpettina-isnt-your-average-pizzeria-review.html', 'snippet': 'Polpettina, in the Crestwood section of Eastchester, has fabulous food, including other-worldly meatballs, but the dining experience can be rough around the edges.', 'lead_paragraph': 'POLPETTINA, a tiny storefront pizzeria with youthful enthusiasm and Brooklynesque charm, has won serious devotees since it opened in the Crestwood section of Eastchester last March. It’s a pizzeria at heart, but what turns heads are the sparkling salads, the way-above-average pasta dishes, a profoundly good roasted chicken half, and trimly tailored desserts.', 'print_section': 'WE', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/01/nyregion/01DINEWE1/01DINEWE1-jumbo.j