unt to New Hampshire.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/31/romney-focuses-on-obama-before-leaving-new-hampshire/', 'snippet': 'Mitt Romney heads back to Iowa for a final pre-caucuses swing after a quick jaunt to New Hampshire.', 'lead_paragraph': ' HAMPTON, N.H. – Holding one last event in New Hampshire before bolting back to Iowa, Mitt Romney drew a few hundred people to the Old Salt restaurant here on the seacoast. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Romney Focuses on Obama Before Leaving New Hampshire', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Primaries and Caucuses', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gregg, Judd', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Romney, Mitt', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Boeing Company', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iowa', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Hampshire', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-31T15:07:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Katharine Q. Seelye', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Katharine', 'middlename': 'Q.', 'lastname': 'Seelye', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/01c33aca-d9d9-599c-88c7-770227ab52d8', 'word_count': 349, 'uri': 'nyt://article/01c33aca-d9d9-599c-88c7-770227ab52d8'}, {'abstract': 'Top track athletes can earn hundreds of thousands of dollars a year, but most athletes struggle to make enough money from sponsorships.