y Soon Confront Uncertainty', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Sanchez, Used to Stability, May Soon Confront Uncertainty', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sanchez, Mark', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Jets', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-31T16:07:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Shpigel', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Shpigel', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a564bb99-fc1b-5b03-8bf3-ea5eb8060f70', 'word_count': 1042, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a564bb99-fc1b-5b03-8bf3-ea5eb8060f70'}, {'abstract': 'As a native Clevelander and a lifelong die-hard fan of the Indians, the Browns and the Cavaliers, what’s left of my heart goes out to the fans of St. Louis.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/01/sports/departure-of-a-star-is-a-test-of-faith.html', 'snippet': 'As a native Clevelander and a lifelong die-hard fan of the Indians, the Browns and the Cavaliers, what’s left of my heart goes out to the fans of St. Louis.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As a native Clevelander and a lifelong die-hard fan of the Indians, the Browns and the Cavaliers, what’s left of my heart goes out to the fans of St. Louis upon their recent loss of Albert Pujols to the merciless scourge of free agency. Small solace though it may seem in the throes of fresh grief, you are not alone.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/01/sports/raap1/raap1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 811, 'wid