why-the-giants-chris-canty-wears-the-big-grille.html', 'snippet': 'Chris Canty’s unusual face mask is not worn to intimidate, although it does; it’s worn to protect against a potentially career-ending injury.', 'lead_paragraph': 'EAST RUTHERFORD, N.J. — When the Giants’ defensive linemen gather for their last meeting before Sunday night’s game against Dallas, their captain, Justin Tuck, will almost surely stand aside for the final invocation. The young superstar Jason Pierre-Paul will probably stay quiet, too, same as Osi Umenyiora, the stalwart opposite Tuck, who has battled injury and hopes to play for the first time in a month.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/01/sports/YGIANTS/YGIANTS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 779, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/01/sports/YGIANTS/YGIANTS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/01/sports/YGIANTS/YGIANTS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Man in the Mask Is a Key Giant', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Man In the Mask Is a Key Giant', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Football League', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Canty, Chris', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Giants', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-31T19:57:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', '