e the best year ever! Seriously! I know, because I’m a person from the future! And here in the future, guess what? It’s 2112 and we’re celebrating the centennial of 2012! That’s how amazing 2012 is going to be!', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/01/sunday-review/01LOOSEENDS/01LOOSEENDS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 938, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/01/sunday-review/01LOOSEENDS/01LOOSEENDS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/01/sunday-review/01LOOSEENDS/01LOOSEENDS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'How Great Was 2012!', 'kicker': 'Loose Ends', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'How Great Was 2012!', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Two Thousand Twelve', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'New Year', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-12-31T22:34:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'subsection_name': 'Sunday Review', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bruce Handy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bruce', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Handy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/2089d183-98d8-50c5-b9c6-5296873774f7', 'word_count': 536, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2089d183-98d8-50c5-b9c6-5296873774f7'}, {'abstract': 'Our refusal to see what we know is true has led to one global disaste